hadiths[396]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4570","Muawiya-bin-Saleh ne Abdur-Rehman bin Juber se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Auf bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Himyar ke aik aadmi ne dushman ke aik aadmi ko qatl kar diya aur uska saazo-saamaan lena chaha to Hazrat Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein mana kar diya aur wo un par ameer they, chunanche Auf bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) (apne Himyari sathi ki himaayat ke liye) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur aapko bataya to aap ne Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : tumhen uske maqtool ka saman usey deney se kya baat rokti hai? unhon-ne jawab diya : Allah ke rasool! maine usey zyada samjha. aap ne farmaya : wo (saman) unke hawale kar do. iske baad Hazrat Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se guzrey to unhon-ne unki chadar kheenchi aur kaha : kya maine pura kar diya jo maine aap ke samney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hawale se kaha tha? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki baat sun li to aapko ghussa aa gaya aur farmaya : Khalid ! usey mat do, Khalid! usey mat do. kya tum mere (muqarrar kiye huey) ameeron ko mere liye chhod saktey ho (ke main islaah karun tum taaney aur kataksh na karo! tumhari aur unki misal us aadmi ki tarah hai jisey oonton ya bakriyon ka charwaha banaya gaya, us ne unhein churaayaa, phir unko pani pilaaney ke waqt ka intizar kya aur unhein hauz par ley gaya, unhon-ne usmein se peenaa shuru kya to unhon-ne iska saaf pani pi liya aur gadla chhod diya to saaf pani tumharey liye hai aur gadlaa unka."
"4571","Safwan bin-Amr ne Abdur-Rehman bin Jubair-bin-Nufair se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Auf bin Malik Ashjai (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Mauta ki jang mein Hazrat Zaid-bin-Haarisa (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath janey walon ke sath rawaana hua, Yaman se madad ke liye aaney wala aik aadmi bhi mera rafeeqe-safar hua. unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki, albatta unhon-ne hadis mein kaha : Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine kaha : Khalid! kya aapko malum nahi tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salb (maqtool ke saazo-saamaan) ka faisla qaatil ke haq mein kya tha? unhon-ne kaha : kyon nahi! lekin maine usey zyada khayal kya."
"4572","Ayas bin Salma ne kaha : mujhey mere walid Hazrat Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Hunain ki jang ladi, us doran mein aik baar ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath subah ka khana kha rahe they ke surkh oont par aik aadmi aaya, usey bithaya, phir us ne apne patkey se chamdey ki aik rassi nikaali aur us se oont ko baandh diya, phir wo logon ke sath khana khaney ke liye aagey badha aur jaaiza leney laga, ham mein kamzori aur hamari sawaariyon mein dublaapan maujood tha, ham mein kuchh paidal bhi they, achcha wo daudta hua nikla, apne oont ke paas aaya, uski rassi kholi, phir usey bithaya, is par Sawar hua aur usey uthaya to wo (oont) usey lekar daud pada. (ye dekh kar) khaakastri rang ki ontni par aik aadmi uske peechhey lag gaya. Hazrat Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main bhi daudta hua nikla, main (peechha karne waley musalman ki) ontni ke pichhley hissey ke paas pahunch gaya, phir main aagey badha yahan tak ke oont ke pichhley hissey ke paas pahunch gaya, phir main aagey badha yahan tak ke maine oont ki nakel pakad li aur usey bitha diya, jab us ne apna ghutna zamin par rakha to maine apni talwaar nikaali aur us shakhs ke sar par waar kya to wo (gardan se) alag ho gaya, phir main oont ko nakel se chalaata hua ley aaya, is par uska paalaan aur (sawar ka ( aslaha bhi tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon samet mera istiqbaal kya aur puchha is aadmi ko kis ne qatl kiya? logon ne kaha : ibne- Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne. aap ne farmaya : uska chheena hua saazo-saaman usi ka hai."
"4573","Hazrat Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ham ne banu-Fazara se jang ladi, Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey sarbaraah they, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hamara ameer banaya tha, jab hamarey aur chashmey ke darmyan aik ghadi ki masafat reh gaee to Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein hukm diya aur raat ke aakhiri hissey mein ham utar padey, phir unhon-ne dhaawa bol diya aur pani par pahunch gaey, maine un logon ki aik qataar si dekhi, usmein auratein aur bachchey they, mujhey khadsha mehsus hua ke wo mujh se pahley pahaad tak pahunch jaeinge, chunanche maine unke aur pahaad ke darmyan aik teer phainka, jab unhon-ne teer dekha to thehar gaey (unhein yaqin ho gaya ke wo teer ka nishana banengey), main unhein haankta hua ley aaya, unmein banu-Fazara ki aik aurat thi, us (ke jism) par rangey huey chamdey ki chadar thi. قَشع chamdey ki bani hui chadar hoti hai. iske sath uski beti thi jo Arab ki Husain tareen ladkiyon mein se thi. maine unhein aagey lagaya yahan tak ke Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas ley aaya, unhon-ne uski beti mujhey inaam mein de di. ham Madina aaey aur maine (abhi tak) uska kapda nahi khola tha ke bazar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se meri mulaqat hui. aap ne farmaya : Salma! wo aurat mujhey hiba kar do. maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! Allah ki qism ! wo mujhey bahut achi lagi hai aur (abhi tak) maine uska kapda bhi nahi khola, phir agley din bazar ( hi ( mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se meri mulaqat hui to aap ne mujh se farmaya : Salma ! wo aurat mujhey hiba kar do, Allah tumharey bap ko barkat de! maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! wo aap ke liye hai. Allah ki qasam! maine uska kapda bhi nahi khola. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey Makka bhej diya aur uske badley musalmanon mein se kuchh logon ko chhuda liya jo Makka mein qaid kiye gaey they."
"4574","Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, phir unhon-ne chand hadisein zikr kin, unmein se ye bhi thi : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum log jis basti mein aao aur is mein qiyam karo (baghair jang ke tumhari tehweel mein aa jaey) to usmein tumharey liye (doosrey musalmanon ki tarah aik) hissa hai aur jis basti ne Allah aur uske rasool ki nafarmani ki (aur tum ne lad kar usey hasil kya) to uska khums Allah aur uske rasool ka hissa hai, phir wo (baqi sab) tumhara hai."
"4575","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed , Muhammad-bin Ibad, abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne hamein hadis bayan ki, alfaz ibne-Abi-Sheba ke hain. Ishaq ne kaha ke hamein khabar di, jabke dusron ne kaha ke hamein hadis bayan ki Sufiyan ne Amr se, unhon-ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Malik bin Aus se aur unhon-ne Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : banu-Nazeer ke amwaal un amwaal mein se they jo Allah ne apne rasool ko (bataur fai) ata kiye jis par musalmanon ne na ghodey daudaaey na oont . to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye khas they. aap ( unmein se) apne ahal w ayaal ke liye aik saal ka kharch letey aur jo bach jata usey Allah ki raah mein (jihad ki) taiyaari ke liye jangi sawaariyon aur aslahey par laga detey."
"4576","Mamar ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"4577","Imam Malik ne Zohri se riwayat ki ke unhein Malik bin Aus ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne meri taraf qaasid bheja , din chadh chuka tha ke main unke paas pahuncha. kaha : maine unko unke ghar main apni charpai par baithey huey paya , unhon-ne apna jism khajoor se baney huey baan ke sath lagaya hua tha aur chamdey ke takiye se tek lagai hui thi, to unhon-ne mujh se kaha : aey maal (Malik) ! tumhari qaum mein se kuchh khandan lapaktey huey aaey they, to maine unke liye thoda sa Atiya dene ka hukm diya hai, usey lo aur unmein taqseem kar do. kaha : maine kaha : agar aap mere siwa kisi aur ko iska hukm de dein (to kaisa rahe?) unhon-ne kaha : aey maal ! tum ley lo. kaha : (itney mein unke Maula) Yarfa unke paas aaey aur kehney lagey : ameerul-momeneen ! kya aapko Usman, Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf, Zuber aur Sad (Raziallahu anhu) (ke sath milney) mein dilchaspi hai? unhon-ne kaha : haan! to usne unko ijazat di. wo andar aa gaey, wo phir aaya aur kehney laga : kya aapko Abbas aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) (ke sath milney) mein dilchaspi hai? unhon-ne kaha : haan. to usne un donon ko bhi ijazat de di. to Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ameerul-momeneen! mere aur us jhootey, gunahgaar, ahad shikan aur khaain ke darmyan faisla kar dein. kaha : is par un logon ne kaha : haan , ameerul-momeneen ! unke darmyan faisla karke unko ( jhagdey ke azab se) raahat dila dein. padhi. Malik bin Aus ne kaha : mera khayal hai ke unhon-ne un logon ko usi gharaz se apne aagey bheja tha. padhi. to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tum donon rukoo, main tumhen us Allah ki qism deta hun jiske hukm se aasman aur zamin qaaim hain! kya tum jantey ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : hamara koi waaris nahi banega, ham jo chhodengey wo sadqa hoga? un sab ne kaha : haan. phir wo Hazrat Abbas aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur kaha : main tum donon ko us Allah ki qism deta hun jiske hukm se aasman aur zamin qaaim hain ! kya tum donon jantey ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : tumhara koi waaris nahi hoga, ham jo kuchh chhodengey, sadqa hoga? un donon ne kaha : haan. to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : bila shubah Allah Taala ne apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik khas cheez ata ki thi jo usney aap ke ilawa kisi ke liye makhsoos nahi ki thi, us ne farmaya hai : jo kuchh bhi Allah ne un bastiyon walon ki taraf se apne rasool par lautaaya wo Allah ka aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hai. mujhey pata nahi ke unhon-ne us se pahley wali aayat bhi padhi ya nahi. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banu-Nazeer ke amwaal tum sab mein taqseem kar diye, Allah ki qasam! aap ne (apni zaat ko) tum par tarjeeh nahi di aur na tumhen chhod kar wo maal liya, yahan tak ke ye maal baqi bach gaya hai, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se apne saal bhar ka kharch letey, phir jo baqi bach jata usey (baitul-maal ke) maal ke mutabiq (aam logon ke faaydey ke liye) istemal kartey. unhon-ne phir kaha : main tumhen us Allah ki qism deta hun jiske hukm se aasman aur zamin qaaim hain ! kya tum ye baat jantey ho? unhon-ne kaha : haan. phir unhon-ne Abbas aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko wahi qism di jo baqi logon ko di thi (aur kaha) : kya tum donon ye baat jantey ho? unhon-ne kaha : ji haan. phir kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey to Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ja-nashin hun to aap donon aaey, aap apne bhatijey ki wiraasat maang rahe they aur ye apni biwi ki unke walid ki taraf se wiraasat maang rahe they. to Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : hamara koi waaris nahi hoga, ham jo chhodengey , sadqa hai. to tum ne unhein jhoota, gunahgaar, ahad shikan aur khaain khayal kya tha aur Allah janta hai wo sachey, neku-kaar, sachchai par chalne waley aur haq ke perokar they. phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) faut huey aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka ja-nashin bana to tum ne mujhey jhoota , gunahgaar , ahad shikan aur khaain khayal kya aur Allah janta hai ke main sachcha, neku-kaar, sachchaai par chalnewala aur haq ki pairwi karne wala hun, main iska muntazim bana, phir tum aur ye mere paas aaey, tum donon ikatthey ho aur tumhara mamla bhi aik hai. tum ne kaha : ye (amwaal) hamarey sipurd kar do. maine kaha : agar tum chaho to main is shart par ye tum donon ke hawale kar deta hun ke tum donon par Allah ke ahad ki paasdaari lazimi hogi, tum bhi usmein wahi karogey jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kartey they, to tum ne is shart par usey ley liya. unhon-ne puchha : kya aisa hi hai? un donon ne jawab diya. haan. unhon-ne kaha : phir tum ( ab ( donon mere paas aaey ho ke main tum donon ke darmyan faisla karun. nahi, Allah ki qism ! main qiyamat ke qaaim honey tak tumharey darmyan iske siwa aur faisla nahi karunga . agar tum iske intizam se aajiz ho to wo maal mujhey wapas kar do."
"4578","Mamar ne hamein Zohri se khabar di, unhon-ne Malik bin Aus bin Hadsan se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne meri taraf paigham bheja aur kaha : tumhari qaum mein se kuchh gharaanon ke log aaey they. Malik ki hadis ki tarah, albatta unhon-ne usmein kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se saal bhar apne ahal w ayaal par kharch kartey aur (hadis bayan kartey huey) kabhi-kabhi Mamar ne kaha : aap us se apne ghar walon ki saal bhar ki kam se kam khuraak alag kar letey, phir jo bachta usey Allah ke maal ( baitul-maal) ke kharch par lagaatey."
"4579","Ummul-Momenin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to aap ki beebiyon ne Hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ko Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas bhejna chaha apna tarka maangney ke liye Rasulullah ke maal se, Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha un se, kya janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nahi farmaya ke hamara koi waaris nahi hota, jo ham chhod jaawen wo sadqa hai."
"4580","Ummul-Momenin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai Hazrat Fatima zohraa (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi ne Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas kisi ko bheja apna tarka maangney ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke un maalon mein se jo Allah Taala ne diye aapko Madina main aur fidak main aur jo kuchh bachta tha khaibar ke khums mein se. Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hamara koi waaris nahi hota aur jo ham chhod jaawen wo sadqa hai aur Hazrat Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aulad usi maal mein se khaaeygi aur main to qism khuda ki Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sadqe ko kuchh bhi nahi badloonga us haal se jaisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane Mubarak mein tha aur main usmein wahi kaam karunga jo janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kartey they. gharazeke Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne inkar kya Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko kuchh dene se aur Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko ghussa aaya unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se mulaqat chhod di aur baat na ki yahan tak ke wafat hui unki ( nauwi ne kaha ye tark mulaqat wo tark nahi jo shara' mein haram hai aur wo ye hai ke mulaqat ke waqt salam na karey ya salam ka jawab na de) aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad sirf chh mahina zinda rahin. ( kuch ne kaha aath (8) mahiney ya nau (9) mahiney ya 2 mahiney ya 70 din) bahar-haal teen taareekh Ramazan Mubarak 11 hijri muqaddas ko unhon-ne intiqal farmaya, jab unka intiqal hua to unke khawind Hazrat Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko raat ko dafn kya aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko khabar na ki (is se malum hua ke raat ko dafn karna bhi jaaiz hai aur din ko afzal hai agar koi uzr na ho (aur Namaz padhi un par Hazrat Ali karamallahu wajhu ne aur jab tak Hazrat Fatima zohraa (Raziallahu anhu) zinda thin tab tak log Hazrat Ali karamallahu wajhu ki taraf maail they (b-wajah Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke) . jab wo intiqal kar gain to Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekha log meri taraf se phir gaey. unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se suleh kar lena chaha aur unse bait kar lena munasib samjha aur abhi tak kai mahiney guzrey they unhon-ne bait nahi ki thi Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se to Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ko bula bheja aur ye kelha bheja ke aap akeley aaiye aap ke sath koi na aaey, kyonke wo Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka aana na-pasand kartey they. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha qism khuda ki tum akeley unke paas na jaogey. Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha wo mere sath kya karengey qism khuda ki main to akela jaaunga . aakhir Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) unke paas gaey aur Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne tashahud padha ( jaisey khutbe ke shuru mein padhtey hain) phir kaha ham ne pehchaana aey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) tumhari fazeelat ko aur jo Allah ne tum ko diya aur ham rashk nahi kartey us nemat par jo Allah ne tum ko di (yani khilafat aur hukumat ( lekin tum ne akeley akeley ye kaam kar liya aur ham samajhtey they ke hamara bhi haq hai is mein kyonke ham qaraabat rakhtey they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. phir barabar Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se baatein kartey rahe yahan tak ke Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ki aankhen bhar aaein . jab Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne guftgu shuru ki to kaha qism uski jiske hath mein meri jaan hai janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qaraabat ka lihaaz mujh ko apni qaraabat se zyada hai aur ye jo mujh main aur tum mein un baton ki baabat (yani fidak aur nazeer aur khums khaibar wghaira) ikhtilaf hua to maine haq ko nahi chhoda aur maine wo koi kaam nahi chhoda jis ko maine dekha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kartey huey balke usko maine kya. Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha achchha aaj seh-pahar ko ham aap se bait karengey. jab Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Zohar ki Namaz se farigh huey to member par chadhey aur tashahud padha aur Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ka qissa bayan kya aur unke der karne ka bait se aur jo uzr unhon-ne bayan kya tha wo bhi kaha phir dua ki maghfirat ki aur Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne tashahud padha aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ki fazeelat bayan ki aur ye kaha ke mera der karna bait mein is wjah se na tha ke mujh ko Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) par shak hai ya unki buzurgi aur fazeelat ka mujhey inkar hai balke ham ye samajhtey they ke is khilafat mein hamara bhi hissa hai aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar ne akeley baghair salaah ke ye kaam kar liya is wjah se hamarey dil ko ye ranj hua. ye sun kar musalman khush huey aur sab ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha tum ne theek kaam kya. us roz se musalman Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf maail ho gaey jab unhon-ne waajibi Amr ko ikhtiyar kya."
"4581","Ummul-Momenin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai Hazrat Fatima zohraa (Raziallahu anhu) aur Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) donon Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey apna hissey maangtey they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke maal mein se aur wo us waqt talab kartey they fidak ki zamin aur khaibar ka hissa Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine suna hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se phir bayan kya hadis ko isi tarah jaisey uper guzri usmein ye hai ke phir Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki badaai bayan ki aur unki fazeelat aur sabqat Islam ka zikr kya phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey aur unse bait ki. us waqt log Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur kehney lagey aap ne theek kya aur achchha kya aur us waqt se log unke tarafdaar ho gaey jab se unhon-ne waajibii baat ko maan liya."
"4582","Ummul-Momenin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se apna hissey maanga Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke tarka se jo Allah Taala ne aapko diya tha. Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to ye farmaya hai hamara koi waaris nahi hota aur jo ham chhod jaawen wo sadqa hai aur Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad sirf chh mahiney tak zinda rahin aur wo apna hissey maangti thin khaibar aur fidak aur Madina ke sadqe mein se. Hazrat Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne na diya aur ye kaha ke main koi kaam jis ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kartey they chhodney wala nahi main darta hun kahin gumrah na ho jaun. phir Madina ka sadqa Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne zamaney mein Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko de diya lekin Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) par ghalba kya (yani apne qabze mein rakha) aur khaibar aur fidak ko Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne qabze mein rakha aur ye kaha ke ye donon sadqa they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jo sirf hotey aap ke huquq aur kaamon mein jo pesh aatey aapko aur ye donon iske ikhtiyar mein rahengey jo Hakim ho musalmanon ka phir aaj tak aisa hi raha (yani khaibar aur fidak hamesha khaleefa waqt ke qabze mein rahe. Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi apni khilafat mein unko taqseem nahi kya."
"4583","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ‌(sl) ne farmaya : merey waaris aik Dinar bhi baant nahi saktey jo chhod jaun apni aurton ke kharch ke baad aur muntazim ki ujrat ke baad bachey to wo sadqa hai."
"4584","tarjama wahi jo uper 4593 main guzra ."
"4585","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ‌(sl) ne farmaya ‌ : hamara koi waaris nahi jo ham chhod jayen wo sadqa hai."
"4586","Saleem bin akhzar ne hamein Ubaidullah-bin-Umar se khabar di, kaha : hamein Naafe ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghaneemat mein se ghodey ke liye 2 hissey aur aadmi ( sawar (ke liye aik hissey nikala."
"4587","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne Ubaidullah se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne ye nahi kaha : ghaneemat mein."
"4588","abu-Zameel Samak Hanfi ne kaha : mujhey Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab badr ka din tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mushrekeen ki taraf dekha, wo aik hazaar they, aur aap ke sath teen so unnees aadmi they, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qibla rukh huey, phir apne hath phailaey aur buland awaz se apne rab ko pukarney lagey : aey Allah ! to ne mujh se jo wada kya usey mere liye pura farma. aey Allah! tu ney jo mujh se wada kya mujhey ata farma. aey Allah! agar ahale- Islam ki ye jamat halaak ho gaee to zamin main teri bandagi nahi hogi. aap qibla ru ho kar apne hathon ko phailaey musalsal apne rab ko pukaartey rahe yahan tak ke aap ki chadar aap ke kandhon se gir gaee. is par Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke paas aaey, chadar uthai aur usey aap ke kandhon par daala, phir peechhey se aap ke sath chimat gaey aur kehney lagey : Allah ke Nabi! apne rab se aap ka maangna aur pukaarna kafi ho gaya. wo jald hi aap se kya hua apna wada pura farmaeyga . is par izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne ye aayat nazil farmai : jab tum log apne rab se madad maang rahe they, to usne tumhari dua qabool ki ke main aik-doosrey ke peechhey utarney waley aik hazaar farishton se tumhari madad karunga. phir Allah ne farishton ke zariey se aap ki madad farmai. abu-Zameel ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha is doran mein, us din musalmanon mein se aik shakhs apne samney bhaagtey huey mushrikon mein se aik aadmi ke peechhey daud raha tha ke achcha usne apne uper se koda maarney aur uske uper se ghud sawar ki awaz suni, jo keh raha tha : Hezom! aagey badh. us ne apne samney mushrik ki taraf dekha to wo chit pada hua tha, us ne is par nazar dali to dekha ke uski naak par nishan pada hua tha, kode ki zarb ki tarah uska chehra phata hua tha aur wo poorey ka pura sabz ho chuka tha, wo Ansari aaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye baat batai to aap ne farmaya : tum ne sach kaha, ye teesrey aasman se (aai hui) madad thi. unhon ( sahaba ( ne us din 70 aadmi qatl kiye aur 70 qaidi banaey . abu-Zameel ne kaha : Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : jab unhon-ne qaidiyon ko giraftaar kar liya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Abu-Bakar aur Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : un qaidiyon ke barey mein tumhari raey kya hai? to Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aey Allah ke Nabi ! ye hamarey chacha zaad aur khandan ke betey hain. meri raey hai ke aap unse fidya ley lein, ye kaafiron ke khilaf hamari quwwat ka baais hoga, ho sakta hai ke Allah unko Islam ki raah par chala de. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha : ibne-khattaab! tumhari kya raey hai? kaha : maine kaha : nahi, Allah ke rasool! Allah ki qism ! meri raey wo nahi jo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki hai, balke meri raey ye hai ke aap hamein ikhtiyar dein aur ham unki gardanein uda dein. aap Aqeel par Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko ikhtiyar dein wo uski gardan uda dein aur mujhey fulaan. padhi. umr ke ham nasb . padhi. par ikhtiyar dein to main uski gardan uda dun. ye log kufr ke peshwa aur badey sardaar hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is baat ko pasand kya jo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kahi thi aur jo maine kaha tha usey pasand na farmaya, jab agla din hua (aur ( mein hazir hua to dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) donon baithey huey hain aur donon ro rahe hain. maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! mujhey bataiye , aap aur aap ka sathi kis cheez par ro rahe hain? agar mujhey rona aaya to main bhi ro-unga aur agar mujhey rona na aaya to bhi main aap donon ke roney ki bina par roney ki koshish karunga. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : main is baat par ro raha hun jo tumharey sathiyon ne unse fidya leney ke barey mein mere samney pesh ki thi, unka azab mujhey us darakht se bhi qareeb tar dikhaya gaya. padhi. wo darakht jo Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb tha. padhi. aur izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne ye aayatein nazil farmai hain : kisi Nabi ke liye (rawaa) na tha ke uske paas qaidi hon, yahan tak ke wo zamin main achi tarah khoon bahaaey. is farman tak. padhi. to tum usmein se khaao jo halal aur pakeeza ghaneematein tum ne hasil ki hain. to is tarah Allah ne unke liye ghaneemat ko halal kar diya."
"4589","Leis ne hamein Saeed bin abi Saeed se hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Najad ki taraf ghud-sawaron ka aik dasta bheja to wo banu-Hanifa ke aik aadmi ko pakad laaey, jisey Samaama-bin-Assaal kaha jata tha, wo ahale-yamaama ka sardaar tha, unhon-ne usey masjid ke sutunon mein se aik sutoon ke sath baandh diya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ghar se) nikal kar uske paas aaey aur puchha : Samama ! tumharey paas kya ( khabar ( hai? us ne jawab diya : aey Muhammad ! mere paas achi baat hai, agar aap qatl karengey to aik aisey shakhs ko qatl karengey jiske khoon ka haq maanga jata hai aur agar ehsan karengey to is par ehsan karengey jo shukr karne wala hai. aur agar maal chahtey hain to talab kijiye , aap jo chahtey hain, aapko diya jaeyga Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey (uske haal par) chhod diya yahan tak ke jab agley se baad ka din ( aainda parson ( hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : Samama ! tumharey paas ( kehney ko) kya hai? us ne jawab diya : ( wahi ( jo maine aap se kaha tha, agar ehsan karengey to aik shukr karne waley par ehsan karengey aur agar qatl karengey to aik khoon waley ko qatl karengey aur agar maal chahtey hain to talab kijiye, aap jo chahtey hain aapko wahi diya jaeyga Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey (usi haal mein) chhod diya yahan tak ke jab agla din hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : Samaama! tumharey paas kya hai? us ne jawab diya : mere paas wahi hai jo maine aap se kaha tha : agar ehsan karengey to aik ehsan shanaas par ehsan karengey aur agar qatl karengey to aik aisey shakhs ko qatl karengey jiska khoon zaaye nahi jata, aur agar maal chahtey hain to talab kijiye, aap jo chahtey hain wahi aapko diya jaeyga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Samama ko aazad kar do. wo masjid ke qareeb khajooron ke aik baagh ki taraf gaya, ghusl kya, phir masjid mein dakhil hua aur kaha : main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske bandey aur rasool hain. aey Muhammad ! Allah ki qism ! poori zamin par aap ke chehrey se badh kar koi chehra nahi tha jis se mujhey bughz ho aur ab aap ke chehrey se badh kar koi chehra nahi jo mujhey zyada mahboob ho. Allah ki qasam! aap ke Deen se badh kar koi Deen mujhey zyada na-pasandida nahi tha, ab aap ka Deen sabse badh kar mahboob Deen ho gaya hai. Allah ki qasam! mujhey aap ke Shahar se badh kar koi Shahar bura nahi lagta tha, ab mujhey aap ke Shahar se badh kar koi aur Shahar mahboob nahi. aap ke ghud-sawaron ne mujhey (us waqt) pakda tha jab main Umra karna chahta tha. ab aap kya ( sahi ( samajhtey hain? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein (eman ki qabooliyat ki) khushkhabri di aur hukm diya ke Umra ada kare. jab wo Makka aaey to kisi kehney waley ne unse kaha : kya be-deen ho gaey ho? to unhon-ne jawab diya : nahi, balke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Islam mein dakhil ho gaya hun, aur Allah ki qasam! yamaama se gehun ka aik daana bhi tumharey paas nahi pahunchega yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski ijazat de dein."
"4590","tarjama wahi hai jo uper guzra . siwaey iske ke usne kaha : ''agar tum mujhey qatl karogey to aik taaqatwar aadmi ko qatl karogey.''"
"4591","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : aik baar ham masjid mein they ke) achcha ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya : yahood ki taraf chalo. ham aap ke sath nikley yahan tak ke unke yahaan pahunch gaey, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey, buland awaz se unhein pukara aur farmaya : aey yahood ki jamat ! Islam qabool kar lo, salamati paogey unhon-ne kaha : aey abul-Qaasim! aap ne paigham pahuncha diya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : main yahi (paigham pahunchaana) chahta hun, Islam qabool kar lo, salamati paogey unhon-ne kaha : aey abul-Qaasim! aap ne paigham pahuncha diya hai. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : main yahi chahta hun. aap ne unse teesri martaba kaha aur farmaya : jaan lo! ye zamin Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hai aur main chahta hun ke tumhen us zamin se jilaa watan kar dun, tum mein se jisey apne maal ke iwaz kuchh miley to wo usey farokht kar de, warna jaan lo ke ye zamin Allah ki aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hai."
"4592","ibne-Juraij ne Musa-bin-Aqba se, unhon-ne Naafe se aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke banu-Nazeer aur Qureza ke yahood ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jang ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banu-Nazeer ko jilaa watan kar diya aur Qureza ko theharney diya aur un par ehsan kya, yahan tak ke iske (eik-dedh saal) baad Qureza ne ( jange-Ehzaab mein dushman ka sath diya aur) jang ki to aap ne (unke chuney huey saalis Hazrat Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ke faisley par) unke ( jangju ( mardon ko qatl kar diya aur unki auratein , bachchey aur amwaal musalmanon mein taqseem kar diye, albatta unmein se kuchh log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath waabasta ho gaey to aap ne unhein aman ata ki aur wo musalman ho gaey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( khud apne faisley ki ru se) Madina ke tamam yahood ko jilaa watan kya : bani qainuqaa ko , ye Hazrat Abdullaah-bin-Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) ki qaum thi, banu-Haarisa ke yahood ko aur har Yahudi ko jo Madina mein tha."
"4593","Hafs-bin-Maisra ne Musa se ye hadis isi sanad ke sath bayan ki aur ibne-Juraij ki hadis zyada lambi aur zyada mukammal hai."
"4594","ibne-Juraij ne hamein khabar di, kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : mujhey Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : main yahood w nasara ko har sura jazeera Arab se nikal doonga yahan tak ke main musalmanon ke siwa kisi aur ko nahi rehney doonga ."
"4595","Sufiyan Sory aur Maaqil bin Ubaidullah donon ne abu-Zubair se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4596","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur ibne-Bashar ne. padhi. un sab ke alfaz qareeb-qareeb hain. padhi. hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. Abu-Bakar ne kaha : hamein ghandar ne Shoba se hadis bayan ki aur doosrey donon ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ( ghandar ( ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki. padhi. unhon-ne Sad bin Ibrahim se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine abu-Umama bin Sahal-bin-Haneef (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : Qureza ke yahood Hazrat Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ke faisley (ko qabool karne ki shart ( par) qile se) utar aaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf paigham bheja , wo gadhey par Sawar ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey, jab wo masjid ke qareeb pahunchey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar se farmaya : apne sardaar . padhi. ya ( farmaya : ( apne behtreen aadmi . padhi. ke) istiqbaal ke) liye utho . phir farmaya : ye log tumharey faisley (ki shart ( par) qiley se) utrey hain. unhon-ne kaha : unke jangju afraad ko qatl kar diya jaey aur (unki aurton aur) unke bachchon ko qaidi bana liya jaey. kaha : to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne Allah ke faisley ke mutabiq faisla kya hai. aur kabhi-kabhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne ( asl ( badshah ke faisley ke mutabiq faisla kya hai. ibne- Musanna ne ye bayan nahi kya : aur kabhi-kabhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne badshah ke faisley ke mutabiq faisla kya hai."
"4597","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne apni hadis mein kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne unke barey mein Allah ke hukm ke mutabiq faisla kya hai. aur aik baar farmaya : tum ne ( haqiqi ( badshah ( Allah (ke faisley ke mutabiq faisla kya hai."
"4598","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : khandaq ke din Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) zakhmi ho gaey, unhein Quraish ke aik aadmi ne, jisey ibne-Arqa kaha jata tha, teer maara. usne unhein bazu ki badi rag mein teer maara . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye masjid mein khema lagwaaya, aap qareeb se unki teemaardaari karna chahtey they. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khandaq se wapas huey, aslaha utara aur ghusl kya to (eik insan ki shakl mein) Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aaey, wo apne sar se gardo-ghubaar jhaad rahe they, unhon-ne kaha : aap ne aslaha utaar diya hai? Allah ki qism ! ham ne nahi utara , unki taraf nikaliyie , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : kahan ? unhon-ne banu-Quraiza ki taraf ishara kya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse jang ki, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke faisley par utar aaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke barey mein faisla Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ke sipurd kar diya, unhon-ne kaha : main unke barey mein faisla karta hun ke jangju afraad ko qatl kar diya jaey aur ye ke bachchon aur aurton ko qaidi bana liya jaey aur unke amwaal taqseem kar diye jaaein."
"4599","Urwa ne kaha : mujhey bataya gaya hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne unke barey mein izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ke faisley ke mutabiq faisla kya hai."
"4600","ibne-Numair ne Hisham se hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey mere walid ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se khabar di ke Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne, jab unka zakhm bhar raha tha, (to dua kartey huey) kaha : aey Allah ! to janta hai ke mujhey terey rastey mein, us qaum ke khilaf jihad se badh kar kisi ke khilaf jihad karna mahboob nahi jinhoney terey rasool ko jhutlaaya aur nikala. agar Quraish ki jang ka koi hissey baqi hai to mujhey zinda rakh taake main terey rastey mein unse jihad karun. aey Allah! mera khayal hai ke tu ney hamarey aur unke darmyan ladai khatm kar di hai. agar tu ney hamarey aur unke darmyan ladai waqei khatm kar di hai to us ( zakhm ( ko phaad de aur mujhey usi mein maut ata farma, chunanche unki hansli se khoon bahney laga, logon ko . padhi. aur masjid mein unke sath banu- ghifaar ka khema tha. padhi. us khoon ne hi khaufzada kya jo unki taraf bah raha tha. unhon-ne puchha : aey khemey waalo! ye kya hai jo tumhari taraf se hamari taraf aa raha hai? to wo Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ka zakhm tha jis se musalsal khoon bah raha hai, chunanche wo usi ( kaifiyat ( mein faut ho gaey."
"4601","Abda ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki, albatta unhon-ne kaha : usi raat se khoon bahney laga aur musalsal bahtaa raha yahan tak ke wo wafat pa gaey aur unhon-ne hadis mein ye izafa kiya, kaha : yahi waqt hai jab (eik kaafir ( shaair kehta hai : aey Sad ! banu-Muaz ke (gharaaney ke) Sad ! wo kya tha jo banu-Quraiza ne kiya aur (wo kya tha jo ( banu-Nazeer ne kiya? tumhari zindagi ki qism ! banu-Muaz ka Sad , jis subah un logon ne saza bardasht ki, khub sabr karne wala tha. tum ( Aus ke) logon ne apni haddiyaan is tarah chhodein ke unmein kuchh baqi na bacha tha jabke qaum ( banu-khazraj ( ki haandiyaan garm thin, ubal rahi thin ( unhon-ne apne haleef (saathi) banu-nazeer ka sath diya tha.) aik Karim insan abu-Hubaab (munafiqon ke sardar Abdullah-bin-Ubai-ibne-Salool) ne kaha tha : ( bano ( qainuqaa' ! muqeem raho, mat jao . wo log apne Shahar mein bahut wazan rakhtey they ( baa-waqa't they) jis tarah meetaan pahaad ki chattaanein bahut wazan rakhti hain."
"4602","Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne, jis roz aap jange-ehzaab se lautey ham mein manaadi karaai ke koi shakhs banu-Quraiza ke siwa kahin aur namaze Zohar ada na kare. kuchh logon ko waqt nikal janey ka khof mehsus hua to unhon-ne banu-Quraiza (pahunchne) se pahley hi Namaz padh li. jabke dusron ne kaha : chahey waqt khatm ho jaey ham wahin Namaz padhengey jahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Namaz padhney ka hukm diya hai. kaha : to aap ne fareeqain (dono pakshon) mein se kisi ko bhi malaamat na ki."
"4603","ibne-Shahab ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab muhajireen Makka se Madina aaey to us haalat mein aaey ke unke paas kuchh bhi na tha, jabke Ansar zamin aur jaaydaadon waley they. to Ansar ne unke sath is tarah hisse daari ki ke wo unhein har saal apne amwaal ki paidawar ka aadha hissey dengey aur ye (muhajireen) unhein mehnat aur mashaqqat se be-niyaaz kar dengey. Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida , jo Umme-Sulaim kehlaati thin aur Abdullah-bin-Ubai Talha (Raziallahu anhu) jo Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ke maadri bhai they, ki bhi walida thin. Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki) unhi ( walida ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khajoor ke apne kuchh darakht diye they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo apni aazad karda kaneez, Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida , umme-aiman (Raziallahu anhu) ko inayat kar diye they. ibne-Shahab ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ahale khaibar ke khilaf jang se farigh huey aur Madina wapas aaey to muhajireen ne Ansar ko unke wo atiye wapas kar diye jo unhon-ne unhein apne phalon ( kheton, baaghon ( mein se diye they. kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri walida ko unke khajoor ke darakht wapas kar diye aur umme-aiman (Raziallahu anhu) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki jagah apne baagh mein se (eik hissey ( ata farma diya. ibne-Shahab ne kaha : Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida umme-aiman (Raziallahu anhu) ke halaat ye hain ke wo (Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke walid giraami) Abdullah-bin-abdul-Muttalib ki kaneez thin. aur wo Habsha se thin, apne walid ki wafat ke baad jab Hazrat aamna ke yahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wilaadat baa-khush-naseebi hui to umme-aiman (Raziallahu anhu) aapko god mein uthatin aur aap ki parwarish mein Sharik rahien yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badey ho gaey to aap ne unhein aazad kar diya, phir Zaid-bin-Haarisa (Raziallahu anhu) se unka nikah kara diya, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat se panch maah baad faut ho gain."
"4604","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , haamid-bin-Umar-bakraawi aur Muhammad-bin-Abdul-Aala Qaisi , sab ne Moatamir se hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz ibne-Abi-Sheba ke hain. hamein Moatamir-bin-Sulaiman Taimi ne apne walid ke waastey se Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke koi aadmi. padhi. jabke haamid aur Abdul-Aala ne kaha : koi makhsoos aadmi. padhi. apni zamin se khajooron ke kuchh darakht ( fuqaraaey muhajireen ki khabar-geeri ke liye) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye khas kar deta tha. yahan tak ke Qureza aur banu-Nazeer aap ke liye fateh ho gaey to iske baad jo kisi ne aapko diya tha, wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey wapas karna shuru kar diya. Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : mere ghar walon ne mujh se kaha ke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hun aur aap se wo sab ya uska kuchh hissey maangon, jo unke ghar walon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko diya tha. aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo umme-aiman (Raziallahu anhu) ko de diya tha. main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya to aap ne wo sab ka sab mujhey de diya. is par umme-aiman (Raziallahu anhu) aaein, mere galley mein kapda daala aur kehney lagein : Allah ki qism ! ham wo (darakht) tumhen nahi dengey , jabke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wo hamein de chukey hain. to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : umme-aiman ! usey chhod do, itna-itna tumhara hua. wo kehti thin : hargiz nahi, us zaat ki qism jiske siwa koi haqiqi maabood nahi ! aur aap isi tarah farmatey rahe yahan tak ke aap ne usey das guna ya taqriban das guna ata farma diya."
"4605","hamein Sulaiman-bin-Mugheera ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Humaid-bin-Hilal ne Abdullah-bin-mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : khaibar ke din mujhey charbi ka ( bharaa hua) chamdey ka aik thailaa mila. kaha : maine usey apne sath chimtaa liya aur kaha : aaj ke din mein usmein se kisi ko kuchh nahi doonga. kaha : maine mud kar dekha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa rahe they."
"4606","Bahaz-bin-Asad ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis sunai, kaha : mujhey Humaid-bin-Hilal ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abdullah-bin-mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye bataatey huey suna : khaibar ke din hamari taraf chamdey ka aik thailaa phainkaa gaya jis mein khana aur charbi thi, mein usey pakadney ke liye jhaptaa. kaha : maine mud kar dekha to (peechhey) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maujood they. to mujhey aap se bahut haya aai. Abu-Dawud ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, albatta unhon-ne charbi ka  bharaa hua) thailaa kaha, khaney ka zikr nahi kiya."
"4607","Mamar ne hamein Zohri se khabar di, unhon-ne Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein roo-baroo bataya , kaha : ( muaahida suleh ki) us muddat ke doran mein jo mere aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darmyan thi, main safar par gaya. kaha : is beech mein, jab main Sham (Syria) mein tha, hiraqal yani Rome ke badshah ke paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se aik khat laya gaya. kaha : usey Dahiya Kalbi (Raziallahu anhu) lekar aaey aur hakime Busraa ke hawale kiya, Busra ke Hakim ne wo Hiraql tak pahuncha diya to Hiraql ne kaha : kya us shakhs ki qaum mein se, jo dawa karta hai ke wo Nabi hai, koi shakhs yahan maujood hai? unhon-ne kaha : haan. kaha : to Quraish ke kuchh afraad samet mujhey bulaya gaya. ham Hiraql ke paas aaey to usne hamein apne samney bithaya aur puchha : tum mein se nasb mein us aadmi ke sabse zyada qareeb kon hai jo dawa karta hai ke wo Nabi hai? Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine jawab diya : main hun. to un logon ne mujhey unke samney bitha diya aur mere sathiyon ko mere peechhey bitha diya. phir us ne apne tarjuman ko bulaya aur us se kaha : unse keh do : main is aadmi se us shakhs ke barey mein poochhney laga hun jo dawa karta hai ke wo Nabi hai. agar ye mere samney jhoot boley to tum log uska inkar kar dena. kaha : Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! agar ye dar na hota ke meri taraf jhoot ki nisbat ki jaeygi to main jhoot boltaa. phir us ne apne tarjuman se kaha is se poochho : tum mein uska hasab ( khandan ( kaisa hai? kaha : maine jawab diya : wo ham mein hasab wala hai. us ne puchha : kya uske baap-dada aur ijdaad mein se koi badshah bhi tha? maine jawab diya : nahi. us ne puchha : kya usne ( nabwooat ke hawale se) jo kaha, uske kehney se pahley tum is par jhoot bolney ka ilzam lagaatey they? maine jawab diya : nahi. us ne puchha : iske perokar kon log hain? badey log hain ya kamzor log hain? maine jawab diya : balke kamzor log hain. us ne puchha : kya wo badh rahe hain ya kam ho rahe hain? kaha : maine jawab diya : nahi, balke wo badh rahe hain. us ne puchha : kya unmein se koi uske Deen mein dakhil honey ke baad usey na-pasand kartey huey murtad bhi hota hai? maine jawab diya : nahi. us ne puchha : kya tum ne us se jang bhi ki hai? maine jawab diya : haan. us ne puchha : to tumhari us se jang kaisi rahi ? maine jawab diya : hamarey aur uske darmyan jang kuwein ke dol ki tarah hai, wo hamein nuqsan pahunchata hai aur ham usey nuqsan pahunchaatey hain. us ne puchha : kya wo bad-ahdi karta hai? maine jawab diya : nahi, ham uski taraf se (ki gai) suleh ke zamaney mein hain, hamein malum nahi, wo usmein kya karega? kaha : Allah ki qism ! us aik kalimey ke siwa usmein koi aur baat milana mere liye mumkin na hua. us ne puchha : kya us se pahley kisi ne wo baat kahi hai? maine jawab diya : nahi. us ne apne tarjuman se kaha : unse kaho : maine tum se uske hasab ke barey mein puchha to tum ne kaha ke wo tum mein (oonchey) hasab wala hai. rasool isi tarah hotey hain, apni qaum ke aalaa khandanon mein bhejey jatey hain. aur maine puchha : kya iske baap-dada aur ijdaad mein koi badshah tha? to tum ne dawa kiya : nahi, maine (dil mein) kaha : agar iske baap-dada aur ijdaad mein koi badshah hota to main kehta : wo aadmi apne baap-dada ki badhshahat hasil karna chahta hai aur maine tum se iske pairokaaron ke barey mein puchha : wo kamzor log hain ya ashraaf hain? to tum ne kaha : balke wo kamzor log hain, rasulon ke perokar wahi log hotey hain. aur maine tum se puchha ke jo wo kehta hai us se pahley tum is par jhoot ka ilzam lagaatey they, to tum ne kaha : nahi, is tarah mein jaan gaya ke ye mumkin nahi ke wo logon par to jhoot na boley magar Allah par jhoot baandhney lagey aur maine tum se puchha : kya iske Deen mein dakhil honey ke baad koi us se naraz ho kar uske Deen se nikla hai? to tum ne kaha : nahi, eman jab dilon mein rach bas jata hai to isi tarah hota hai. aur maine tum se puchha : kya wo badh rahe hain ya kam ho rahe hain? to tum ne kaha ke wo badh rahe hain, eman aisa hi hota hai yahan tak ke wo mukammal ho jata hai. aur maine tum se puchha : kya tum ne us se ladai ki? to tum ne kaha ke) haan ( tum ne us se ladai ki hai aur tumharey aur uske darmyan jang dol ki tarah hai, wo tum mein se logon ko qatl karta hai aur tum uske logon mein se qatl kartey ho, rasool isi tarah hotey hain, unhein aazmaya jata hai, phir anjam unhi ke haq mein hota hai. aur maine tum se puchha : kya wo ahad shikani karta hai? to tum ne kaha ke wo ahad shikani nahi karta aur rasool isi tarah hotey hain, wo bad-ahdi nahi kartey aur maine tum se puchha : kya us se pahley kisi ne ye baat kahi (ke wo Allah ka rasool hai?) to tum ne kaha : nahi, maine (dil mein) kaha : agar kisi ne us se pahley ye baat kahi hoti to main kehta : ye aadmi wahi baat kehna chahta hai jo us se pahley kahi ja chuki hai. kaha : phir us ne puchha : wo tumhen kis cheez ka hukm deta hai? maine jawab diya : wo hamein Namaz , zakat , sila rehmi aur paakbaazi ka hukm deta hai. usne kaha : agar tum jo uske barey mein kehtey ho, sach hai, to bila shubah wo Nabi hai aur main janta tha ke uska zuhoor (zahir) honey wala hai lekin main ye nahi samajhta tha ke wo tum mein se hoga, aur agar mujhey ilm ho jaey ke main un tak pahunch sakta hun to main unse milney ko mahboob rakhoon aur agar main unke paas hota to main unke paon dhota aur unki hukumat is zamin tak pahunch kar rahegi jo mere qadmon ke nichey hai. kaha : phir us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khat mangwaya aur usey padha to usmein ( likha ( tha : Allah ke naam se jo bahut zyada raham karne waalaa, hamesha meherbani karne wala hai, Allah ke rasool Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se Rome ke badshah Hiraql ke naam , is par salamati ho jisne hidayat ki ittaba (pairvi) ki, iske ba'd, main tumhen Islam ke bulaawey ke sath dawat deta hun, Islam qabool kar lo, salamati pa logey , Islam qabool kar lo, Allah tumhen do baar ajr dega aur agar tum ne munh mod liya to aam logon ka gunah (jo tumharey peechhey chaltey hain) tum par hoga aur aey ahle-kitab ! is baat ki taraf aao jo hamarey aur tumharey darmyan aik jaisi hai ke ham Allah ke siwa kisi ki ibadat na karein, uske sath kisi cheez ko Sharik na karein, ham mein se koi kisi ko Allah ke siwa rab na banaey , phir agar wo munh mod lein to keh dein, (tum ( gawah raho ke ham farman bardaar (Islam qabool karne waale) hain. jab wo khat padhney se farigh hua to uske paas aawaazein buland honey lagein aur shor badh gaya, us ne hamarey barey mein hukm diya to hamein bahar bhej diya gaya. kaha : jab ham bahar nikley to maine apne sathiyon se kaha : abu-Kabsha ke betey ka mamla to bahut bada ho gaya hai, is se to banu-asfar ( ahale Rome (mojooda Itly) (ka badshah bhi khof khata hai. kaha : iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mamley mein mujhey hamesha yaqin raha ke wo ghalib aaeingey , yahan tak ke Allah ne mujh mein uper se ( ghalib karke ( Islam dakhil kar diya."
"4608","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur hadis mein ye izafa kiya : jab Allah ne qaisar (ke sar par se) Faaris ke lashkaron ko hata diya to wo us nemat ka shukr ada karne ke liye, jo Allah ne is par ki thi, paidal chal kar teiswin se iliyaa gaya, aur unhon-ne hadis mein) yun ( kaha : Allah ke bandey aur uske rasool Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se. aur unhon-ne (''اریسین'' areeseen ke bajaey ya ke saath) ''یریسین'' aur Islam ki taraf bulaney waley kalimey ke sath ( daawat deta hun (ke alfaz kahey ."
"4609","Abdul-Aala ne hamein Saeed (bin-abi-Aruba ( se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Qatada se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Kisraa , qaisar , Najashi aur har mutakabbir badshah ko Allah Taala ki taraf bulatey huey khutoot likh bhejey , aur us se wo Najashi murad nahi jiski Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaaze-janaaza padhai. (uske baad waley Najashi ki taraf khat likha.)"
"4610","abdul-wahaab-bin-Ata ne Saeed se, unhon-ne Qatada se riwayat ki, kaha : hamein Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki, aur unhon-ne ye nahi kaha : aur ye Najashi wo nahi tha jiski Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaaze-janaaza padhai thi."
"4611","Khalid-bin-Qais ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki aur unhon-ne bhi ye zikr nahi kiya : ye Najashi wo nahi tha jiski Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaaze-janaaza padhai thi."
"4612","Yunus ne mujhey ibne-Shahab se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey kaseer-bin-Abbas-bin-abdul-Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Hunain ke din main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maujood tha, main aur Abu-Sufiyan-bin-Haaris-bin-abdul-Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath rahe, aap se juda na huey, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne safaid khachchar par) sawar ( they jo farwa-bin-nufasa juzaami ne aapko tohfey mein diya tha. jab musalmanon aur kuffaar ka aamna saamna hua to musalman peeth pher kar bhaagey, ( magar ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne khachchar ko eirh laga kar, kuffaar ki taraf badhney lagey. Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khachchar ki lagaam thaamey huey tha. main chahta tha ke wo tezi se ( aagey ( na badhey aur Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rikaab ko pakda hua tha. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Abbas ! keekar ke darakht (ke nichey bait karne) walon ko awaz do. Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : . padhi. aur wo buland awaz waley they. maine apni buland tareen awaz se pukar kar kaha : keekar ke darakht waley kahan hain? kaha : Allah ki qism ! meri awaz sun kar unka palatna is tarah tha jaisey gaaey apne bachchon ki) awaz sun kar unki ( taraf palat'ti hai. aur wo ( jawab mein) kehney lagey : hazir hain ! hazir hain ! kaha : to wo kuffaar se bhid gaey, phir Ansar mein bulaawaa diya gaya ( bulaawaa dene waale) kehtey they : aey Ansar ki jamat ! aey Ansar ki jamat ! phir us nidaa ko bani-Haaris-bin-khazraj tak mehdud kar diya gaya aur unhon-ne kaha : aey banu-Haaris-bin-khazraj ! aey banu-Haaris-bin-khazraj ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne khachchar par baithey huey, gardan ko aagey karke dekhney waley ki tarah , unki ladai ka jaaiza liya, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye ghadi hai ke) ladai ka ( tannoor garm hua hai. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kankariyaan pakdein aur unhein kaafiron ke chehron par maara, phir farmaya : Muhammad ke parwardigar ki qism ! wo shikast kha gaey. kaha : main dekhney laga to mere khayal ke mutabiq ladai isi tarah jari thi. kaha : Allah ki qism ! phir yahi hua ke jun-hi aap ne unki taraf kankariyaan phenki to main dekh raha tha ke unki dhaar kund ho gaee hai aur unka mamla peechhey janey ka hai."
"4613","Mamar ne hamein Zohri se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah khabar di, albatta unhon-ne farwa-bin (nufasa ki jagah) Naama juzaami (sahi nufasa hi hai) kaha aur kaha : Kaba ke rab ki qism ! wo shikast kha gaey. Kaba ke rab ki qism ! wo shikast kha gaey aur unhon-ne hadis mein ye izafa kiya : yahan tak ke Allah ne unhein shikast de di. kaha : aisey lagta hai ke main ( ab bhi) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun ke aap unke peechhey apne khachchar ko eirh laga rahe hain."
"4614","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein Zohri se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey kaseer-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : Hunain ke din main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maujood tha. padhi. aur) aagey baqi bachi ( hadis bayan ki, albatta Yunus aur Mamar ki hadis un ( Sufiyan ( ki hadis se zyada lambi aur zyada mukammal hai."
"4615","abu-Khaisma ne hamein Abu-Ishaq se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : aik aadmi ne Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : abu-Amaara ! kya aap log Hunain ke din bhaagey they? unhon-ne kaha : nahi, Allah ki qism ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukh tak nahi phera , albatta aap ke sathiyon mein se chand naujawaan aur jald baaz ( jang ke liye) nihattey nikley they jin (ke jism ( par aslaha ya bada aslaha nahi tha, to unki mudbhed aisi teer andaz qaum se hui jinka koi teer ( zamin ( par na girtaa tha, ( nishaaney par lagta tha) wo banu-Hawazin aur banu-nazar ke jatthey they. unhon-ne un ( naujawaanon ( ko is tarah se teeron se chhednaa shuru kiya ke koi nishana khata na jata tha. phir wo log wahan se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf badhey , aap apne safaid khachchar par they aur Abu-Sufiyan-bin-Haaris-bin-abdul-Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) usey chala rahe they, aap nichey utrey ( Allah se) madad mangi aur farmaya : main Nabi hun, ye jhoot nahi mein abdul-Muttalib ka betaa hun. phir aap ne ( naey sirey se) unki saf bandi ki. (aur paansa palat gaya.)"
"4616","Zakariya ne Abu-Ishaq se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : aik aadmi Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur puchha : abu-Amaara ! kya aap log Hunain ke din peeth pher gaey they? to unhon-ne kaha : main Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke barey mein gawahi deta hun ke aap ne rukh tak nahi phera, kuchh jald baaz log aur nihattey Hawazin ke us qabeeley ki taraf badhey , wo teer-andaz log they, unhon-ne un ( naujawaanon ( par is tarah yakbaargi ikatthey teer phainkey jaisey wo tiddi dal hon. is par wo bikhar gaey, aur wo ( Hawazin ke) log Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf badhey , Abu-Sufiyan (bin-Haaris ( (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke khachchar ko pakad kar chala rahe they, to aap nichey utrey , dua ki aur) Allah se) madad mangi , aap farma rahe they : main Nabi hun, ye jhoot nahi, mein abdul-Muttalib ka betaa hun. aey Allah ! apni madad nazil farmaa. Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! jab ladai shiddat ikhtiyar kar jati to ham aap ki ot letey they aur ham mein se bahaadur wo hota jo aap ke  yani Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath qadam mila kar khada hota."
"4617","Shoba ne hamein Abu-Is'haq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine (us waqt) Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se suna jab ( qabila ( Qais ke aik aadmi ne unse puchha : kya aap log Hunain ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko chhod kar bhaagey they? to Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nahi bhaagey they, us zamaney mein Hawazin ke log ( maahir ( teer andaz they, jab ham ne un par hamla kiya to wo bikhar gaey, phir ham ghaneematon ki taraf mutwajjeh ho gaey to wo teeron ke sath hamarey samney aa gaey. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne safaid khachchar par dekha, Abu-Sufiyan-bin-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) uski baag thaamey huey they aur aap farma rahe they : main Nabi hun, ye jhoot nahi,main abdul-Muttalib ka betaa hun."
"4618","Sufiyan se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Abu-Ishaq ne Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : aik aadmi ne unse puchha : abu-Amaara ! . padhi. aur) aagey ( hadis bayan ki, unki hadis un sab ( abu-Khaisma , Zakariya aur Shoba ( ki hadis se ( tafseelaat mein) kam hai aur un sab ki hadis zyada mukammal hai."
"4619","Hazrat Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Hunain ki jang ladi, jab hamara dushman se samna hua to main aagey badha phir main aik ghaati par chadh jata hun, mere samney dushman ka aadmi aaya to main is par teer phainktaa hun, wo mujh se chhup gaya. iske baad mujhey malum nahi us ne kya kiya? maine (un ( logon ka jaaiza liya to dekha wo aik dusri ghaati ki taraf zahir huey, unka aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathiyon ka takraao hua to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathi peechhey hat gaey aur main bhi shikast khay hue laut'taa hun. mujh (mere jism) par do chaadrein thin, unmein se aik ka maine tehband baandha hua tha aur dusri ko odh rakha tha to mera tehband khul gaya. maine un donon ko ikattha kiya aur shikast khai hui haalat mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se guzra , aap apne safaid khachchar par they. (mujhey dekh kar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Akwaa ka betaa ghabraa ke lot aaya hai. jab wo har taraf se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par hamla aawar huey to aap khachchar se nichey utrey. zamin se mitti ki aik muththi li, phir usey samney ki taraf se unke chehron par phainkaa aur farmaya : chehrey bigad gaey. Allah ne unmein se kisi insan ko paida nahi kiya tha magar us aik muththii se unki aankhen bhar dein, so wo peeth pher kar bhag nikley, Allah ne usi (eik muththi khaak ( se unhein shikast di aur) baad iske ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke amwaale ghaneemat musalmanon mein taqseem kiye."
"4620","Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ahale Taaif ka muhaasra kiya aur unmein se kisi ki jaan na ley sakey to aap ne farmaya : inshaAllah ham kal lot jaengey. aap ke sahaba ne kaha : ham lot jayen jabke ham ne isey fateh nahi kiya? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : subah jang ke liye niklo . wo subah nikley to unhein zakhm lagey. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : ham kal wapas lot jaengey. kaha : to unhein ye baat achi lagi , is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans padey ."
"4621","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab Abu-Sufiyan ki aamad ki khabar mili to aap ne mashwara kiya, kaha : Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne guftgu ki to aap ne unse ea'raaz farmaya, phir Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne guftgu ki to aap ne unse ea'raaz farmaya, is par Hazrat Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur kehney lagey : aey Allah ke rasool! kya aap ham se ( mashwara karna ( chahtey hain? us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! agar aap hamein (apne ghodey ( samandar mein daal dene ka hukm dein to ham unhein daal dengey aur agar aap ham ko unhein zamin ke aakhiri koney tak daudaaney ka hukm dein to ham yahi karengey. kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko bulaya , aur wo chal padey yahan tak ke badr mein padao dala. unke paas Quraish ke pani laney waley oont aaey, unmein banu-Hujjaj ka aik siyah faam ghulam bhi tha to unhon-ne usey pakad liya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathi us se Abu-Sufiyan aur uske sathiyon ke barey mein poochh gachh karne lagey to wo kehney laga : mujhey Abu-Sufiyan ka to pata nahi hai, albatta abu-Jahal , Utba , Sheba , aur Umayya-bin-Khalaf yahan ( qareeb maujood ( hain. jab us ne ye kaha, wo usey maarney lagey. to usne kaha : haan , tumhen batataa hun, Abu-Sufiyan idhar hai. jab unhon-ne usey chhoda aur) dobara ( poochha, to usne kaha : Abu-Sufiyan ka to mujhey ilm nahi hai, albatta abu-Jahal , Utba , Sheba , aur Umayya-bin-Khalaf yahan logon mein maujood hain. jab us ne ye (pahley wali) baat ki to wo usey maarney lagey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey Namaz padh rahe they, aap ne jab ye surate haal dekhi to aap (salam pher kar) paltey aur farmaya is zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! jab wo sach kehta hai to tum usey maartey ho aur jab wo tum se jhoot boltaa hai to usey chhod detey ho. kaha : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye falan ke marney ki jagah hai. aap zamin par apna hath rakhtey they (aur farmatey they) yahan aur yahan . kaha : unmein se koi bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath ki jagah se ( zarra barabar bhi) idhar-udhar nahi hua."
"4622","Sheban-bin-Farukh ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sulaiman-bin Mughira ne hadis sunai, kaha : hamein Sabit Bunani ne Abdullah-bin-ribaah se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : kai wafad Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey, ye Ramazan ka mahina tha. ( Abdullah-bin-ribaah ne kaha : ( ham aik doosrey ke liye khana taiyaar kartey to Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) jo hamein aksar apni qiyam gaah par bulatey they. aik (din) maine kaha : main bhi kyon na khana taiyaar karun aur sab ko apni qiyam gaah par bulaaun? maine khana banaaney ka keh diya, phir Sham ko Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se mila aur kaha : aaj ki raat mere yahan dawat hai. Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tu ney mujh se pahley keh diya. (yani aaj main dawat karne wala tha) maine kaha : haan , phir maine un sab ko bulaya. Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aey Ansar ki jamat ! kya main tumhen tumharey mutaalliq hadison mein se aik hadis na bataaoon? phir unhon-ne Makka ke fateh honey ka zikr kiya. iske baad kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey yahan tak ke Makka mein dakhil ho gaey, phir do mein se aik bazu par Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko bheja aur doosrey bazu par Khalid-bin-Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) ko , abu-Ubaida (bin-jarraah ( (Raziallahu anhu) ko un logon ka sardaar banaya jinke paas zirahein na thin. unhon-ne ghaati ke darmyan wala rasta ikhtiyar kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik dastey mein they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey dekha to farmaya : Abu-Hurera ! maine kaha : hazir hun, Allah ke rasool ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere sath Ansari ke siwa koi na aaey. Sheban ke ilawa doosrey rawiyon ne izafa kiya : aap ne farmaya : mere liye Ansar ko awaz do. Ansar aap ke ird-gird aagey aur Quraish ne bhi apne obaash logon aur taabe-daaron ko ikattha kiya aur kaha : ham unko aagey kartey hain, agar koi cheez ( kamiyabi ( mili to ham bhi unke sath hain aur agar un par aafat aai to ham se jo maanga jaeyga de dengey. (diyat , jurmaana wghaira.) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum Quraish ke obaashon aur taabe-daaron (har kaam mein pairwi karne walon) ko dekh rahe ho? phir aap ne donon hathon se aik hath ko doosrey hath par (maartey huey) ishara farmaya : (unka safaayaa kar do, unka fitna daba do), phir farmaya : yahan tak ke tum mujh se Safa par aa milo. Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : phir ham chaley, ham mein se jo koi ( kaafiron mein se) jis kisi ko maarna chahta, mar daalta aur koi hamari taraf kisi cheez ( hathiyar ( ko aagey tak na karta, yahan tak ke Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur kehney lagey : Allah ke rasool ! Quraish ki jamat (ke khoon ( jayez kar diye gaey aur aaj ke baad Quraish na rahe. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( apna pichhla bayan dohraatey huey) farmaya : jo shakhs Abu-Sufiyan ke ghar ke andar chala jaey usko amn hai. Ansar aik doosrey se kehney lagey : unko (yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko) apne watan ki muhabbat aur apne kunbey walon par shafqat aa gaee hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aur ''wahi'' aaney lagi aur jab ''wahi'' aaney lagti thi to ham se chhipi na rehti . jab ''wahi'' aati to ''wahi'' (ka nuzool ( khatm honey tak koi shakhs Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf apni aankh na uthata tha, gharaz jab ''wahi'' khatm hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aey Ansar ke logo ! unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! ham hazir hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne ye kaha : is shakhs (ke dil mein) apne gaaun ki muhabbat aa gaee hai. unhon-ne kaha : yaqinan aisa to hua tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : hargiz nahi, main Allah ka banda aur uska rasool hun. maine Allah Taala ki taraf hijrat ki aur tumhari taraf ( aaya ( ab meri zindagi bhi tumhari zindagi (ke saath) hai aur maut bhi tumharey sath hai. ye sun kar Ansar rotey huey aagey badhey , wo keh rahe they : Allah Taala ki qism ! ham ne kaha jo kaha mahz Allah Taala aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath shadeed chaahat (aur unke sath se mahroomi ke khof) ki wjah se kaha tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : be-shak Allah aur uska rasool tumhari tasdeeq kartey hain aur tumhara uzr qabool kartey hain. phir log Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar ki taraf aagey aur logon ne apne darwazey band kar liye aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hajre-aswad ke paas tashrif ley aaey aur usko choomaa , phir Baitullah ka tawaaf kiya, phir aap Baitullah ke pahlu mein aik but ke paas aaey, log uski puja kiya kartey they, us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein kamaan thi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko aik taraf se pakda hua tha, jab aap but ke paas aaey to uski aankh mein chubhoney lagey aur farmaney lagey : haq aa gaya aur baatil mit gaya. jab apne tawaaf se farigh huey to Safa pahadi par aaey, is par chadhey yahan tak ke Baitullah ki taraf nazar uthai aur apne donon hath uthaey , phir Allah Taala ki hamd karne lagey aur Allah se jo maangna chaha wo maangney lagey."
"4623","Behaz ne kaha : Sulaiman-bin-Mugheera ne hamein isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne hadis mein (ye ( izafa kiya : aap ne donon hathon se, aik ko doosrey ke sath phertey huey ishara kiya : unko isi tarah kaat dalo jis tarah fasl kaati jati hai unhon-ne hadis mein (ye bhi) kaha : un logon ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! ham ne ye kaha tha. aap ne farmaya : to phir mera naam kya hoga? hargiz nahi, mein Allah ka banda aur uska rasool hun."
"4624","hamein Hammaad-bin-Salma ne hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Sabit ne Abdullah-bin-ribaah se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : ham bataur wafad Hazrat Muawiya-bin-abi-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey, aur ham logon mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they, ham mein se har aadmi aik din apne sathiyon ke liye khana banata , aik din meri baari thi, maine kaha : Abu-Hurera ! aaj meri baari hai, wo sab mere thikaaney par aaey aur abhi khana nahi aaya tha. maine kaha : Abu-Hurera ! kaash! ! aap hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se koi hadis sunaien yahan tak ke khana aa jaey. unhon-ne kaha : ham fateh Makka ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khalid-bin-Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) ko daain bazu ( memna ( par) ameer ( muqarrar kiya aur Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko baain bazu ( Maisra ( par aur abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) ko piyaadon par aur wadi ke andar (ke rastey ( par tainaat kiya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Abu-Hurera ! Ansar ko bulao . maine unko bulaya , wo daurhtey huey aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Ansar ke logo ! kya tum Quraish ke obaashon ko dekh rahe ho? unhon-ne kaha : ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : dekho ! kal jab tumhara unse saamnaa ho to unko is tarah kaat dena jis tarah fasl kaati jati hai aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne posheeda rakhtey huey hath se ishara karke bataya aur daahinaa hath baain hath par rakha aur farmaya : ab tum se mulaqat ka wada kooh (pahadi) Safa par hai. Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : to us roz jis kisi ne sar uthaya , unhon-ne usko silaa diya, (yani mar dala. ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Safa pahaad par chadhey , Ansar aaey, unhon-ne Safa ko gher liya, itney mein Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur kehney laga : Allah ke rasool ! Quraish ki jama'iyat mitaa di gaee, aaj se Quraish na rahe. Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo koi Abu-Sufiyan ke ghar mein chala gaya usko amn hai aur jo hathiyar daal de usko bhi amn hai aur jo apna darwaza band kar ley usko bhi amn hai. Ansar ne kaha : aap par apne azeezon ki mohabbat aur apne Shahar ki mohabbat ghalib aa gaee hai. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi nazil hui. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum logon ne kaha : mujh par kunbey walon ki mohabbat aur apne Shahar ki muhabbat ghalib aa gaee hai, dekho ! phir (is sura mein) mera naam kya hoga? aap ne teen baar farmaya :  main Muhammad Allah Taala ka banda aur uska rasool hun. maine Allah ke liye tumhari taraf hijrat ki, to ab zindagi tumhari zindagi (ke saath) hai aur maut tumhari maut (ke saath) hai. unhon-ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! ham ne ye Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki shadeed chaahat (aur aap ki maiyat (sath) se mahroomi ke khof (ke ilawa kisi wjah se nahi kaha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : to Allah aur uska rasool donon tum ko sachcha jantey hain aur tumhara uzr qabool kartey hain."
"4625","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid aur ibne-abi-Umar ne. padhi. alfaz ibne-Abi-Sheba ke hain. padhi. kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne ibne-abi-najeeh se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Mujahid se, unhon-ne abu-Ma'mar se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka mein dakhil huey to Kaba ke gird teen so sath but they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har aik ko apne hath mein pakdi hui lakdi se kachokaa de kar giraaney lagey aur ye farmaney lagey : haq aa gaya aur baatil mit gaya, bila shubah baatil mitney wala hai. haq aa gaya aur baatil na shuruat karta hai aur na lautaataa hai) balke donon izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah jalaala ke kaam hain. ( ibne-abi-Umar ne izafa kiya : fateh Makka ke din ."
"4626","Sory ne ibne-abi-najeeh se isi sanad ke sath pehli aayat ke aakhir tak riwayat ki, dusri aayat bayan nahi ki aur . padhi. (nasban) ke bajaey (sanmaa) kaha : (donon ke mana but ke hain.)"
"4627","Ali-bin-Mus'hir aur Wakee ne Zakariya se, unhon-ne Shabi se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Abdullah-bin-mutee' ne apne bap ( mutee'-bin- Aswad (Raziallahu anhu)) se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : jis din Makka fateh hua maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehtey huey suna : aaj ke baad qiyamat tak koi qureshi baandh kar qatl na kiya jaey."
"4628","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne kaha : hamein Zakariya ne isi sanad ke sath yahi hadis sunai aur ye izafa kiya, kaha is din Quraish ke Aas ( naafarmaan ( naam ke logon mein se, mutee' ke siwa , koi musalman nahi hua. uska naam aasi tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska naam ( badal kar) mutee' rakh diya."
"4629","Muaz Anbari ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne us suleh ka muaahida likha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur mushrikon ke darmyan Hudaibiya ke din hui thi. unhon-ne likha : ye ( muaahida ( hai jis par tahreeri suleh ki Allah ke rasool , Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne. un logon ( mushrikon ( ne kaha : Allah ke rasool mat likhiye , isliye ke agar ham yaqin jantey ke aap Allah ke rasool hain to ham aap se na ladtey . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya : is lafz ko mitaa do. unhon-ne kaha : jo is ( lafz ( ko mitaaey ga wo main nahi. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko apne hath se mitaa diya, kaha : unhon-ne jo shartein rakhein unmein ye bhi thi ke) musalman ( Makka mein aaein aur teen din tak muqeem rahen aur hathiyar lekar Makka mein dakhil na hon, siwaey-iske ke chamdey ke thailey mein hon. ( Shoba ne kaha ( maine Abu-Ishaq se kaha : chamdey ke thailey se kya murad hai? unhon-ne kaha : niyaam aur jo iske andar hai."
"4630","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hudaibiya (mein aa kar suleh ki guftgu karne) walon se suleh ki to unke beech Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne tahreer likhi , kaha : unhon-ne Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) likha , phir Muaz ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya, magar unhon-ne : ye hai jis par tahreer suleh ki (ka jumla ( bayan nahi kiya."
"4631","Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim Hanzali aur Ahmed bin janab missisi donon ne Esa-bin-Yonus se. lafz Ishaq ke hain. padhi. riwayat ki, kaha : hamein Esa-bin-Yonus ne khabar di, hamein Zakariya ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Baitullah ke paas rok liya gaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Makka walon ne is baat par suleh ki ke) aainda saal ( Makka mein dakhil hon aur teen din tak usmein rahen aur hathiyar rakhney ke thelon : talwaar aur uske niyaam ke ilawa (koi hathiyar lekar) us Shahar mein dakhil na hon aur kisi Makka waley ko apne sath na ley jayen aur unke sath aaney walon mein se jo wahan reh jaey (mushrikon ka sath qabool kar ley) to usko mana na karein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya : is shart ko hamarey darmyan likho ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم ( ye hai jis par aapsi faisla kya Allah Taala ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne. mushrik boley : agar ham ye yaqin jantey ke aap Allah Taala ke rasool hain to aap ki pairwi kartey, balke yun likhiye : Muhammad-bin-Abdullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya un (alfaz ( ko mitaa dein. unhon-ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! main (apne hath se) na mitaunga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : achchha, mujhey us (jumley) ki jagah dikhao. Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne dikha di, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko mita diya aur ibne- Abdullah likh diya (jab hasab muaahida agley saal aa kar Umra ada farmaya ( to teen roz hi Makka muazzama mein rahe. jab tesraa din hua to mushrikon ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : ye tumharey sahib ki shart ka aakhiri din hai, unse kaho : ab wo chaley jayen, unhon-ne aapko bataya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : achchha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka se) nikal aaey. ibne-janab ne ham aap ki pairwi kartey ke bajaey ham aap ki bait kartey. kaha."
"4632","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Quraish ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se musaalihat ki, unmein Suhail-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya : likho : ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم ( Suhel kehney lagey : jahan tak bismillah ka talluq hai to ham ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم ( ko nahi jaantey, lekin wo likho jisey ham jantey hain : ( باسمك اللهم ( phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : likho : Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se. wo log kehney lagey : agar ham yaqin jantey ke aap Allah ke rasool hain to ham aap ki pairwi kartey, lekin apna aur apne walid ka naam likho , Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : likho : Muhammad-bin-Abdullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se. un logon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par shart lagai ke aap logon mein se jo ( hamarey paas ( aa jaeyga ham usey aap logon ko wapas na karengey aur ham mein se jo aap ke paas aaya aap usey ham ko wapas kar dengey. ( sahaba ne) puchha : aey Allah ke rasool! kya ham ye likh dein ? farmaya : haan , ham mein se jo shakhs unke paas chala gaya to usey Allah ne ham se door kar diya aur unmein se jo hamarey paas aayega Allah uske liye kushadgi aur nikalney ka rasta paida farma dega."
"4633","Habib bin abi Sabit ne abu-Waeil (Shaqeeq) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Sahal-bin-Haneef (Raziallahu anhu) jange-siffin ke roz khadey huey aur) logon ko mukhaatab karke ( kaha : logo ! ( ameerul-momeneen par ilzam lagaaney ke bajaey) khud ko ilzam 2 (Suleh ko mustarad karke Allah aur uske bataaey huey rastey se tum hat rahe ho ( ham Hudaibiya ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they aur agar ham jang ( hi ko naaguzeer ( dekhtey to jang kar guzartey. ye us suleh ka waqia hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur mushrekeen ke darmyan hui. ( ab to musalmanon ke 2 girohon ka mamla hai.) umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) aaey, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! kya ham haq par aur wo baatil par nahi ? aap ne farmaya : kyon nahi ! kaha : kya hamarey maqtool jannat mein aur unke maqtool aag mein na jaeinge? farmaya : kyon nahi ! kaha : to ham apne Deen mein nichey lag kar (Suleh ( kyon karein ( nichey lag kar kyon suleh karein? (aur is tarah kyon lot jayen ke Allah ne hamarey aur unke darmyan faisla nahi kiya? to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Khattab ke betey ! main Allah ka rasool hun, (uske hukm se suleh kar raha hun) Allah mujhey kabhi zaaye nahi karega. kaha : umr (Raziallahu anhu) ghussey ke aalim mein chal padey aur sabr na kar sakey. wo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha : aey Abu-Bakar ! kya ham haq par aur wo baatil par nahi ? kaha : kyon nahi ! kaha : kya hamarey maqtool jannat mein aur unke maqtool aag mein nahi? unhon-ne kaha : kyon nahi ! (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : to ham apne Deen mein nichey lag kar) jaisi suleh wo chahtey hain unhein) kyon dein? aur is tarah kyon lot jayen ke Allah ne hamarey aur unke darmyan faisla nahi kiya? to unhon-ne kaha : ibne-khattaab! wo Allah ke rasool hain, Allah unhein hargiz kabhi zaaye nahi karega. kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par fateh (ki khushkhabri) ke sath Quran utra. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulwaya aur unhein (jo nazil hua tha) wo padhwaaya. unhon-ne kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! kya ye fateh hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : haan. to (us par) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka dil khush ho gaya aur wo lot aaey."
"4634","abu-Kuraib Muhammad-bin Alaa aur Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Numer donon ne kaha : hamein abu-Muawia ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Shaqiq (bin Salma abu-Waail ( se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine siffin mein Sahal-bin-Haneef (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : logo! apni raey par) ghalat honey ka ( ilzam lagaao . Allah ki qism ! maine abu-jandal (Raziallahu anhu) (ke waqiey (ke din apne aapko us haalat mein dekha ke agar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke (Suleh ke) mamley ko radd kar sakta to radd kar deta. Allah ki qism ! ham ne kabhi kisi kaam ke liye apne kandhon par talwaarein nahi rakhin thin magar un talwaaron ne hamarey liye aisey mamley tak pahunchne mein aasani kar di jis ko ham jantey they, siwaey tumharey maujooda mamley ke. ibne-Numair ne kabhi kisi mamley ke liye ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"4635","Jarir aur Wakee donon ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, un donon ki hadis mein ye alfaz hain : aisey kaam ki taraf jo hamein mushkil mein mubtala kar raha tha."
"4636","abu-Haseen ne abu-Waeil se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine siffin mein Sahal-bin-Haneef (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : apne Deen ke muqaabley main apni raey par ilzam dharo . abu-jandal (Raziallahu anhu) (ke waqiey (ke din maine khud ko is haalat mein dekha ke agar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke faisley ko radd kar sakta (to haashaa w kalaa radd kar deta .) lekin ye mamla aisa hai ke ham iske aik koney ko mazbut nahi kar patey ke hamarey samney uska doosra kona khul jata hai. (kyonke ye musalmanon ka aapas mein ikhtilaf hai.)"
"4637","Saeed-bin-abi-Aruba ne hamein Qatada se hadis sunai ke Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein hadis sunai, kaha : jab Sura Fateh ki aayat 1 se 5 tak utri (to ye (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Hudaibiya se waapsi ka mauqa tha aur logon ke dilon mein gham aur dukh ki kaifiyat taari thi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hudaibiya mein qurbani ke oont nehar kar diye they, to (is mauqe par) aap ne farmaya : mujh par aik aisi aayat nazil ki gaee hai jo mujhey poori duniya se zyada mahboob hai."
"4638","Motamir ke walid ( Sulaiman ( , Hammam aur Sheban sab ne Qatada se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Saeed-bin-abi-Aruba ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4639","Hazrat Huzefa bin Yaman (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jange-badr mein mere shamil na honey ki wjah sirf ye thi ke main aur mere walid Husail (Raziallahu anhu) (jo Yamaan ke laqab se Maruf they) donon nikley to hamein kuffaare-Quraish ne pakad liya aur kaha : tum Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jana chahtey ho? ham ne kaha : unke paas jana nahi chahtey, ham to sirf Madina Munawra jana chahtey hain. unhon-ne ham se Allah ke naam par ye ahad aur meesaaq liya ke ham Madina jaeynge lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath mil kar jang nahi karengey, ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar aapko ye khabar di, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum donon lot jao, ham unse kya hua ahad pura karengey aur unke khilaf Allah Taala se madad maangengey."
"4640","Ibrahim Taimi ke walid (Yazeed bin Sharik) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : ham Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas they, aik aadmi ne kaha : agar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak ko pa leta to aap ke sath jihad karta aur khub ladta, Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : kya tum aisa kartey? maine jange-Ehzaab ki raat ham sab ko dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, hamein tez hawa aur sardi ne apni giraft mein ley rakha tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya koi aisa mard hai jo mujhey (is) qaum (ke andar) ki khabar la de? qiyamat ke din Allah Taala usko mere sath rakhey! ham khamosh rahe aur ham mein se kisi ne aapko koi jawab na diya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya : koi shakhs hai jo mere paas un logon ki khabar ley aaey? qiyamat ke din Allah Taala usko mere sath rakhey ! ham khamosh rahe aur ham mein se kisi ne koi jawab na diya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir farmaya : hai koi shakhs jo un logon ki khabar la de ? qiyamat ke din Allah Taala usko meri rifaaqat ata farmaai ! ham khamosh rahe, ham mein se kisi ne koi jawab na diya, aap ne farmaya : Huzefa ! khadey ho jao aur tum mujhey unki khabar la ke do. jab aap ne mera naam lekar bulaya to maine uthney ke siwa koi chaara na paya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jao un logon ki khabrein mujhey la do aur unhein mere khilaf bhadka na dena. (koi aisi baat ya harkat na karna ke tum pakdey jao, aur wo mere khilaf bhadak uthein ( jab main aap ke paas se gaya to meri haalat ye ho gaee jaisey main Hammam mein chal raha hun, ( pasiney mein nahaya hua tha) yahan tak ke main unke paas pahuncha , maine dekha ke Abu-Sufiyan apni pusht aag se saink raha hai, maine teer ko kamaan ki beech mein rakha aur usko nishana bana dena chaha , phir mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye farman yad aa gaya ke unhein mere khilaf bhadka na dena (ke jang aur tez ho jaey) agar main us waqt teer chala deta to wo nishana bin jata, main lota to (mujhey aisey lag raha tha) jaisey main Hammam mein chal raha hun, phir jab main aap ki khidmat mein hazir hua to maine aapko un logon ki (saari) khabar batai aur main farigh hua to mujhey thand lagney lagi, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey (apni us) chaadar ka bacha hua hissey odha diya jo aap (ke jism) par thi, aap usmein Namaz padh rahe they. main ( usko odh kar) subah tak sota raha, jab subah hui to aap ne farmaya : aey khub soney waley ! uth jao."
"4641","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jange-Uhud ke din Rasulullah (sl), Ansar ke saat (7) aur Quraish ke 2 aadmiyon ( Sad-bin-abi-Waqas aur Talha bin Ubaidullah Taimi (Raziallahu anhu)) ke sath (lashkar se alag karke) tanha kar diye gaey, jab unhon-ne aapko gher liya to aap ne farmaya : unko ham se kon hataaeyga? uske liye jannat hai, ya (farmaya :) wo jannat mein mera rafeeq hoga. to Ansar mein se aik shakhs aagey badha aur us waqt tak ladta raha, yahan tak ke wo Shahid ho gaya, unhon-ne phir se aapko gher liya, aap ne farmaya : unhein kon ham se door hataaeyga? uske liye jannat hai, ya (farmaya :) wo jannat mein mera rafeeq hoga. phir Ansar mein se aik shakhs aagey badha wo lada yahan tak ke Shahid ho gaya, phir ye silsila yoonhi chalta raha yahan tak ke wo saaton Ansari Shahid ho gaey, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne (un qureshi) sathiyon se farmaya : ham ne apne sathiyon ke sath insaf nahi kya."
"4642","abu-Hazim ke betey Abdul-Azeez ne apne walid se bayan kya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unse jange-Uhud ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zakhmi honey ke mutaalliq sawal kya ja raha tha, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra Mubarak zakhmi ho gaya tha aur samney (sanaaya ke saath) ka aik daant (rubaai) toot gaya tha aur khod sar par tukdey-tukdey ho gaya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Sayeda Fatima (Raziallahu anha) (aap ke chehrey se) khoon dho rahi thin aur Hazrat Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) dhaal se us ( zakhm ( par pani daal rahe they, jab Sayeda Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne ye dekha ke pani dalney se khoon nikalney mein izafa ho raha hai to unhon-ne chataai ka aik tukda lekar jalaaya wo raakh ho gaya, phir usko zakhm par laga diya to khoon ruk gaya."
"4643","Yaqoob bin Abdur-Rehman al-Qari ne abu-Hazim se bayan kya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zakhm ke mutaalliq sawal kya ja raha tha, unhon-ne kaha : suno ! Allah ki qism ! mujhey achi tarah malum hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zakhm kon dho raha tha aur pani kon daal raha tha aur aap ke zakhm par kon si dawaai lagai gaee, phir Abdul-Azeez ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya, magar unhon-ne ye izafa kya : aur aap ka chehra anwar zakhmi ho gaya aur. padhi. (khod) tukdey-tukdey ho gaya. padhi. ki jagah toot gaya kaha."
"4644","ibne-Uena, Saeed-bin-abi-Hilal aur Muhammad-bin Mutarrif, un sab ne abu-Hazim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se yahi hadis Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, ibne-abi Hilal ki hadis mein hai : aap ka chehra Mubarak nishana banaya gaya aur ibne- Mutarrif ki hadis mein hai : aap ka chehra Mubarak zakhmi hua."
"4645","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jange-Uhud ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ( sanaaiya ke sath wala ( rubaai daant toot gaya aur aap ke sar mein zakhm laga, aap apne sar se khoon poonchhtey they aur farmatey they : wo qaum kaisey falaah paaeygi jisne apne Nabi ke sar mein zakhm lagaya aur uska rubaai ka daant tod diya, aur wo unhein Allah ki taraf bula raha tha. is mauqe par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai is mamley mein aap ke hath mein koi cheez nahi (ke wo Allah unki taraf tawajjoh farmaai ya unko azab de ke wo zaalim hain. ("
"4646","Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Numer ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Wakee ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Aamash ne Shaqiq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abdullah (bin Masood ( (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : jaisey main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dekh raha hun, aap anbiya mein se aik Nabi ka waqia bayan farma rahe they jinhein unki qaum ne maara, wo apne chehrey se khoon poonchh rahe they aur (ye) farma rahe they : aey Allah! meri qaum ko maaf kar de, wo nahi jantey (ke wo kya kar rahe hain.)"
"4647","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne kaha : hamein Wakee aur Muhammad-bin-Bishr ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath riwayat bayan ki, usmein unhon-ne ye kaha : to wo (Nabi (Alaihissalam)) apni peshani se khoon poonchhtey jatey they."
"4648","Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat hai, kaha : ye hadisein hain jo hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, unhon-ne kai hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik ye hai : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya is qaum par Allah ka ghazab shadeed ho gaya jinhoney Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ye kya aap us waqt apne rubaai daant ki taraf ishara farma rahe they. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala us shakhs par sakht ghazab naak hota hai jis ko Allah ka rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ki raah mein (jihad kartey huey) qatl kar de."
"4649","Zakariya (bin abi Zayda ( ne Abu-Ishaq se, unhon-ne Amr-bin-Memoon Awdi se, unhon-ne ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : aik baar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Baitullah ke paas Namaz padh rahe they, abu-Jahal aur uske sathi bhi baithey huey they, aur aik din pahley aik ontni zabah hui thi. abu-Jahal ne kaha : tum mein se kon uth kar bani falan ke mohalley se ontni ki bachchey wali jhilli ( bachche daani) laaeyga aur Muhammad sajdey mein jayen to usko unke kandhon ke darmyan rakh dega ? qaum ka sabse bad-bakht shakhs ( Aqba bin abi Muet) utha aur usko ley aaya. jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajdey mein gaey to usne wo jhilli aap ke kandhon ke darmyan rakh diya, phir wo aapas mein khub hansey aur aik doosrey par girney lagey. main khada hua dekh raha tha, kash! ! mujhey kuchh bhi tahaffuz hasil hota to main us jhilli ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki pusht se utha kar phenk deta, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajdey mein they. apna sar Mubarak nahi utha rahe they, yahan tak ke aik shakhs ne ja kar Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko khabar di, wo aaein, halanke wo us waqt kam umr bachchi thin, unhon-ne wo jhilli utha kar aap se door phenki. phir wo un logon ki taraf mutwajjeh huin aur unhein sakht sust kaha, jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni Namaz mukammal kar li to aap ne bazu buland karke unke khilaf dua ki, aap jab koi dua kartey they, to teen martaba dohraatey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) agar kuchh maangtey to teen baar maangtey they, phir aap ne teen martaba farmaya : aey Allah ! Quraish par giraft farma. jab Quraish ne aap ki awaz suni to unki hansi jati rahi aur wo aap ki baddua se khof-zada ho gaey. aap ne phir baddua farmai : aey Allah ! abu-Jahal bin Hisham par giraft farma aur Utba-bin- Rabee , Sheba bin Rabee , Waleed bin Aqba , Umayya-bin-Khalaf , Aqba bin abi Muet par giraft farma. padhi. ( Abu-Ishaq ne kaha : ( unhon ( Amr-bin-Memoon) ne saatwen shakhs ka naam bhi liya tha lekin wo mujhey yad nahi raha (uske baad Abu-Ishaq ko saatwen shakhs Umara bin Waleed ka naam yad aa gaya tha, sahi al-bukhari, hadis : 520). padhi. ( ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : (us zaat ki qism jisne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko haq ke sath maboos kya hai ! jinka aap ne naam liya tha maine badr ke din unko maqtool padey dekha, phir un sab ko ghaseet kar kuwein, badr ke kuwein ki taraf ley jaya gaya aur unhein usmein daal diya gaya. Abu-Ishaq ne kaha is hadis mein Waleed bin Aqba (ka naam ( ghalat hai. ( sahi Waleed bin Utba hai.)"
"4650","Shoba ne kaha : maine Abu-Ishaq se suna, wo Amr-bin-Memoon se hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke (eik baar) jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajdey mein they aur aap ke gird Quraish ke log baithey huey they ke Aqba bin abi Muet aik zabah ki hui ontni ki bachchey wali jhilli lekar aaya aur usko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki pusht par phenk diya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (sajdey se) sar na uthaya, phir Sayeda Fatima (Raziallahu anha) aain aur us jhilli ko aap ki pusht se uthaya aur jin logon ne ye harkat ki thi unko baddua di, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (unke barey mein) farmaya : aey Allah ! Quraish ke us giroh par giraft farma, abu-Jahal bin Hisham, Utba-bin- Rabee, Sheba bin Rabee, Aqba bin abi Muet aur Umayya-bin-Khalaf ya Ubai-bin-Khalaf. padhi. Shoba ko shak hai, par giraft farma! (Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : maine unko dekha, wo jange-badr ke din qatl kiye gaey aur unko kuwein mein daal diya gaya, albatta Umayya-bin-Khalaf ya Ubai bin Khalaf ke jod jod kat chukey they, usey (ghaseet kar) kuwein mein nahi daala ja saka."
"4651","Sufiyan ne Abu-Ishaq se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah riwayat ki aur is mein ye izafa kya ke aap teen baar ( dua karna ( pasand farmatey they, aur aap ne teen baar farmaya : aey Allah ! Quraish par giraft farma, aey Allah ! Quraish par giraft farma, aey Allah ! Quraish par giraft farma aur is mein Waleed bin Utba aur Umayya-bin-Khalaf ka naam liya (Ubai bin Khalaf aur Umayya-bin-Khalaf ke naamon mein) shak nahi kya, Abu-Ishaq ne kaha : saatwan shakhs main bhool gaya."
"4652","Zuhair ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abu-Ishaq ne Amr-bin-Memoon se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Baitullah ki taraf munh karke Quraish ke chh aadmiyon ke khilaf baddua ki, unmein abu-Jahal , Umayya bhi Khalaf , Utba-bin- Rabee , Sheba bin Rabee aur Aqba bin abi Muet they. main Allah ki qism kha kar kehta hun : maine unko badr (ke maidan) mein aundhey padey huey dekha, dhoop ne un (ke laashon) ko bilkul badal diya tha aur wo aik garm din tha."
"4653","Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya mohtarma Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! kya aap par koi aisa din bhi aaya jo Uhud ke din se zyada shadeed ho? aap ne farmaya : mujhey tumhari qaum se bahut takleef pahunchi, jab main khud ko ibne-abd ya lail bin abd kalaal ke samney ley gaya (yani usko da'wate-Islam di) lekin jo main chahta tha us ne meri baat na maani, main ghamzada ho kar chal padaa aur Qarn-Saalib par pahunch kar hi meri haalat behtar hui, maine sar uthaya to mujhey aik badal nazar aaya, us ne mujh par saaya kya hua tha, maine dekha to usmein Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) they, unhon-ne mujhey awaz de kar kaha : izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne jo kuchh aap ne apni qaum se kaha wo aur unhon-ne jo aapko jawab diya wo sab sun liya, Allah Taala ne pahadon ka farishta aap ki taraf bheja hai taake aap un kuffaar ke mutaalliq usko jo chaahein hukm dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : phir mujhey pahadon ke Farishtey ne awaz di aur salam kya, phir kaha : aey Muhammad ! Allah Taala ne aap ki qaum ki taraf se aapko diya gaya jawab sun liya, main pahadon ka farishta hun aur mujhey aap ke rab ne aap ke paas bheja hai ke aap mujhey jo chaahein hukm dein, agar aap chaahein to main un donon sanglaakh pahadon ko (utha kar) unke uper rakh dun. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : balke main ye ummeed karta hun ke Allah Taala unki pushton se aisey log nikalega jo sirf Allah ki ibadat karengey aur uske sath kisi ko Sharik nahi thehraengey."
"4654","abu-Awana ne Aswad bin Qais se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jundub bin Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : un jangon mein se aik mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungli khoon aalud ho gaee to aap ne farmaya : to aik ungli hi hai jo zakhmi hui aur tu ney jo takleef uthai wo Allah ki raah mein hai."
"4655","ibne-Uena ne Aswad bin Qais se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik lashkar mein they aur) wahan (aap ki ungli zakhmi ho gaee."
"4656","Sufiyan bin Aswad bin Qais se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke aik baar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ki aamad mein taakheer ho gaee, mushrekeen kehney lagey ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko alwadaa keh diya gaya. to izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne ye nazil farmaya : qism hai dhoop chadhtey waqt ki, aur qism hai raat ki jab wo chhaa jaey! (aey Nabi!) aap ke rab ne na aapko rukhsat kya aur na bezaar hua."
"4657","Zuhair ne Aswad bin Qais se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Jundub bin Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar ho gaey aur 2 ya teen raatein uth na sakey to aik aurat aap ke paas aai aur kehney lagi : aey Muhammad ! mujhey lagta hai ke aap ke shaitan ne aapko chhod diya hai, maine 2 ya teen raaton se usey aap ke qareeb aatey nahi dekha. kaha : is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai : qism hai dhoop chadhtey waqt ki aur raat ki jab wo chhaa jaey ! (aey Nabi ! (aap ke rab ne na aapko rukhsat kya aur na wo bezaar hua."
"4658","Shoba aur Sufiyan ( Sory ( ne Aswad bin Qais se isi sanad ke sath un donon ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4659","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Urwa (bin Zuber ( se khabar di ke Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke (eik baar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik gadhey par sawari farmai, is par paalaan tha aur uske nichey fidak ki bani hui aik chadar thi, aap ne Usama (bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu)) ko peechhey bithaya hua tha, aap qabila banu- Haris bin khazraj mein Hazrat Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki iyaadat karna chahtey they. ye jange-badr se pahley ka waqia hai, aap rastey mein aik majlis se guzrey jahan musalman, but-parast aur mushrik aur Yahudi miley juley maujood they, unmein Abdullah-bin Ubai bhi tha aur majlis mein Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) bhi maujood they. jab sawari ki gard majlis ki taraf uthi to Abdullah-bin Ubai ne chadar se apni naak dhanp li aur kehney laga : ham par gard na udaaein. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un sab ko salam kya, ruk gaey, phir aap sawari se utrey, un logon ko Islam ki dawat di aur un par Quran Majeed ki tilawat ki. Abdullah-bin Ubai ne kaha : aey shakhs! us se achi baat aur koi nahi hogi ke jo kuchh aap keh rahe hain agar wo sach hai to bhi hamari majlison mein aa kar hamein takleef na pahunchaaein aur apne ghar lot jayen aur ham mein se jo shakhs aap ke paas aaey usko sunaein. padhi. Hazrat Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aap hamari majlis mein tashrif laaein . ham usko pasand kartey hain, phir musalman, yahood aur but parast aik doosrey ko bura bhala kehney lagey, yahan tak ke aik doosrey par toot padney par taiyaar ho gaey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unko musalsal dheemaa kartey rahe, phir aap apni sawari par baithey, Hazrat Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey aur farmaya : Sad ! aap ne nahi suna ke abu-Hubaab ne kya kaha hai? aap ki murad Abdullah-bin Ubai se thi, us ne is-is tarah kaha hai. (hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : ya Rasulullah ! usko maaf kar dijiye aur us se darguzar kijiye . be-shak Allah Taala ne aapko jo ata kya hai so kya hai. is nashebi nakhlistaani ilaaqey mein basney walon ne mil jul kar ye tay kar liya tha ke usko (badhshahat ka ( taaj pahnaaengey aur uske sar par (riyaasat ka ( amaama baandhengey, phir jab Allah Taala ne, us haq ke zariey jo aapko ata farmaya hai, us ( faisley ( ko radd kar diya to is bina par usko halaq mein phanda lag gaya aur aap ne jo dekha hai us ne usi bina par kya hai. so Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey maaf kar diya."
"4660","Aqeel ne ibne-Shahab (Zohri ( se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki aur ye izafa kya : ye Abdullah (bin abi ( ke) zahiri taur par) Islam (ka elaan karne) se pahley ka waqia hai."
"4661","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya : (kya hi achchha ho ( agar aap (Islam ki dawat dene ke liye) Abdullah-bin Ubai ke paas bhi tashrif ley jayen! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik gadhey par sawari farma kar uski taraf gaey aur musalman bhi gaey, wo shorili zamin thi, jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uske paas pahunchey to wo kehney laga : mujh se door rahen , Allah ki qasam! aap ke gadhey ki bu se mujhey azeeyat ho rahi hai. Ansar mein se aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka gadhaa tum se zyada khushbu daar hai. is par Abdullah-bin Ubai ki qaum mein se aik shakhs uski himaayat mein, ghussey mein aa gaya. kaha : donon mein se har aik ke sathi ghussey mein aa gaey. kaha : to unmein hathon , chhadiyon aur jooton ke sath ladai honey lagi, phir hamein ye baat pahunchi ke unhi ke barey mein ye aayat nazil hui : agar musalmanon ki 2 jamatein aapas mein lad padein to un donon ke darmyan suleh karao."
"4662","Ismail ibne-Ulaih ne kaha : hamein Sulaiman Taimi ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : hamari khaatir kon ja kar dekhega ke abu-Jahal ka kya bana ? is par Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) chaley gaey, unhon-ne dekha ke Ifra ke do betey usko talwaaron ka nishana bana chukey hain. aur uska jism thanda ho raha hai. Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne uski dadhi pakad kar kaha : to abu-Jahal hai? abu-Jahal ne kaha : kya us se badey kisi shakhs ko bhi tum ne qatl kiya hai? ya kaha, padhi. uski qaum ne qatl kiya hai? ( Sulaiman Taimi ne) kaha : abu-Mujliz ne kaha : abu-Jahal ne ye bhi kaha tha : kaash! ! mujhey kisaanon ke ilawa kisi aur ne qatl kiya hota."
"4663","hamein Moatamir ne kaha : maine apne walid ( Sulaiman Taimi ( se suna, wo keh rahe they : hamein Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere liye kon malum karega ke abu-Jahal ka kya hua? aagey ibne-Ulaih ki hadis aur abu-Mujliz ke qaul ki tarah hai, jis tarah Ismail ne bayan kiya hai."
"4664","hamein Sufiyan ne Amr se hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Kab-bin-Ashraf ki zimme-dari kon lega? us ne Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko azeeyat di hai. Muhammad-bin-Muslima (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! kya aap chahtey hain ke main usey qatl kar dun? aap ne farmaya : haan. unhon-ne kaha : mujhey ijazat dijiye ki main (ye kaam kartey huey) koi baat keh loon. aap ne farmaya : keh lenaa. chunanche wo uske paas aaey, baat ki aur baahami ta'lluqaat ka tazkira kiya aur kaha : ye aadmi sadqa ( lena ( chahta hai aur hamein takleef mein daal diya hai. jab us ne ye suna to kehney laga : Allah ki qism ! tum aur bhi uktaao gey . unhon-ne kaha : ab to ham uske perokar bin chukey hain aur) abhi ( usey chhodnaa nahi chahtey. yahan tak ke dekh lein ke uske mamley ka anjam kya hota hai. kaha : main chahta hun ke tum mujhey kuchh udhaar do. usne kaha : tum mere paas girwi mein kya rakho gey? unhon-ne jawab diya : tum kya chahtey ho? usne kaha : apni aurton ko mere paas girwi rakh do. unhon-ne kaha : tum Arab ke sabse khoobsurat insan ho, kya ham apni auratein tumharey paas girwi rakhein? us ne unse kaha : tum apne bachchey mere yahan girwi rakh do. unhon-ne kaha : ham mein se kisi ke betey ko gaali di jaeygi to kaha jaeyga : wo khajoor ke do wasaq ke iwaz girwi rakha gaya tha. albatta ham tumharey paas zirah yani hathiyar girwi rakh detey hain. usne kaha : theek hai. unhon-ne us se wada kiya ke wo Haris , abu-Abas-bin-jabr aur Ibaad-bin-Bishr (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar uske paas aaeingey. kaha : wo aaey aur raat ke waqt usey awaz di to wo utar kar unke paas aaya. Sufiyan ne kaha : Amr ke ilawa doosrey rawi ne kaha : uski biwi us se kehney lagi : main aisi awaz sun rahi hun jaisey wo khoon (ke talabgaar ( ki awaz ho. usne kaha : ye to Muhammad-bin-Mussalima (Raziallahu anhu) aur uska doodh Sharik bhai aur abu-Naeyla (Raziallahu anhu) hain aur Karim insan ko raat ke waqt bhi kisi zakhm (ke madaawey ( ki khaatir bulaya jaey to wo aata hai. Muhammad (bin mussalima (Raziallahu anhu)) ne (apne sathiyon se) kaha : main, jab wo aayega , apna hath uske sar ki taraf badhaaun ga , jab main usey khub achi tarah jakad loon to wo tumharey bas mein hoga (tum apna kaam kar guzarna .) kaha : jab wo nichey utra to is tarah utra ke usne peti ( chadar baain kandhey par daal kar uska sar daain baghl ke nichey se nikal kar seeney par donon siron se) baandhi hui thi. unhon-ne kaha : hamein aap se itr ki khushbu aa rahi hai. usne kaha : haan , mere nikah mein falan aurat hai, wo Arab ki sab aurton se zyada muattar (khushbudar) rehney wali hai. unhon-ne kaha : kya tum mujhey ijazat detey ho ke main is ( khushbu ( ko soongh loon ? usne kaha : haan , soongh lo. to unhon-ne ( sar ko) pakad kar soonghaa . phir kaha : kya tum mujhey ijazat detey ho ke main isey dobara soongh loon? kaha : to unhon-ne uske sar ko qaabu kar liya, phir kaha : tumharey bas mein hai. kaha : to unhon-ne usey qatl kar diya."
"4665","Abdul-Azeez-bin-Suhaib ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaibar ki jang ladi. ham ne wahan subah ki Namaz andherey mein padhi. phir Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sawar huey aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) bhi sawar huey aur main sawari par abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke peechhey tha. Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaibar ke tang raston main apni sawari ko daudaayaa , mera ghutna Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan ko chhu raha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan se kapda hat gaya aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan ki safedi dekh raha tha. jab aap basti mein dakhil huey to farmaya : Allahu-akbar ! khaibar tabah hua, ham jab kisi qaum ke gharon ke samney utartey hain to un logon ki subah buri hoti hai jinhein ( aaney se pahley) daraaya gaya tha. aap ne teen baar yahi farmaya. kaha : log apne kaamon ke liye nikal chukey they, to unhon-ne kaha : (ye ( Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. Abdul-Azeez ne kaha : hamarey kuchh sathiyon ne kaha : aur lashkar hai. kaha : ham ne usey bazor shamsheer hasil kiya.(talwaron ke bal par)"
"4666","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : khaibar ke din main sawari par Hazrat abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke peechhey tha aur mera paon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paon ko chhu raha tha. kaha : ham us waqt unke paas pahunchey jab suraj chamak raha tha, wo log apne maweshi nikal chukey they aur kulhaadiyaan, tokriyaan aur belchey lekar ( khud bhi) nikal chukey they. to unhon-ne kaha : Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain aur lashkar hai. kaha : to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : khaibar ujad gaya, jab ham kisi qaum ke gharon ke samney utartey hain to un logon ki subah buri hoti hai jinhein daraayaa ja chuka tha. kaha : to izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne unhein shikast di."
"4667","Qatada ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khaibar aaey to aap ne farmaya : jab ham kisi qaum ke gharon ke aagey utartey hain to daraaiye gaey logon ki subah buri hoti hai."
"4668","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur Muhammad-bin-Ibad ne. padhi. alfaz ibne-Ibad ke hain. padhi. hamein hadis bayan ki, un donon ne kaha : hamein Hatim-bin-Ismail ne Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam Yazeed-bin-abi-Ubaid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar ki taraf rawaana huey to ham ne raat ke waqt safar kiya, logon mein se aik aadmi ne Aamir-bin-Akwaa (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : kya tum hamein apne naadir jangi ashaar  nahi sunao gey? aur Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) shaair aadmi they. wo utar kar logon ke) oonton (ke liye hoodi parhney lagey. wo keh rahe they : aey Allah ! agar to ( Fazal aur karam karne wala ( na hota to ham hidayat na patey, na sadqa kartey, na Namaz padhtey, ham terey naam par qurbaan, ham ne jo gunah kiye unko bakhsh de aur agar hamara muqaabla ho to hamarey qadam jama de aur ham par zaroor sakeenat aur waqaar nazil farmaa. hamein jab bhi awaz de kar bulaya gaya ham aaey, hamein awaz de kar un ( awaz dene waale) logon ne ham par aitimad kiya. (aur ham is par poorey utrey .) to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : ye (hoodi padhkar) oonton ko haankney wala kon hai? logon ne kaha : Aamir . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( Allah se uski mohabbat aur shauq ko dekhtey huey) farmaya : Allah is par raham karey ! logon mein se aik aadmi (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : (iske liye shahadat ( wajib ho gaee. aey Allah ke rasool ! aap ne (uske haq mein dua muakhkhar farma kar) hamein us (ki sohbat ( se zyada muddat fayda kyon nahi uthaney diya ? ( Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : ham khaibar pahunchey to ham ne unka muhaasra kar liya yahan tak ke hamein (shadeed bhook ke) makhmasey ne aa liya. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bila shubah Allah ne usey un (jihad karne waale) logon ke liye fateh kar diya hai. jab logon ne us din ki Sham ki, jab unhein fateh ata ki gaee thi to unhon-ne bahut si ( jaghon par) aag jalaaii. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : ye aag kaisi hai aur ye log kis cheez (ko pakaaney (ke liye usey jalaa rahe hain? unhon-ne jawab diya : gosht (ko pakaaney (ke liye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : kon sa gosht? unhon-ne jawab diya : paaltu gadhon ka gosht. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usey (pani samet) baha do aur un ( bartanon ( ko tod do. is par aik aadmi ne kaha : ya usey baha dein aur bartan dho lein? to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ya aisey kar lo. kaha : jab logon ne mil kar saf bandi ki to Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ki talwaar chhoti thi, unhon-ne maarney ke liye us ( talwaar ( se aik Yahudi ki pindli ko nishana banaya to talwaar ki dhaar lot kar Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghutney par aa lagi aur wo usi zakhm se faut ho gaey. jab log wapas huey, Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aur us waqt unhon-ne mera hath pakda hua tha, kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey khamosh dekha to aap ne puchha : tumhen kya hua hai? maine aap se kaha : mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan ! logon ka khayal hai ke Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ka amal zaaya ho gaya hai. aap ne farmaya : kis ne kaha hai? maine kaha : falan , falan aur Usaid-bin-Huzair Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne. to aap ne farmaya : jisne bhi ye kaha, ghalat kaha hai, uske liye to yaqinan do ajr hain. aap ne apni donon ungliyon ko ikattha kiya. wo to khud jam kar jihad karne waley Mujahid they, kam hi koi arabi hoga jo us rastey par unki tarah chala hoga. Quteba ne hadis ke do harfon ( القين (ke aakhiri do harfon ی aur ن ( mein Muhammad (bin-Ibad) ki mukhalifat ki hai aur (Muhammad ( bin-Ibad ki riwayat main ( القين (ke bajaey) ( الق )) ( zaroor biz-zaroor ki takeed ke baghair mahz ( nazil karke alfaz hain."
"4669","abu-Taahir ne mujhey hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein ibne-Wahab ne khabar di, kaha : mujhey Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se khabar di, kaha : mujhey Abdur-Rehman ne khabar di. padhi. ibne-Wahab ke ilawa doosrey rawi ne unka nasb bayan kiya to (Abdur-Rehman) bin-Abdullah-bin-Kab-bin-Malik ne kaha, padhi. ke Hazrat Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : jab khaibar ka din tha, mere bhai ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khub jang ladi, (usi beech mein) unki talwaar palat kar unhi ko ja lagi aur unhein Shahid kar diya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba ne us hawale se kuchh baatein kahin aur us mamley mein shak (ka izhar kiya) ke aadmi apne hi aslaha se faut hua hai. unhon-ne unke mamley ke kuchh pahluon mein shak kiya. Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khaibar se wapas huey to maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool ! mujhey ijazat dijiye ki main aap ke aagey rajziya (fakhriya) ashaar padhun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein ijazat de di. is par Hazrat Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main janta hun jo tum kehney ja rahe ho. kaha : to maine (ye rajziya (fakhriya) ashaar ( padhey : Allah ki qism ! agar Allah (ka karam ( na hota to ham hidayat na patey , na sadqa kartey aur na Namaz padhtey . is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne sach kaha, ham par bahut sakeenat nazil farma aur agar hamara muqaabla ho to hamarey qadam mazbut kar de, mushrikon ne yaqinan ham par sakht zyadti ki. kaha : jab maine apne rajziya (fakhriya) ashaar khatm kiye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : ye ( ashaar ( kis ne kahey ? maine jawab diya : mere bhai ne kahey . to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah un par raham karey ! kaha : to maine kaha : Allah ki qism ! Allah ke rasool ! kuchh log uske liye dua kartey huey dar rahe they, wo keh rahe they : wo aadmi apne hi aslahey se faut hua hai. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo to jihad kartey huey Mujahid ke taur par faut hua hai. ibne-Shahab ne kaha : phir maine Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ke aik betey se sawal kiya to unhon-ne mujhey apne walid se usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne (Hazrat Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ke alfaz dohraatey huey) kaha : jab maine kaha : kuchh log uske liye dua karne se dartey hain to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : un logon ne ghalat kaha, wo to jihad kartey huey Mujahid ke taur par faut huey, unke liye dohra ajr hai. aur aap ne apni do ungliyon se ishara farmaya."
"4670","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : ehzaab ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey sath mitti utha kar phenk rahe they. (us) mitti ne batan Mubarak (pait) ki safedi ko chipa liya tha aur aap farma rahe they : Allah ki qism ! agar tera karam na hota to ham hidayat na patey , na sadqa kartey, na Namaz padhtey . ham par zaroor biz-zaroor sakeenat nazil farmaa. un logon ne ham par zulm kiya hai. kaha : kabhi-kabhi aap farmatey : un sardaaron ne ham par) apna zulm rokney se) inkar kar diya, jab wo fitney ka irada kartey hain ham us (main padney ( se inkar kar detey hain. aap un (alfaz ( par apni awaz ko buland farma letey."
"4671","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se suna. padhi. unhon-ne usi ki tarah bayan kya, albatta (is riwayat ke mutabiq ( unhon-ne kaha : bila shubah un logon ne ham par zyadti ki hai."
"4672","Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laey jabke ham khandaq khod rahe they aur apne kandhon par mitti utha kar phenk rahe they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aey Allah ! zindagi to sirf aakhirat ki zindagi hai, isliye muhajireen aur Ansar ki maghfirat farma."
"4673","Muawiya bin Qurra ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : aey Allah ! aakhirat ki zindagi ke siwa koi zindagi nahi, to Ansar aur muhajireen ko maaf farma de."
"4674","Shoba ne hamein Qatada se hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! be-shak zindagi aakhirat ki zindagi hai. Shoba ne kaha : ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yun farmaya : aey Allah ! aakhirat ki zindagi ke siwa koi zindagi ( haqiqi ( nahi, to Ansar aur muhajireen ko izzat ata farma."
"4675","Yahya-bin-Yahya aur Sheban-bin-Farukh ne hamein hadis bayan ki, Yahya ne kaha : hamein Abdul-Waris ne Abu-Tayyah se hadis bayan ki, kaha : Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : sahaba rajziya ashaar padhtey they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unka sath detey they, wo kehtey they : aey Allah ! bhalai to sirf aakhirat ki bhalai hai, to Ansar aur muhajireen ki madad farma. Sheban ki hadis mein madad farma ki jagah maghfirat farma hai."
"4676","Hammaad-bin-Salma ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke khandaq ke din Muhammad (Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ke sahaba keh rahe they : ham wo log hain jinhoney Islam par zindagi bhar ke liye Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki. ya kaha : jihad par. padhi. Hammad ko shak hua hai. aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! asl bhalai, aakhirat ki bhalai hai, to Ansar aur muhajireen ki maghfirat farma."
"4677","Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai main subah ki azan se pahley nikla aur aap ki dodheli oontniyan zi-Qard mein charti thin (zi-Qard aik pani ka naam hai Madina se aik din ke fasla par. Bukhari ne kaha ye ladai khaibar ki jang se teen din pahley hui aur kuch ne kaha 6 hijri mein Hudaibiya se pahley) mujhey Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ka ghulam mila usne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dudheli oontniyan jati rahen. maine puchha kis ne lin? usne kaha Ghatfan ne (jo aik shaakh hai Qais qabeele ki). ye sun kar main teen baar chillaya ya sabaaha (arab ki aadat hai ke ye kalima us waqt kehtey hain jab koi badi aafat aati hai aur logon ko khabardaar karne ki zarurat hoti hai) aur Madina ke donon taraf walon ko suna diya phir main seedha chala yahan tak ke maine un luteron ko zi-Qard mein paya unhon-ne pani peena shuru kya tha maine teer maarna shuru kiye aur main teerandaaz tha aur kehta jata tha main ibne-Akwa hun aur aaj maaon ka doodh pinewalon ka din hai. main rajz padhta raha yahan tak ke oontniyan unse chhuda lin balke aur tees chaadrein unki chheenin aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur log bhi aa gaey. maine arz kya ya Rasulullah un luteron ko maine pani peeney nahi diya, wo piyaasey hain ab un par lashkar ko bhejiye . aap ne farmaya aey Akwaa ke betey ! to apni cheezein ley chuka ab janey de. Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha phir ham lautey aur Rasulullah ne ontni par apne sath mujh ko bithlaaya yahan tak ke ham Madina mein pahunchey."
"4678","saiyedna ibne- Akwaa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, jab ham Hudaibiya mein pahunchey so ham chaudah so aadmi they ( yahi mashhoo riwayat hai aur aik riwayat mein 1300 aur aik riwayat mein pandarah so aaey hain) aur wahan pachaas bakriyan thin jinko kuwein ka pani sair na kar sakta tha (yani aisa kam pani tha kuwein mein) phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kuwein ke mendh par baithey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ya thooka kuwein mein wo us waqt ubal aaya. phir ham ne janwaron ko pani pilaya aur khud bhi piyaa . baad iske Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham ko bulaya bait ke liye darakht ki jad mein (usi darakht ko shajra rizwaan kehtey hain aur us darakht ka zikr Quran sharif mein hai. ( إِنَّ الَّذِينَ يُبَايِعُونَكَ إِنَّمَا يُبَايِعُونَ اللَّـهَ يَدُ اللَّـهِ فَوْقَ أَيْدِيهِمْ فَمَن نَّكَثَ فَإِنَّمَا يَنكُثُ عَلَىٰ نَفْسِهِ وَمَنْ أَوْفَىٰ بِمَا عَاهَدَ عَلَيْهُ اللَّـهَ فَسَيُؤْتِيهِ أَجْرًا عَظِيمًا Mina ( ۴۸ / fateh : 10 ( maine sabse pahley logon mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bait letey rahe letey rahe, yahan tak ke aadhey aadmi bait kar chukey. us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''aey Salma bait kar. maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! main to aap se awwal hi bait kar chuka . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' phir sahi''aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey nihatta (be hathiyar) dekha to aik badi si dhaal ya chhoti si dhaal di, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bait leney lagey, yahan tak ke log khatm honey lagey, us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''aey Salma ! mujh se bait nahi kartaa.'' maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! main to aap ki bait kar chuka awwal logon mein, phir beech ke logon mein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' phir sahi'' , gharaz maine teesri baar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''aey Salma ! teri wo badi dhaal ya chhoti dhaal kahan hai jo maine tujhey di thi. '' maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mera chacha Aamir mujhey mila, wo nihatta tha maine wo phir usko de di. ye sun kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' teri misal us agley shakhs ki si hui jisne dua ki thi ya Allah ! mujhey aisa dost de jis ko main apni jaan se zyada chaahun.'' phir mushrikon ne suleh ke payaam bhejey yahan tak ke har aik taraf ke aadmi dusri taraf janey lagey aur ham ne suleh kar li, Salma ne kaha : main Talha bin Ubaidullah ki khidmat mein tha, unke ghodey ko pani pilaata, unki peeth khujaata, unki khidmat karta, unhi ke sath khana khata aur maine apna ghar baar, dhan-daulat sab chhod diya tha, Allah aur uske rasool ki taraf hijrat ki jab hamari aur Makka walon ki suleh ho gaee aur ham mein har aik-doosrey se milney laga to main aik darakht ke paas aaya aur uske taley se kaantey jhaadey aur jad ke paas leta . itney mein char aadmi mushrikon mein se aaey Makka walon mein se aur lagey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bura kehney . mujhey ghussa aaya, main doosrey darakht ke nichey chala gaya, unhon-ne apne hathiyar latkaey aur let rahe, wo usi haal mein they ke yakaayak wadi ke nasheb se kisi ne awaz di, daudo aey muhajireen! ibne- zaneem ( sahabi ( maarey gaey. ye suntey hi maine apni talwaar soonti aur un charon aadmiyon par hamla kya, wo so rahe they, unke hathiyar maine ley liye aur gatha bana kar aik hath mein rakhey, phir maine kaha : qism uski jisne izzat di Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh ko, tum mein se jisne sar uthaya , main aik mar doonga us uzu (khaas ang) par jis mein uski donon aankhen hain. phir main unko kheenchta hua laya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aur mera chacha Aamir ablaat (eik shaakh hai Quraish ki) mein se aik shakhs ko laya jis ko makooz kehtey they wo usko kheenchta hua laya ghodey par, jis par jhul padi thi aur 70 aadmiyon ke sath mushrikon mein se. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko dekha. phir farmaya : ''chhod do unko . mushrikon ki taraf se ahad shikani shuru honey do. phir dobara bhi unhi ki taraf se honey do. '' (yani ham agar un logon ko maarein to suleh ke baad hamari taraf se ahad shikani hogi ye munasib nahi pahley kaafiron ki taraf se ahad shikani ho aik baar nahi 2 baar tab ham ko badla lena bura nahi ( aakhir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un logon ko maaf kar diya. tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ( وَهُوَ الَّذِي كَفَّ أَيْدِيَهُمْ عَنكُمْ وَأَيْدِيَكُمْ عَنْهُم بِبَطْنِ مَكَّةَ مِن بَعْدِ أَنْ أَظْفَرَكُمْ عَلَيْهِمْ Mina ( ۴۸ / fateh : ۲۴ ( akheer tak '' yani us Allah ne unke hathon ko roka tum se aur tumharey hathon ko roka unse Makka ki sarhad mein jab fateh de chuka tha tum ko un par. '' phir ham lautey Madina ko , raah mein aik manzil par utrey , jahan hamarey aur bani Lahyaan ke mushrikon ke beech mein aik pahaad tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki us shakhs ke liye jo us pahaad par chadh jaey raat ko aur pahra de aap ka aur aap ke ashaab kaa. Salma ne kaha : main raat ko us pahaad par 2 ya teen baar chadha (aur pahra deta raha), phir ham Madina mein pahunchey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni oontniyan apne Ribah ghulam ko din aur main bhi uske sath tha, Talha ka ghoda liye huey charaagaah mein pahunchaney ke liye un oontniyon ke sath, jab subah hui to Abdur-Rehman fazari (mushrik) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki oontniyon ko loot liya aur sabko haank ley gaya aur charwaahey ko mar dala. maine kaha : aey Ribaah! to ye ghoda ley aur Talha ke paas pahuncha de aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar karke kaafiron ne aap ki oontniyan loot lin, phir main aik teele par khada hua aur Madina ki taraf munh karke maine teen baar awaz di (ya sabaaha) baad iske main un luteron ke peechhey rawana hua teer maarta hua aur rajz padhta hua yani ''main Akwaa ka betaa hun aur aaj kameenon ki tabahi ka din hai.'' phir main kisi ke qareeb hota aur aik teer uski kaathi mein maarta jo uske kaandhey tak pahunch jata (kaathi ko cheer kar) aur kehta ye ley aur main Akwaa ka betaa hun aur aaj kameenon ki tabahi ka din hai, phir qism Allah ki main barabar teer maarta raha aur zakhmi karta raha jab unmein se koi sawar meri taraf laut-taa to main darakht ke taley aa kar uski jad mein baith jata aur aik teer maarta wo sawar zakhmi ho jata yahan tak ke wo pahaad ke tang rastey mein ghusey aur main pahaad par chadh gaya aur wahan se patthar maarna shuru kiye aur barabar unka peechha karta raha yahan tak ke koi oont jisko Allah Taala ne paida kya tha aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari ka tha na bacha jo mere peechhey na reh gaya aur luteron ne usko na chhod diya ho (to sab oont saiyedna Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse chheen liye) Salma ne kaha : phir main unke peechhey chala, teer maarta hua yahan tak ke tees chaadaron mein se zyada aur tees bhaalon se zyada unse chheenin wo apne tain halka kartey they (bhaagney ke liye) aur jo cheez wo phainktey main is par aik nishan rakh deta patthar ka taake Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab usko pehchan lein (ke ye ghaneemat ka maal hai aur usko ley lein) yahan tak ke wo aik tang ghaati mein aaey aur wahan unko badr fazari ka beta mila, wo sab baithey subah ka naashta karne lagey aur main aik chhoti teekri ki choti par betha. Fazari ne kaha : ye kon shakhs hai. wo boley us shakhs ne ham ko tang kar diya. qism Allah ki andheri raat se hamarey sath hai barabar teer maarey jata hai yahan tak ke jo kuchh hamarey paas tha sab chheen liya. fazari ne kaha : tum mein se char aadmi usko ja kar mar lein. ye sun kar char aadmi meri taraf chadhey pahaad par jab wo itney door aagey ke meri baat sun sakein to maine kaha : tum mujhey jantey ho. unhon-ne kaha : nahi, maine kaha : main Salma hun, Akwaa ka betaa (Akwaa unke dada they lekin dada ki taraf apne ko mansub kya b-wajah shohrat ke aur Salma ke bap ka naam Amr tha aur Aamir unke chacha they kyonkey wo Akwaa ke betey they) qism us zaat ki jisne buzurgi di Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh Mubarak ko main tum mein se jis ko chaahunga mar daalunga (teer se) aur tum mein se koi mujhey nahi mar sakta , unmein aik shakhs bola. ye aisa hi malum hota hai phir wo sab lautey. main wahan se nahi chala tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sawar nazar aaey jo darakhton mein ghus rahe they. sabse aagey Akhram Asadi they, unke peechhey abu-Qatada unke peechhey Miqdaad-bin-Aswad kandi. maine Akhram ke ghodey ki baag thaam li, ye dekh kar wo luterey bhaagey. maine kaha : aey Akhram tum unse bachey rehna aisa na ho ye tum ko mar daalein jab tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab na aa lein. unhon-ne kaha : aey Salma ! agar tujh ko yaqin hai Allah ka aur aakhirat ke din ka aur to janta hai ke jannat sach hai aur jahannam sach hai to mat rok mujh ko shahadat se. (yani bahut hoga to yahi ke main un logon ke hath Shahid hunga us se kya behtar hai) maine unko chhod diya, unka muqaabla hua Abdur-Rehman fazari , se Akhram ne iske ghodey ko zakhmi kya aur Abdur-Rehman ne barchhi se Akhram ko Shahid kya aur Akhram ke ghodey par chadh betha , itney mein saiyedna abu-Qatada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke shehsawaar aan pahunchey aur unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman ko barchhi mar kar qatl kya to qism uski jisne buzurgi di Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh Mubarak ko main unka peechha kiya gaya, main apne paon se aisa daud raha tha ke mujhey apne peechhey aap ka koi sahabi na dikhlai diya na unka ghubaar yahan tak ke wo luterey aaftaab doobney se pahley aik ghaati mein pahunchey jahan pani tha aur uska naam zi -Qard tha, wo utrey pani peeney ko piyaasey they, phir mujhey dekha, mein unke peechhey daudta chala aata tha aakhir maine unko pani par se hata diya wo aik qatra bhi na pi sakey, ab wo daudtey chaley kisi ghaati ki taraf. main bhi douda aur unmein se kisi ko paakar aik teer laga diya iske shaaney ki haddi main aur maine kaha : ley usko aur main betaa hun Akwaa ka aur ye din kameenon ki tabahi ka hai. wo bola ( Allah karey Akwaa ka betaa marey aur) uski maan is par roey . kya wahi Akwaa hai jo subah ko mere sath tha. maine kaha : haan aey dushman apni jaan ke wahi Akwaa hai jo subah ko terey sath tha. Salma-bin-Akwa ne kaha : un luteron ke 2 ghodey saqat ho gaey ( daudtey daudtey ( unhon-ne unko chhod diya aik ghaati mein, main un ghodon ko kheenchta hua Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya. wahan mujh ko Aamir miley aik chhaagal doodh ki pani mila hua aur aik chhaagal pani ki liye huey, maine wuzu kya aur doodh piyaa ( Allahu-akbar ! Salma-bin-Akwa ki himmat subah sawerey se daudtey daudtey raat ho gaee ghodey thak gaey, oont thak gaey, log mar gaey, asbaab reh gaya par Salma na thakey aur din bhar mein kuchh khaya na piyaa Allah jalle-jalalahu ki imdaad thi) phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us pani par they jahan se maine luteron ko bhagaaya tha. maine dekha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sab oont ley liye hain aur sab cheezein jo maine mushrikon se chheeni thin sab barchhi aur chaadrein aur saiyedna Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne un oonton mein se jo maine chheeni thi aik oont nehar kya aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye uski kaleji aur kohan bhoon rahe hain. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! dijiye mujh ko ijazat lashkar mein se so aadmi chun leney ki phir main luteron ka peechhaa karta hun aur unmein se koi shakhs baqi nahi rahe jo khabar de apni qaum ko ja kar (yani sab ko mar daalta hun) ye sun kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansey , yahan tak daadhein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khul gain angaar ki roshni mein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''aey Salma! to ye kar sakta hai.'' maine kaha : haan! qism uski jisne aapko buzurgi di. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''wo to ab Ghatfan ki sarhad mein pahunch gaey wahan unki mehmani ho rahi hai.'' itney mein aik shakhs aaya Ghatfan mein se. wo bola : falan shakhs ne unke liye aik oont kaata tha wo uski khaal nikal rahe they. itney mein unko gard malum hui. wo kehney lagey log aagey to wahan se bhi bhag khadey huey. jab subah hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''aaj ke din hamarey sawaaron mein behtar sawar abu-Qatada hain aur piyaadon mein sabse badh kar Salma-bin-Akwa hain.'' Salma ne kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh ko 2 hisse diye. aik hissey sawar ka aur aik hissey piyaadey ka aur donon mujh hi ko de diye. baad iske Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apne sath bithaya azba par Madina ko laut-tey waqt. ham chal rahe they ke aik Ansari jo daudney mein kisi se peechhey nahi rehta tha kehney laga koi hai jo Madina ko mujh se aagey daud jaey aur baar-baar yahi kehta tha jab maine uska kehna suna to us se kaha to buzurg ki buzurgi nahi karta aur buzurg se nahi darta. wo bola : nahi, albatta Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki buzurgi karta hun. maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! mere maan-baap aap par fida hon, mujhey chhod dijiye main us mard se aagey badhunga daud mein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''achchha agar tera ji chaahey.'' tab maine kaha, main aata hun teri taraf aur maine apna paon tedha kya aur kood pada phir main douda aur jab aik ya 2 chadhaao baqi rahe to dam ko sanbhaala phir jo douda to us se mil gaya. yahan tak ke aik ghoonsa diya maine uske donon moondhon ke beech mein aur maine kaha : qism Allah ki ab main aagey badha phir us se aagey pahuncha Madina ko (to malum hua ke muqaabla durust hai bila-ewaz aur b-ewaz mein khilaf hai) phir qism Allah ki ham sirf teen raat thahrey baad iske khaibar ki taraf nikley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath to mere chacha Aamir ne rajz padhna shuru kya. '' qism Allah ki agar Allah hidayat na karta to ham raah na patey aur na sadqa detey, na Namaz padhtey aur ham terey Fazal se be-parwaa nahi huey to jama rakh hamarey paon ko agar kaafiron se milen aur apni rehmat aur tasalli utaar hamarey uper. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''ye kon hai? '' logon ne kaha : Aamir . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''Allah bakhshey tujh ko .'' Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi ke liye khas taur par istighfar kartey to wo zaroor Shahid hota to saiyedna umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne pukara aur wo apne oont par they. ya Nabi Allah ! aap ne ham ko fayda kyon na uthaney diya Aamir se, saiyedna Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : phir jab ham khaibar mein aaey to uska badshah Marhab talwaar hilata hua nikla aur ye rajz padhta tha ki Khaibar ko malum hai ke main marhab hun pura hathiyar band bahaadur aazmooda kaar jab ladaaiyaan aaein sholey udaati hui.'' ye sun kar mere chacha Aamir nikley uske muqable ke liye aur unhon-ne ye rajz padha ki ""Khaibar janta hai ke main Aamir hun. hathiyar band ladai mein ghusney wala.'' phir donon ka eik-eik waar hua to marhab ki talwaar mere chacha Aamir ki dhaal par padi aur Aamir ne nichey se waar karna chaha to unki talwaar unhi ko aa lagi aur sheh-rag kat gaee usi se mar gaey. saiyedna Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : phir main nikla to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand ashaab ko dekha wo keh rahe hain Aamir ka amal laghw ho gaya us ne apne tain aap mar dala. ye sun kar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya rota hua. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Aamir ka amal laghw ho gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' kon kehta hai.'' maine kaha : aap ke ashaab kehtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : '' jhoot kaha jisne kaha balke usko dohra sawab hai.'' phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh ko saiyedna Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas bheja unki aankhen dukh rahi thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''main aisey shakhs ko jhanda doonga jo dost rakhta hai Allah aur uske rasool ko ya Allah aur rasool usko dost rakhtey hain.'' ( ibne- Hisham ki riwayat mein itna zyada hai ke Allah fateh dega uske hathon par aur wo bhaagney wala nahi) Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : phir main saiyedna Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya aur unko liya kheenchta hua unki aankhen dukh rahi thin yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley aaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki aankhon mein apna luaabe-dahan daal diya wo usi waqt achchhey ho gaey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko nishan diya aur marhab nikla aur kehney laga ‏‏‏‏قَدْ عَلِمَتْ خَيْبَرُ أَنِّى مَرْحَبُ شَاكِى السِّلاَحِ بَطَلٌ مُجَرَّبُ إِذَا الْحُرُوبُ أَقْبَلَتْ تَلَهَّبُ . saiyedna Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske jawab mein"
"4679","saiyedna Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai assii (80) aadmi Makka waley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke uper utrey taneem ke pahaad se, wo chahtey they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dhokaa dein aur ghafalat mein hamla karein. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko pakad liya aur qaid kiya, baad iske Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhod diya. tab Allah Taala ne is aayat ko utara :                     ( وَهُوَ الَّذِي كَفَّ أَيْدِيَهُمْ عَنْكُمْ )                                                                                                                                                          ''yani Allah wo hai jisne rokaa unke hathon ko tum se (aur unka faraib kuchh na chala (aur tumharey hathon ko unse (tum ne unko qatl na kiya ( Makka ki sarhad main tumharey fateh ho janey ke baad un par.''"
"4680","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Hunain ke din Hazrat Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik khanjar (apne paas rakh ( liya, wo unke sath tha, Hazrat abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey dekh liya to unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! ye Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) hain, inke paas aik khanjar hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse puchha : ye khanjar kaisa hai? unhon-ne kaha : maine ye isliye liya hai ke agar mushrikon mein se koi mere qareeb aaya to main is se uska pet chaak kar dun gii. (ye sun kar) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansney lagey. unhon-ne kaha : aey Allah ke rasool ! hamarey baad daayra Islam mein shamil honey waale, jinhein (fatah Makka ke din) maafi di gaee thi ( Hunain ke din) aapko chhod kar bhag gaey, unhein qatl karwaa dijiye. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Umme-Sulaim ! bila shubah Allah Taala kafi ho gaya ( unka bhagna jang haarney ka baais na bana (aur us ne ehsan farmaya. (ke hamein fateh ata kar di.)"
"4681","Ishaq-bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha ne (apne chacha (Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se (apni daadi ( Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ke waqiey ke hawale se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Sabit ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4682","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab jang kartey to Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) aur Ansar ki kuchh dusri aurton ko sath ley ja kar jang kartey, wo pani pilaatin aur zakhmiyon ki marham patti karti thin."
"4683","Abdul-Azeez-bin-Suhaib ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab ahad ka din tha, logon mein se kuchh log Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko chhod kar paspaa ho gaey aur Hazrat abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aik dhaal ke sath aad kiye huey they. abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) intihai quwwat se teer chalaney waley teer andaz they. unhon-ne us din do ya teen kamaanein todin. kaha : koi shakhs apne sath teeron ka tarkash liye huey guzarta to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey : usey abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke aagey phaila do. kaha : Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ka jaaiza leney ke liye jhank kar dekhtey to abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) arz kartey : Allah ke Nabi ! mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan ! jhank kar na dekhein. kahin dushman ke teeron mein se koi teer aapko na lag jaey. mera Sina aap ke Sina ke aagey dhaal bana hua hai. kaha : maine Hazrat Aaisha binte-abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) aur Hazrat Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha, un donon ne apne kapdey sametey huey they, mein unki pindliyon ke paazeb dekh raha tha. wo apni kamar par mishkeezey lekar aati thin. ( zakhmiyon ko pani pilaatey-pilaatey ( unke munh mein un ( mushkon ( ko khali kartin thin, phir wapas ho kar unhein bharti thin, phir aatin aur unhein logon ke munh mein farigh karti thin. us din oongh ( janey ( ki bina par abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke hathon se do ya teen martaba talwaar giri . (shadeed thakaan aur adh-jagey aalim mein bhi wo dhaal bin kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney khadey rahe.)"
"4684","Sulaiman-bin-Bilal ne hamein Jafar-bin-Muhammad se, unhon-ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Yazeed-bin-Hurmuz se riwayat ki ke) Maruf khaariji sardaar ( najda (bin-Aamir hanfi) ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se panch baatein malum karne ke liye khat likha . Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : agar ye dar na hota ke main ilm chipa raha hun to main usey jawab na likhtaa . najda ne unhein likha tha : ammaa ba'd ! mujhey bataiye : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aurton se madad letey huey jang kartey they? kya aap ghaneemat mein unka hissey rakhtey they? kya aap bachchon ko qatl kartey they? aur ye ke yateem ki yateemi Kab khatm hoti hai? us ne khums ke barey mein) bhi puchha ke) wo kis ka haq hai? to Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne uski taraf ( jawab ( likha : tum ne mujh se malum karne ke liye likha tha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aurton se madad letey huey jang kartey they? bila shubah aap unse jang mein madad letey they aur wo zakhmiyon ko marham lagaya karti thin aur unhein ghaneemat (ke maal) se maamooli sa Atiya diya jata tha. raha (ghaneemat ka baa-qaayda) hissey to wo aap ne unke liye nahi nikala. aur yaqinan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bachchon ko qatl nahi kartey they. lihaza tum bhi bachchon ko qatl na kiya karo. aur tum ne mujh se malum karne ke liye likha tha : yateem ki yateemi Kab khatm hoti hai? mujhey apni umr (ke Malik ( ki qism ! kisi aadmi ki dadhi nikal aati hai jabke abhi wo apne liye haq leney mein aur apni taraf se haq dene mein kamzor hota hai, jab wo apne liye theek tarah se huquq ley sakey jis tarah log letey hain to uski yateemi khatm ho jaeygi. aur tum ne mujh se khums ke barey mein malum karne ke liye likha tha ke wo kis ka haq hai? to ham kehtey they : wo hamara haq hai, lekin hamari qaum ne hamari ye baat manney se inkar kar diya."
"4685","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim donon ne hamein Hatim-bin-Ismail se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Jafar-bin-Muhammad se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Yazeed-bin-Hurmuz se riwayat ki ke najda ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko unse kuchh baatein poochhney ke liye khat likha .) aagey ( Sulaiman-bin-Bilal ki hadis ki tarah hai. magar Hatim ki hadis mein hai : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) yaqinan bachchon ko qatl nahi kartey they, lihaza tum bhi bachchon ko qatl na karo. siwaey-iske ke tumhen bhi isi tarah ilm hasil ho jaey jis tarah khizr (Alaihissalam) ko us bachchey ke barey mein ilm hua tha jisey unhon-ne qatl kiya tha. Ishaq ne Hatim se riwayat ki hui apni hadis mein ye izafa kiya : ( siwaey-iske ke) tum ( bachchon mein se) momin ka imtiyaz (farq) kar lo to kaafir ko qatl kar dena aur momin ko chhod dena (ye donon baatein kisi insan ke bas mein nahi jab tak Allah Taala na bataaey.)"
"4686","hamein ibne-abi-Umar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Ismail-bin-Umayya se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Saeed Maqbari se aur unhon-ne Yazeed-bin-Hurmuz se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : najda-bin-Aamir haroori ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf likha , wo unse us ghulam aur aurat ke barey mein poochh raha tha jo jang mein Sharik hotey hain. kya wo ghaneemat ki taqseem mein (bhi) Sharik hongey? aur bachchon ke qatl karne ke barey mein (poochha (aur yateem ke barey mein ke us se yateemii Kab khatm hoti hai aur rishteydaaron ke barey mein ke wo kon log hain? to unhon-ne Yazeed se kaha : uski taraf likho aur agar dar na hota ke wo kisi himaaqat mein pad jaeyga to main uski taraf jawab na likhtaa. (usey) likho : tum ne mujhey us aurat aur ghulam ke barey malum karne ke liye khat likha tha jo jang mein Sharik hotey hain : kya wo ghaneemat ki taqseem mein Sharik hongey ? haqiqat ye hai ke un donon ke liye kuchh nahi hai. siwaey-iske ke unhein kuchh Atiya de diya jaey. aur tum ne mujh se bachchon ko qatl karne ke barey mein poochhney ke liye likha tha, bila shubah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein qatl nahi kiya aur tum bhi unhein qatl mat karo, siwaey-iske ke tumhen un bachchon ke barey mein wo baat malum ho jaey jo Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) ke sathi ( khizr (Alaihissalam) ( ko us bachchey ke barey mein malum ho gaee jisey unhon-ne qatl kiya tha. aur tum ne mujh se yateem ke barey mein poochhney ke liye likha tha ke us se yateem ka laqab Kab khatm hoga? to haqiqat ye hai ke us se yateem ka laqab khatm nahi hota yahan tak ke wo baligh ho jaey aur uski bulooghat (samajhdaari ki umr ko pahunchne) ke barey pata chalney lagey. aur tum ne mujh se rishteydaaron ke barey mein poochhney ke liye likha tha ke wo kon hain? hamara khayal tha ke wo ham log hi hain. to hamari qaum ne hamari ye baat manney se inkar kar diya."
"4687","Abdur-Rehman-bin-Bishr-abdi ne hamein yahi hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Ismail-bin-Umayya ne Saeed-bin-abi-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Yazeed-bin-Hurmuz se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : najda ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf khat likha . padhi. aur unhon-ne usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah hadis bayan ki. Abu-Ishaq ne kaha : mujhey Abdur-Rehman-bin-Bishr ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne poori yahi hadis bayan ki."
"4688","Qais-bin-Sad ne mujhey Yazeed-bin-Hurmuz se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : najda-bin-Aamir ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf khat likha to main us waqt , jab Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne uska khat padha aur iska jawab likha , unke paas hazir tha. Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! agar ye ( khayal ( na hota ke) ghaaliban ( main usey kisi qabeeh amal mein pad janey se rok loonga to usey jawab na likhtaa. ye uski aankhon ki khushi ke liye nahi. kaha : to unhon-ne uski taraf likha : tum ne rishteydaaron ke hissey ke barey mein puchha tha, jiska Allah ne zikr farmaya hai ke wo kon hain? to hamara khayal ye tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qaraabat daar ham hi log hain ( lekin) hamari qaum ne hamari baat manney se inkar kar diya aur tum ne yateem ke barey mein puchha tha, uski yateemii Kab khatm hoti hai? to jab wo nikah ki umr ko pahunch jaey, uske samajhdaar ho janey ka pata chalney lagey aur uska maal iske hawale kiya ja sakey to us se yateemii khatm ho jaeygi. aur tum ne puchha tha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mushrekeen ke bachchon mein se kisi ko qatl kartey they? to bila shubah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unmein se kisi aik ko bhi qatl nahi kartey they aur tum bhi unmein se kisi ko qatl mat karnaa, siwaey-uske ke unke barey main tum ko bhi usi baat ka ilm ho jaey jiska us bachchey ke barey mein khizr (Alaihissalam) ko ilm hua jab unhon-ne usey qatl kiya tha. aur tum ne aurat aur ghulam ke barey mein puchha ke jab wo jang mein Sharik hon to kya unko bhi muqarrara hissey milega? waqia ye hai ke unka koi muqarrara hissey nahi, haan ye ke logon ki ghaneematon mein se unhein kuchh Atiya de diya jaey."
"4689","Mukhtar-bin-saifi ne Yazeed-bin-Hurmuz se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : najda ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf khat likha . padhi. aur unhon-ne hadis ka kuchh hissey bayan kiya aur unki tarah pura waqia bayan nahi kiya jinki hadisen ham ne ( uper ( bayan ki hain."
"4690","abdur-Raheem-bin-Sulaiman ne hamein Hisham (bin-Hassan ( se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hafsa binte-Sirin se aur unhon-ne Hazrat umme-Atiya ansariya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath saat (7) ghazawaat mein Sharik hui, mein peechhey unke khemon mein rehti thi. unke liye khana taiyaar karti , zakhmiyon ki marham patti karti aur mareezon ki dekh bhaal karti thi."
"4691","Yazid-bin-Harun ne Hisham-bin-Hassan se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4692","Shoba ne hamein Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki ke) ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se Kufa ke ameer ( Abdullah-bin-Yazeed (bin-Husain ( logon ke sath barish ki dua maangney ke liye nikley to unhon-ne do rakatein padhein , phir barish ki dua ki. kaha is din meri mulaqat Hazrat Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se hui. kaha : mere aur unke darmyan aik aadmi ke siwa koi na tha ya (kaha : ( mere aur unke darmyan ( bas ( aik aadmi tha to maine unse puchha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitni jangein ki? unhon-ne kaha : unnees (19). to maine puchha : aap ne unke sath kitni jangein ladein ? unhon-ne kaha : satrah jangein . maine puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sabse pahlaa jang kon sa tha? unhon-ne kaha : zaatul-usair ya zaatul-ushair."
"4693","Zuhair ne hamein Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis suni ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unnees ghazwey kiye aur hijrat ke baad aap ne sirf aik Haj kiya, iske siwa koi Haj nahi kiya, wo Hijjatul-wada tha."
"4694","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath unnees ghazawaat mein shirkat ki. Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main badr aur uhud mein Sharik nahi hua, mujhey mere walid ne rok diya tha, jab ( mere walid ( Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) Uhud ke din Shahid ho gaey to (iske baad) main kisi bhi ghazwey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath shirkat karne se peechhey nahi raha."
"4695","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Zaid-bin-Hubab ne hadis bayan ki, neez (isi ke saath) Saeed-bin-Muhammad Jarmi ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein abu-Tameela ne hadis bayan ki, un donon ( Zaid aur abu-Tameela ( ne kaha : hamein Husain-bin-Waqid ne Abdullah-bin-Barida se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unnees ghazwey kiye, aap ne unmein se aath (8) mein ladai ki Abu-Bakar ne ( unmein se) riwayat nahi kiya aur unhon-ne apni hadis mein kaha : mujhey Abdullah-bin-Barida ne hadis bayan ki."
"4696","Kahmas ne ibne-bareeda se aur unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath sola ghazawaat mein shirkat ki."
"4697","hamein Muhammad-bin-Ibad ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Hatim-bin-Ismail ne Yazeed-bin-abi-Ubaid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Salma (bin-Akwaa (Raziallahu anhu)) se suna, wo keh rahe they : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath saat (7) ghazawaat mein jang ki aur main un daston ke sath , jinhein aap rawaana farmatey they, nau (9) ghazawaat mein nikla . aik baar hamarey ameer Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) they aur aik baar Hazrat Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) . (pichhli hadis mein bayan ki hui tadaad sahi tar hai.)"
"4698","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed ne Hatim se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unhon-ne donon jagah saat (7) ghazawaat kahey ."
"4699","abu-Usama ne hamein bareed-bin-abi-burda se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Barda se aur unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik ghazwey mein nikley, ham chh: afraad they, ham sab ke liye oont aik ( hi ( tha, ham is par baari-baari sawar hotey they. kaha : hamarey pairon mein suraakh ho gaey, mere donon paon bhi zakhmi ho gaey aur mere naakhun gir gaey, ham apne paon par puraaney kapdon ke tukdey baandha kartey they, usi wjah se to us ghazwey ka naam zaatur-Riqaa' (dhajjiyon wali jang) pad gaya kyonke ham apne pairon par phatey puraaney kapdon ki dhajjiyaan baandha kartey they. abu-Barda ne kaha : Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye hadis bayan ki, phir usey ( bayan karne) ko na-pasand kiya jaisey wo ye baat na-pasand kartey hon ke unke amal ka koi aisa pahlu ho jiski unhon-ne tashheer (mash-hoor) ki ho. abu-Usama ne kaha : bareed ke ilawa kisi aur ne mujhey mazeed ye baat batai : aur Allah uski jazaa de."
"4700","Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi mohtarma Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badr ki taraf nikley, jab aap Wabra ke Harra par pahunchey to aik aadmi aa kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mila. uski jur'at aur bahaaduri ka bada charcha tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba ne usey dekha to khush huey, jab wo aapko mila to usne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : main isliye aaya hun ke aap ka sath dun aur aap ke sath ( ghaneemat mein se) hissey wsool karun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : kya tum Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par eman rakhtey ho? usne kaha : nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : to lot jao, mein kisi mushrik se hargiz madad nahi loonga. (Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : phir wo chala gaya, yahan tak ke jab ham darakht ke paas pahunchey to wo aadmi (doosri baar ( aapko mila aur aap se wahi baat kahi jo pehli martaba kahi thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi us se wahi kuchh kaha jo pehli martaba kaha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wapas ho jao, mein kisi mushrik se hargiz madad nahi loonga. kaha : wo wapas chala gaya aur beida ke maqam par aapko mila to aap ne us se wahi baat poochhi jo pehli baar poochhi thi : tum Allah aur uske rasool par eman rakhtey ho? usne kaha : ji haan. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey farmaya : to phir ( hamarey saath) chalo."
"4701","Abdullaah-bin-Muslima-bin-qa'nab aur Qutaiba-bin-Saeed ne Mughira hazaami se aur Zuhair-bin-Harab aur Amr Naqid ne Sufiyan-bin-Uena se ( Mughira aur Sufiyan ( donon ne abu-Zinad se unhon-ne Aaraj se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aur Zuhair ki hadis mein hai, unhon (Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu)) ne hadis ki nisbat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchai (aap se bayan ki) aur Amr ne kaha : (Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki : log us aham mamley ( hukumat ( mein Quraish ke taabea (matahat) hain, musalman , qureshi musalmanon ke peechhey chalney waley hain aur kaafir , qureshi kaafiron ke peechhey chalney waley hain."
"4702","Hammam-bin-Munabbah se riwayat hai, kaha : ye hai jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kiya, unhon-ne bahut si hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik hadis ye thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : log us mamley ( khilafat ya hukumat ( mein Quraish ke taabe (matehat) hain, musalman , qureshi musalmanon ke taabe hain aur kaafir , qureshi kaafiron ke peechhey chalney waley hain."
"4703","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : achai aur burai ( donon ( mein log Quraish ki pairwi kartey hain."
"4704","Hazrat Abdullah (bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tak (un ( logon mein do insan bhi baqi raheingey , hukumat ka muamla Quraish mein hoga."
"4705","Husain (bin-Abdur-Rehman ( ne Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke main apne walid (Hazrat Samra-bin-junaada (Raziallahu anhu)) ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : is baat ka khaatma us waqt tak na hoga jab tak usmein baara(12) ja-nashin na guzrein . phir aap ne koi baat ki jo mujh par waazeh na hui. maine apne walid se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya hai? unhon-ne kaha : aap ne farmaya hai : wo sab Quraish mein se hongey."
"4706","abdul-Malik-bin-Umair ne Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : logon ki imaarat jari rahegi yahan tak ke baara(12) ashkhaas unke wali banengey . phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi baat kahi jo mujh par waazeh na hui, maine apne walid se puchha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaayaa? unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo sab Quraish mein se hongey."
"4707","abu-Awana ne Samak se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis bayan ki, lekin unhon-ne ye bayan nahi kiya : logon ki imaarat ka silsila chalta rahega."
"4708","Hammaad-bin-Salma ne Samak se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : baara khaleefaon (ke ahad ( tak Islam ghalib rahega. phir aap ne aik kalima farmaya jis ko main nahi samajh saka , maine apne walid se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaayaa? unhon-ne kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo sab Quraish mein se hongey."
"4709","Dawud ne Shabi se, unhon-ne Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : baara khulafaa (ke ahad ( tak Islam ka ghalba jari rahega. phir aap ne koi baat kahi jis ko main nahi samajh saka , maine apne walid se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya? unhon-ne kaha : aap ne farmaya : wo sab Quraish mein se hongey."
"4710","Abdullah-bin-Aun ne Shabi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein gaya, mere sath mere walid they, maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : baara khulafaa (ke ahad ( tak musalsal ye Deen ghalib aur) dushmanon se) mehfooz rahega. phir aap ne koi kalima farmaya jisey logon ne mujhey sunney na diya, maine apne walid se puchha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya? unhon-ne kaha : aap ne farmaya : wo sab Quraish mein se hongey."
"4711","Hatim-bin-Ismail ne muhajir-bin-mismaar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aamir-bin-Sad-bin-abi-Waqas se riwayat ki, kaha : maine apne ghulam Naafe ke hath Hazrat Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas khat bheja ke aap mujhey koi aisi hadis likh bhejen jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni ho. unhon-ne mujhey likh bheja ke us Juma ke din jiski Sham ko Hazrat ( Maaiz ( Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ko rajm (sangsaar) kiya gaya tha, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya : qiyamat tak ye Deen qaaim rahega , ya jab tak musalmanon par baara (12) khulafaa hukumat karengey jo sab ke sab Quraish mein se hongey aur maine aapko ye farmatey huey suna : musalmanon ki aik chhoti si jamat Kisraa ya aale Kisraa ka safaid mahal fateh karegi aur maine aapko ye farmatey huey suna : qiyamat ke qareeb kuchh kazzaab (jhunte) zahir hongey unse bachna. aur maine aapko ye farmatey huey suna : jab Allah Taala tum mein se kisi ko koi achi cheez de to wo apne aur apne ghar walon se shuruat kare. aur maine aapko ye farmatey suna : main hauz par tumhara pesh-rau hunga ."
"4712","ibne-abi-Ze'ib ne muhajir-bin-mismaar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aamir-bin-Sad se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne ibne-Samra-adwi (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas paigham bheja ke aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jo hadis suni, wo hamein bayan kijiye . unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna. padhi. phir Hatim ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"4713","Hisham ke walid (Urwa) ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke jab mere walid (hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu)) zakhmi huey to main unke paas maujood tha. logon ne unki tareef ki aur kaha : Allah aapko achi jazaa de ! unhon (Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : main (eik hi waqt mein) raghbat rakhney wala aur darney wala hun. logon ne kaha : aap kisi ko apna (jaa-nashin) bana dijiye. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : main zindagi mein bhi tumharey maamlaat ka bojh uthaaoon aur marney ke baad bhi ? mujhey sirf ye khahish hai ke (qiyamat ke roz ( is khilafat se mere hissey mein ye aa jaey ke) hisab kitab ( barabar-sarabar ho jaey. na mere khilaf ho, na mere haq mein) chahey inaam na miley, magar saza se bach jaun ( agar main ja-nashin muqarrar karun to unhon-ne muqarrar kiya jo mujh se behtar they, yani Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) aur agar main tumhen aisey hi chhod dun to unhon-ne tumhen (jaa-nashin muqarrar kiye baghair) chhod diya jo mujh se ( bahut zyada ( behtar they. yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zikr kiya to maine jaan liya ke wo ja-nashin muqarrar nahi karengey."
"4714","Salim ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kiya, kaha : main Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke paas gaya. unhon-ne kaha : kya tum ko ilm hai ke tumharey walid kisi ko) apna ( ja-nashin muqarrar nahi kar rahe? maine kaha : wo aisa nahi karengey. wo kehney lagin : wo yahi karne waley hain. Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine qism khaai ke main is mamley mein unse baat karunga, phir main khamosh ho gaya yahan tak ke subah ho gaee aur maine unse is mamley mein baat nahi ki thi, aur mujhey aisa lagta tha jaisey maine apne daain hath mein pahaad uthaya hua hai) mujh par apni qism ka bahut zyada bojh tha). aakhir kaar main wapas aaya aur unke paas gaya. unhon-ne mujh se logon ka haal malum kiya. main aapko halaat se ba-khabar karne laga, phir maine unse kaha : maine logon se aik baat suni thi aur wo sun kar maine qism khaai ke wo main aap se zaroor bayan karunga . logon ka khayal hai ke aap kisi ko apna ja-nashin nahi banaaein gey aur baat ye hai ke agar aap ka koi oonton ya bakriyon ka charwaha ho aur wo aap ke paas chala aaey aur unko aisey hi chhod de to aap yahi kahengey ki usne unko zaaya kar diya hai. so logon ki nigahbaani to us se zyada zaroori hai. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko meri raey theek malum hui, unhon-ne ghadi bhar sar jhukaaey rakha , phir meri taraf sar utha kar farmaya : bila shubah izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah apne Deen ki hifazat farmaeyga aur agar main kisi ko ja-nashin na banaun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi ko ja-nashin muqarrar nahi kiya tha. aur agar main kisi ko ja-nashin banaun to Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ja-nashin banaya tha? ( donon mein se kisi bhi misal par amal kiya ja sakta hai.) unhon (Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka zikr kiya to maine jaan liya ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke tareeqey se kabhi nahi hatein gey aur wo kisi ko ja-nashin banaaney waley nahi."
"4715","Jareer-bin-Haazim ne kaha : hamein Hasan Basri ne aur unhein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya : Abdur-Rehman ! imaarat talab na karna kyonke agar tum ko talab karne se ( imaarat ( mili to tum uske hawale kar diye jaogey ( uski tamam tar zimma dariyaan khud uthao gey , Allah ki madad shamil na hogi) aur agar tumhen maangey baghair mili to ( Allah ki taraf se) tumhari madad hogi."
"4716","yoonus-bin-ubaid , Mansoor , Humaid aur Hisham-bin-Hassan sab ne Hasan Basri se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdur-Rehman-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Jarir ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4717","bareed-bin-Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne abu-Barda se, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa ( Ash-ari ( (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main aur mere chacha ke beton mein se do aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey, un donon mein se aik ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! Allah Taala ne aap ki tauliyat mein jo diya uske kisi hissey par hamein ameer bana dijiye. doosrey ne bhi yahi kaha, aap ne farmaya : Allah ki qism ! ham kisi aisey shakhs ko us kaam ki zimme-dari nahi detey jo usko talab karey, na aisey shakhs ko banatey hain jo uska khahish mand ho."
"4718","Humaid-bin-Hilal ne kaha : mujhey abu-Barda ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main banu-ash'ar mein se do aadmiyon ke sath Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aik meri daain taraf tha aur doosra meri baain taraf. un donon ne kisi mansab (ohdey) ka sawal kiya, us waqt Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) miswak kar rahe they, aap ne farmaya : abu-Musa ! ya farmaya : Abdullah-bin-Qais ! tum kiya kehtey ho? maine kaha is zaat ki qism jisne aapko haq ke sath maboos kiya hai ! un donon ne mujhey ye nahi bataya tha ke unke dil mein kiya hai? aur na mujhey ye pata tha ke ye donon mansab ka sawal karengey. Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aisa lagta hai ke main ( aaj bhi) aap ke hont ke nichey miswak dekh raha hun jabke aap ka hont uper ko simtaa hua tha. aap ne farmaya : jo shakhs khahish mand hoga ham usey apne kisi kaam ki zimme-dari nahi ya ( farmaya : ( hargiz nahi dengey lekin abu-Musa ! ya farmaya : Abdullah-bin-Qais ! tum (zimme-dari sanbhaalney ke liye) chaley jao . to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein Yaman bhej diya. phir ( sath hi ( unke peechhey Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhej diya, jab Hazrat Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) unke paas pahunchey to Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tashrif laaiye aur unke baithney ke liye aik gaddaa bichhaya, to wahan us waqt aik shakhs rassiyon se bandhaa hua tha, unhon (Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu)) ne puchha : ye kon hai? (Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : aik Yahudi tha, phir ye musalman ho gaya aur ab phir apne Deen (burai ke deen) par lot gaya hai aur Yahudi ho gaya hai. Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main us waqt tak nahi baithoon ga jab tak usko qatl na kar diya jaey, yahi Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka faisla hai. Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : haan , ( ham usko qatl kartey hain) aap baithiye , Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main us waqt tak nahi baithoon ga jab tak us shakhs ko qatl nahi kar diya jata jo Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka faisla hai, teen ( martaba yahi mukaalma (baat-cheet) hua) Hazrat abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne hukm diya, us shakhs ko qatl kar diya gaya, phir un donon ne aapas mein raat ke qiyam ke barey mein guftgu ki. donon mein se aik (yani (Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : jahan tak mera mamla hai, main sota bhi hun aur qiyam bhi karta hun aur main apne qiyam mein jis ajr ki ummeed rakhta hun apni neend mein bhi usi ( ajr ( ki tawaqqo rakhta hun."
"4719","ibne-Hujaira akbar ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! kya aap mujhey aamil nahi banaaengey? aap ne mere kandhey par hath mar kar farmaya : Abu-Zar! tum kamzor ho, aur ye (amaarat) amanat hai aur qiyamat ke din ye sharmindagi aur ruswai ka baais hogi, magar wo shakhs jisne usey haq ke mutabiq qabool kya aur is mein jo zimme-dari is par Aaiz hui thi usey (achi tarah) ada kya. (wo sharmindagi aur ruswai se mustashna hoga.)"
"4720","abu Salim jeeshaani ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Abu-Zar ! main dekhta hun ke tum kamzor ho aur main tumharey liye wahi cheez pasand karta hun jisey apne liye pasand karta hun, tum kabhi 2 aadmiyon par ameer na banna aur na yateem ke maal ke mutwalli banna."
"4721","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba, Zuhair-bin-Harab aur ibne-Numair teenon ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Amr-bin-Dinar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Amr bin Aus se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, ibne-Numair aur Abu-Bakar ne kaha : unhon-ne is hadis ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kya, Zuhair ki hadis mein hai) Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : adl karne waley Allah ke yahan Rehman azz-w-jall ki daain taraf noor ke membaron par hongey aur uske donon hath daaein hain, ye wahi log hongey jo apne faislon, apne ahal w ayaal aur jinke ye zimme daar hain unke mamley mein adl kartey hain."
"4722","ibne- Wahab ne kaha : mujhey Hurmala ne Abdur-Rehman bin shamasa se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas kisi masley ke barey mein poochhney ke liye gaya. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne puchha : tum kin logon mein se ho? maine kaha : main Misr walon mein se hun. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne puchha : tumhara Hakim haaliya jang ke doran main tumharey sath kaisa raha? maine kaha : hamein uski koi baat buri nahi lagi, agar ham mein se kisi shakhs ka oont mar jata to wo usko oont de deta, aur agar ghulam mar jata to wo usko ghulam de deta aur agar kisi ko kharch ki zarurat hoti to wo usko kharch deta. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya : mere bhai Muhammad-bin-abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ke mamley mein us ne jo kuchh kya wo mujhey us se nahi rok sakta ke main tumhen wo baat sunaun jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne is ghar mein kehtey huey suni, ( farmaya : (aey Allah ! jo shakhs bhi meri ummat ke kisi mamley ka zimme daar baney aur un par sakhti karey, to is par sakhti farma, aur jo shakhs meri ummat ke kisi mamley ka zimmedaar bana aur unke sath narmi ki, to uske sath narmi farma."
"4723","Jareer-bin-Haazim ne Hurmala misri se, unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman bin abi Shimasa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4724","Leis ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : sun rakho ! tum mein se har shakhs Hakim hai aur har shakhs se uski riaya ke mutaalliq sawal kya jaeyga, so jo ameer logon par muqarrar hai wo raai (logon ki bahbood ka zimmedaar) hai us se uski riaya ke mutaalliq puchha jaeyga aur mard apne ahale-khaana par raai (zimmedar) hai, us se uski riaya (zemmedari) ke mutaalliq sawal hoga aur aurat apne shauhar ke ghar aur uske bachchon ki raai hai, us se unke mutaalliq sawal hoga aur ghulam apne Malik ke maal mein raai hai, us se iske mutaalliq sawal kya jaeyga, sun rakho! tum mein se har shakhs raai hai aur har shakhs se uski riaya ke mutaalliq puchha jaeyga."
"4725","Ubaidullah-bin-Umar, Ayub, Suhak bin Usman aur Usama (bin Zaid Lesi ( sab ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah hadis bayan ki jis tarah Leis ne Naafe se bayan ki."
"4726","Ubaidullah (bin Umar-bin Hafs ( ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah hadis bayan ki jis tarah Leis ne Naafe se bayan ki."
"4727","Ismail bin Jafar ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Dinar se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Salim bin-Abdullah se, unhon-ne apne walid ( Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna, ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se Naafe ki hadis ki tarah .) Yunus ne) Zohri ki hadis mein ye izafa kya : kaha : main samajhta hun ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aadmi apne bap ke maal ka raai (zemmedar) hai aur us se uski riaya (zimmedari) ke mutaalliq sawal kya jaeyga"
"4728","Basar-bin-Saeed ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske ham-mana hadis riwayat ki hai."
"4729","abu-Ash'hab ne Hazrat Hasan Basri se riwayat ki ke Ubaidullaah-bin-Ziyaad Hazrat Maaqil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas us marz mein unki iyaadat karne ke liye gaey jis mein unki wafat hui. Hazrat Maaqil (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : main tum ko aik aisi hadis sunata hun jis ko maine khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, agar mujhey (pakka) ilm hota ke main abhi aur zinda rahunga to main tumhen ye hadis na sunata, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : koi shakhs jis ko Allah Taala ne kisi bhi raiyat ka zimmedaar banaya wo jis din marey us haal mein marey ke wo apni riaya ke sath khayanat karne wala hai to Allah Taala is par jannat haram kar dega."
"4730","Yunus ne Hazrat Hasan Basri se riwayat ki, kaha : ibne- Ziyad Hazrat Maaqil (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya wo us waqt ( bimar they aur) dard mein mubtala they, jaisey abu-Ash'hab ki hadis hai aur unhon-ne izafa kya is (ibne- Ziyad) ne kaha : aap ne aaj se pahley mujhey ye hadis kyon nahi bayan ki? Hazrat Maaqil (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : maine tumhen kabhi hadis nahi sunai, (tum ne hadis ka samaa hi nahi kya (ya farmaya : main tumhen hadis bayan nahi kya karta tha (hadis main tumhara ustad na tha.)"
"4731","abu-Maleeh se riwayat hai ke Ubaidullaah-bin-Ziyaad, Hazrat Maqil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) ki bimari mein unke paas gaya, Hazrat Maaqil (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main tum ko aik hadis bayan karne laga hun aur agar main marzul-maut mein na hota to tumhen ye hadis na sunata, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai : koi ameer nahi jo musalmanon ke maamlon ka zimmedaar ho, phir unke liye jiddo-juhad aur khairkhaahi na karey, magar wo unke sath jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"4732","Suwada bin abu-Aswad ne khabar di ke mere walid ne mujhey hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Maaqil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) bimar ho gaey to Ubaidullaah-bin-Ziyaad unki iyaadat ke liye gaya. (aagey) Hasan Basri ki Hazrat Maaqil (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah hai."
"4733","Hasan Basri (Rehmatullahi-alaih) ne bataya ke Aaiz bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se they, Ubaidullaah-bin-Ziyaad ke paas gaey aur farmaya : mere betey ! maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : badtareen raai (zimmedar), sakht geer aur zulm karne wala hota hai, tum us se bachna ke tum unmein se ho. usne kaha : aap baithiye : aap to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se chhalni mein bach janey waley aakhiri hissey ki tarah hain. (aakhir mein chunkey tinkey, patthar, bhoosi bach jatey hain, isliye) unhon-ne kaha : kya unmein bhoosi, tinkey, patthar they? ye to unke baad huey aur unke ilawa dusron mein huey."
"4734","Ismail bin Ibrahim ne abu-Hayyan se, unhon-ne abu-Zura se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham main ( khutba dene ke liye) khadey huey aur aap ne maale-ghanimat mein khiyanat ka zikr farmaya : aap ne aisi khayanat aur uske mamley ko intihai sangeen qarar diya, phir farmaya : main tum mein se kisi ko qiyamat ke din is tarah aata hua na paon ke uski gardan par oont sawar hokar bilbila raha ho aur wo kahey : Allah ke rasool! meri madad farmaiye, aur main jawab mein kahun : main tumharey liye kuchh karne ka ikhtiyar nahi rakhta, maine tumhen (duniya hi mein) haq pahuncha diya tha. main tum mein se kisi shakhs ko is haal mein na paon ke wo qiyamat ke din aaey aur uski gardan par ghoda Sawar ho kar hinhinaa raha ho, wo kahey : Allah ke rasool! meri madad kijiye, aur main kahun ke main tumharey liye kuchh bhi nahi kar sakta , maine tumhen haq pahuncha diya tha. main tum mein se kisi shakhs ko is haal mein na paon ke wo qiyamat ke din aaey aur uski gardan par bakri Sawar ho kar mimiya rahi ho, wo kahey : Allah ke rasool! meri madad kijiye, aur main kahun : main tumharey liye kisi cheez ka ikhtiyar nahi rakhta , maine tumhen haq se aagah kar diya tha, main tum mein se kisi shakhs ko roze-qiyamat is haalat mein na dekhun ke uski gardan par kisi shakhs ki jaan Sawar ho aur wo ( zulm ki duhaai detey huey) cheekhein mar rahi ho, aur wo shakhs kahey : Allah ke rasool! meri madad kijiye , aur main kahun : main tumharey liye kuchh nahi kar sakta, maine tumhen sab kuchh bata diya tha. main tum mein se kisi shakhs ko us haal mein na paon ke wo qiyamat ke din aaey aur uski gardan par kapda lada hua phad-phada raha ho, aur wo kahey : Allah ke rasool! meri madad kijiye, main kahun : tumharey liye mere bas mein kuchh nahi, maine tum ko sab kuchh se aagah kar diya tha. main tum mein se kisi shakhs ko is haal mein na paon ke wo qiyamat ke din aaey aur uski gardan par na bolney wala maal (sona chandi) lada hua ho, wo kahey : Allah ke rasool! meri madad kijiye , main kahun : tumharey liye mere paas kisi cheez ka ikhtiyar nahi, maine tum ko) anjam ( ki khabar pahuncha di thi."
"4735","Abdur-Rahim bin Sulaiman ne abu-Hayyan se, Jarir ne unse aur Ammara-bin-Qaqa se, un sab ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se abu-Hayyan se Ismail ki riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"4736","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne Ayub se, unhon-ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maale-ghanimat mein khayanat ka zikr farmaya aur uski sangini bayan ki aur unhon ( Ayub ( ne poori hadis bayan ki. Hammad ne kaha : phir iske baad maine Yahya-bin-Saeed ko yahi hadis bayan kartey huey suna. unhon-ne jyon ka tyon isi tarah hadis bayan ki jis tarah hamein Ayub ne unse bayan ki thi."
"4737","hamein Abdul-Waris ne bayan kya, kaha : hamein Ayub ne Yahya-bin-Saeed bin hayyan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera se un sab ki hadis ki tarah hadis riwayat ki."
"4738","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid aur ibne-abi-Umar ne hadis bayan ki, alfaz abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ke hain. padhi. kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Zohri se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Urwa se, unhon-ne abu-Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banu-Asad ke aik shakhs ko jisey ibne-Lutbiya kaha jata tha, aamil muqarrar kya. padhi. Amr aur ibne-abi-Umar ne kaha : zakat ki wsooli par (muqarrar kya). padhi. jab wo (zakat wsool karke) aaya to usne kaha : ye aap logon ke liye hai aur ye mujhey hadiya kya gaya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par khadey huey, Allah Taala ki hamd w sana bayan ki aur farmaya : aik aamil ka haal kya hota hai ke main usko ( zakat wsool karne) bhejta hun aur wo aa kar kehta hai : ye aap logon ke liye hai aur ye mujhey hadiya kya gaya hai, aisa kyon na hua ke ye apne bap ya apni maa ke ghar mein baithta, phir nazar aata ke usey hadiya diya jata hai ya nahi? us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! tum mein se koi bhi shakhs aisa nahi ke wo us (maal ( mein se (apne liye) kuchh ley , magar wo qiyamat ke din is haalat mein aayega ke usne usey apni gardan par utha rakha hoga, qiyamat ke din oont hoga, bilbila raha hoga, gaaey hogi, dakraa rahi hogi, bakri hogi, mimiya rahi hogi. phir aap ne apne donon hath is qadr buland kiye ke hamein aap ki donon baghlon ke safaid hissey nazar aaey, phir aap ne 2 martaba farmaya : aey Allah ! kya maine ( haq ( pahuncha diya?"
"4739","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Urwa se, unhon-ne abu-Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Aazad ke ibne- (Lutbiya) naam ke aik shakhs ko zakat (ki wsooli) par aamil banaya, wo kuchh maal lekar aaya, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko diya aur kaha : ye aap logon ka maal hai aur ye hadiya hai jo mujhey diya gaya hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : tum apne bap ya apni maa ke ghar mein kyon nahi baithey, phir dekhtey ke tumhen hadiya diya jata hai ya nahi ? phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba dene ke liye khadey huey, phir Sufiyan (bin Uena ( ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya."
"4740","Hisham ne apne walid se, unhon-ne abu-Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banu-Asad ke aik shakhs ko banu-Sulaim ke sadqaat wsool karne ke liye aamil banaya, usey ibne-Lutbiya kaha jata tha. jab wo maal wsool karke aaya to (Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) iske sath hisab kya. wo kehney laga : ye aap logon ka maal hai aur ye hadiya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar tum sachey ho to apne bap ya apni maa ke ghar mein ja kar kyon na baith gaey taake tumhara hadiya tumharey paas aa jata. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein khutba diya, Allah Taala ki hamd w sana ki, phir farmaya : amma baad! main tum mein se kisi shakhs ko kisi aisey kaam par aamil banata hun jiski tauliyat ( intizam ( Allah Taala ne mere sipurd ki hai aur wo shakhs aata hai aur kehta hai ke ye tum logon ka maal hai aur ye hadiya hai jo mujhey mila hai. wo shakhs agar sachcha hai to apne bap ya apni maa ke ghar mein kyon na baith gaya taake uska hadiya uske paas aata, Allah ki qasam! tum mein se jo shakhs bhi us maal mein se koi cheez apne haq ke baghair lega, wo qiyamat ke din Allah Taala ke samney us haal mein pesh hoga ke wo cheez usne apni gardan par utha rakhi hogi, main tum mein se kisi bhi shakhs ko zaroor pehchan loonga jo Allah Taala ke samney is haal mein pesh hoga ke usne oont uthaya hoga jo bilbila raha hoga, ya gaaey utha rakhi hogi jo dakra rahi hogi, ya bakri uthai hogi jo mimiya rahi hogi, phir aap ne apne donon hathon ko itna uper uthaya ke aap ki baghlon ki safedi nazar aaney lagi, (us waqt) aap farma rahe they : aey Allah! kya maine (tera paigham) pahuncha diya? (abu-Hameed Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ye sab) meri aankhon ne dekha aur mere kanon ne suna."
"4741","Abda, ibne-Numair aur abu-Muawia, isi tarah abdur-Raheem bin Sulaiman aur Sufiyan sab ne isi sanad ke sath Hisham se riwayat ki. Abda aur ibne-Numair ki hadis mein hai : jab wo aaya to (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) uske sath hisab kya, jis tarah abu-Usama ne kaha aur ibne-Numair ki hadis mein ye (bhi) hai : tum logon ko zaroor pata chal jaeyga, Allah ki qasam! us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai! tum mein se koi bhi shakhs jo us (maal) mein se koi cheez lega. Sufiyan ki hadis mein ye izafa hai : meri aankh ne dekha aur mere donon kanon ne suna. (hazrat abu-Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan kartey huey) kaha : tum log Hazrat Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se poochh lo, wo bhi mere sath maujood they."
"4742","Abdullah-bin Zakwan yani abu-Zinad se riwayat hai unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se, unhon-ne abu-Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko sadqaat par aamil muqarrar kya, wo bahut zyada maal lekar aaya aur kehney laga : ye aap logon ka hai aur ye mujhey bataur hadiya mila hai, phir usi (pichhli hadis ki) tarah bayan kya. Urwa ne kaha : maine Hazrat abu-Humaid Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : kya aap ne ye hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni? unhon-ne kaha : baraahe-raast aap ke dahane-mubarak se apne kanon tak (aati hui awaz se suni.)"
"4743","Wakee bin-Jarraah ne kaha : hamein Ismail-bin-abi-Khalid ne Qais-bin abi Hazim se hadis sunai, unhon-ne Hazrat Adi-bin Umaira kandi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : ham tum mein se jis shakhs ko kisi kaam par aamil muqarrar karein aur wo aik sui ya us se badi koi cheez ham se chipa ley to ye khayanat hogi, wo shakhs qiyamat ke din usey sath lekar aayega. (hazrat Adi (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : main dekh raha tha, (ye baat sun kar) Ansar mein se kaley rang ka aik aadmi khada hua aur kehney laga : ya Rasulullah ! aap mujh se apna kaam wapas ley lijiye! aap ne farmaya : tumhen kya hua? usne kaha : maine aapko is-is tarah farmatey huey suna hai (main us waeed se darta hun.) aap ne farmaya : main ab bhi yahi kehta hun ke ham tum mein se jis shakhs ko kisi kaam ka aamil banaaein wo har chhoti aur badi cheez ko lekar aaey, uske baad usmein se jo cheez usko di jaey wo ley-ley aur jo cheez us se rok li jaey us se door rahe.'"
"4744","Abdullah-bin-Numair, Muhammad-bin-Bishr aur abu-Usama sab ne kaha : hamein Ismail ne isi sanad ke sath usi ke mutabiq hadis bayan ki."
"4745","Fazal bin-Musa ne kaha : hamein Ismail bin abi Khalid ne hadis sunai, kaha : hamein Qais-bin abi Hazim ne khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Adi-bin Umaira kandi (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna, un sab ki hadis ki tarah."
"4746","ibne-Juraij ne bayan kya ke Quran Majeed ki aayat : aey eman waalo! Allah ki itaat karo aur rasool ki itaat karo aur unki jo tum mein se ikhtiyar waley hain Hazrat Abdullah-bin Huzafa bin Qais-bin Adi Sehmi (Raziallahu anhu) ke mutaalliq nazil hui hai, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein aik lashkar main (ameer bana kar) rawana kya tha (ibne-Juraij ne kaha) mujhey Yala bin Muslim ne Saeed-bin-Jubair se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki."
"4747","Mughira bin Abdur-Rehman ne abu-Zanad se, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne meri itaat ki usne Allah ki itaat ki aur jisne meri nafarmani ki usne Allah ki nafarmani ki aur jisne ameer ki itaat ki usne meri itaat ki aur jisne ameer ki nafarmani ki usne meri nafarmani ki."
"4748","ibne-Uena ne abu-Zinad se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, unhon-ne ye bayan nahi kya : jisne ameer ki nafarmani ki us ne meri nafarmani ki."
"4749","Yunus ne khabar di ke unhein ibne-Shahab ne khabar di, kaha : hamein abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat bayan ki, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne meri itaat ki us ne Allah ki itaat ki aur jisne meri nafarmani ki us ne Allah ki nafarmani ki aur jisne mere ( muqarrar karda ( ameer ki itaat ki us ne meri itaat ki aur jisne mere ameer ki nafarmani ki us ne meri nafarmani ki."
"4750","Ziyad (bin Sad ( se riwayat hai, unhon-ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, bilkul usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah ."
"4751","abu-Awana aur Shoba ne Yala bin Ata se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Alqama se ( hadis) suni , unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se pichhli hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4752","Mamar ne Hammam-bin-Munabba se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un sab ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4753","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke Maula ( aazad karda ghulam ( abu Yunus ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi ( hadis) riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jisne ameer ki itaat ki farmaya, mere ameer ki nahi farmaya, Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se Hammam ki riwayat ki hui hadis mein bhi isi tarah hai."
"4754","Abu-Saleh as-samaan se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum par (ameer ka hukm ( sunna aur maanna wajib hai, apni mushkil (ki kaifiyat ( mein bhi aur apni aasani mein bhi, apni khushi mein bhi aur apni naakhushi mein bhi aur us waqt bhi jab tum par) kisi aur ko) tarjeeh di ja rahi ho."
"4755","ibne-Idrees ne hamein Shoba se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Imran se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Samit se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mere khaleel (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey wasiiyat farmai thi ke main ( ameer ki baat ( sunoon aur itaat karun chahey wo ( ameer ( katey huey aa'za (angon) wala ghulam hi kyon na ho."
"4756","Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur Nazar-bin-Shumail ne hamein Shoba se, unhon-ne abu-Imran se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur hadis mein kaha : chahey wo (ameer) katey huey aazaa (angon) wala habshi ghulam ( hi kyon na ho. ("
"4757","Ubaidullah ke walid Muaz ne hamein Shoba se aur unhon-ne abu-Imran se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, jis tarah ibne-Idrees ne kaha : katey huey aaza (angon) wala ghulam ( hi kyon na ho. ("
"4758","Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne kaha : Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hamein Shoba se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Yahya bin Husain se, unhon-ne kaha : maine apni daadi se suna, wo bayan karti thin ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hijjatul-wada ke doran mein khutba de rahe they aur aap farma rahe they : agar tum par aik ghulam ko Hakim banaya jaey aur wo kitabullah ke mutabiq tumhari rehnumai karey to uski baat suno aur itaat karo."
"4759","ibne-Bashar ne hamein yahi hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur Abdur-Rehman-bin-Mehdi ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis sunai aur kaha : habshi ghulam ho."
"4760","Wakee bin-Jarraah ne hamein Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : katey huey aaza wala habshi ghulam ho."
"4761","Behaz ne hamein Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki : unhon-ne katey huey aaza wala habshi ghulam nahi kaha, aur ye izafa kya : unhon (umme-Husain (Raziallahu anhu)) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Mina ya Arafaat mein suna."
"4762","Zaid-bin-abi-Unaisa ne Yahya bin Husain se, unhon-ne apni daadi Hazrat Umme- Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke maine unhein kehtey huey suna : maine Hijjatul-wada main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Haj kya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bahut si baatein irshad farmain, phir maine aapko ye farmatey huey suna : agar tum par aik katey huey aaza (angon) wala ghulam, mera guman hai aap ne kala bhi kaha, Hakim bana diya jaey aur wo tum ko kitabullah ke mutabiq chillaey to uski baat suno aur itaat karo."
"4763","Leis ne Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : musalman shakhs par Hakim ki baat sunnaa aur uski itaat karna wajib hai, wo baat usko pasand ho ya na-pasand , siwaey iske ke usey gunah ka hukm diya jaey, agar usey gunah ka hukm diya jaey to usmein na sunnaa (jayaz) hai na maanna."
"4764","Yahya qattaan aur Abdullah-bin-Numair donon ne Ubaidullah se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4765","Zubeda ne Sad bin Ubeda se, unhon-ne abu-Abdur-Rehman se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik lashkar bheja aur aik shakhs ko unka ameer banaya, us ( ameer ( shakhs ne aag jalaai aur logon se kaha : usmein dakhil ho jao . kuchh logon ne usmein dakhil honey ka irada kar liya aur kuchh logon ne kaha : ham aag hi se to bhaagey hain, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us waqiey ka zikr kya gaya to aap ne un logon se jo aag mein dakhil hona chahtey they, farmaya : agar tum aag mein dakhil ho jatey to qiyamat tak usi mein rahtey aur dusron ke haq main achi baat farmai aur farmaya : Allah Taala ki gunah (nafarmani) mein kisi ki itaat nahi, itaat sirf neki mein hai."
"4766","hamein Muhammad-bin-Abdullah bin Numair, Zuhair-bin-Harab aur abu-Saeed ashajj ne hadis bayan ki, alfaz sab ke miltey-jultey hain, ( teenon ne) kaha : hamein Wakee ne Aamash se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Sad bin Ubeda se, unhon-ne abu Abdur-Rehman se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik lashkar bheja aur Ansar mein se aik aadmi ko unka ameer banaya aur lashkar ko ye hukm diya ke wo uske ehkaam sunein aur uski itaat karein, ( ittifaq se) ahale-lashkar ne kisi baat mein ameer ko naraz kar diya, usne kaha : mere liye lakdiyan jama karo. lashkar ne lakdiyan jama kin, phir usne kaha : aag jalaao , unhon-ne aag jalaai, phir kaha : kya tum ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera hukm sunney aur manney ka hukm nahi diya tha? unhon-ne kaha : kyon nahi, usne kaha : aag mein dakhil ho jao, unhon-ne aik doosrey ki taraf dekha aur kaha : ham aag hi se bhag kar to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey they. wo usi mauqif par qaaim rahe yahan tak ke uska ghussa thanda ho gaya aur aag bujhaa di gaee, jab wo lautey to ye baat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai , aap ne farmaya : agar ye log us ( aag ( mein dakhil ho jatey to phir us se bahar na nikaltey, itaat sirf Maruf (qaabile-qabool kaamon) mein hai."
"4767","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Wakee aur abu-Muawia ne Aamash se isi sanad se isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4768","hamein abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abdullah-bin-Idris ne Yahya-bin-Saeed aur Ubaidullah-bin-Umar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ubada bin Waleed se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne unke dada se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath is baat par bait ki ke mushkil mein aur aasani main aur khushi mein aur naakhushi main aur khud par tarjeeh diye janey ki sura mein bhi sunengey aur itaat karengey aur is baat par bait ki ke jinke paas amaarat hogi, amaarat ke mamley mein unse tanaaza nahi karengey aur ham jahan kahin bhi hongey (hamesha) haq kahengey aur Allah ke (deen par chalney ke) mamley mein kisi malaamat karne waley ki malaamat se nahi darengey."
"4769","yahi hadis hamein ibne-Numair ne bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abdullah-bin-Idris ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein ibne- Ajlan, Ubaidullah-bin-Umar aur Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Ubada bin Waleed se isi sanad se usi jaisi hadis bayan ki."
"4770","Yazeed bin haad ne Ubada bin Waleed bin Ubada-bin-Samit, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey mere walid ne riwayat ki, kaha : ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath bait ki, ibne-Idrees ki hadis ki tarah."
"4771","Junaada bin abi Umaya se riwayat hai, kaha : ham Hazrat Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas hazir huey, wo (is waqt) bimar they, ham ne kaha : Allah Taala aapko sihat ata farmaey, ham ko aisi hadis sunaaiye jis se hamein fayda hua aur jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni ho, (hazrat Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham ko bulaya, ham ne aap ke sath bait ki, aap ne ham se jin chizon par bait li wo ye thin ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se khushi aur naakhushi main aur mushkil aur aasani main aur ham par tarjeeh diye janey ki sura mein, sunney aur itaat karne par bait ki aur is par ke ham iqtidaar ke mamley mein uski ahliyat rakhney walon se tanaaza nahi karengey. kaha : haan, agar tum usmein khullam khulla kufr dekho jiske (kufr honey par) tumharey paas (Quran aur sunnat se) waazeh aasaar maujood hun."
"4772","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ‌(sl) ne farmaya ‌ : imam sipar (dhaal) hai iske peechhey musalman ladtey hain ‌ ( kaafiron se) aur uski wjah se log bachtey hain takalluf se (zaalimon se aur luteron se). phir agar wo hukm karey Allah se darney ka aur insaf karey to usko sawab hoga aur jo uske khilaf hukm de dey to is par wabaal hoga."
"4773","Shoba ne hamein Furaat Qazzaz se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Hazim se riwayat ki ke main panch saal Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ka ham majlis raha, maine unko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye hadis bayan kartey huey suna : bani-Israel ke anbiya unka ijtimaai nizaam chalaatey they, jab aik Nabi faut hota to doosra Nabi iska ja-nashin hota aur (ab) bila shubah mere baad koi Nabi nahi, ab khulafa hongey aur kasarat se hongey. sahaba ne kaha : aap hamein kya hukm detey hain? aap ne farmaya : pahley aur uske baad phir pahley ki bait ke sath wafaa karo, unhein unka haq do aur (tumharey huquq ki) jo zimme-dari unhein di hai iske mutaalliq Allah khud unse sawal karega."
"4774","Hasan-bin-Furaat ne apne walid se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4775","Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ab mere baad) kuchh logon se) tarjeehi sulook hoga aur aisey kaam hongey jinhein tum bura samjhogey. sahaba ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! ham mein se jo shakhs un halaat ka saamna karey uske barey mein aap ka kya hukm hai? aap ne farmaya : tum par (hukkaam ka ( jo haq hai tum usko ada karna aur jo tumhara haq hai wo tum Allah se maangna."
"4776","Abdur-Rehman bin abd rabe-kaba se riwayat hai main masjid mein gaya wahan Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) Kaba ke saaye mein baithey they aur log unke paas jama they mein bhi gaya aur betha. unhon-ne kaha ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they aik safar main to aik jagah utrey, koi apna dera durust karne laga, koi teer maarney laga, koi apne janwaron mein tha ke itney main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke pukarney waley ne awaz di Namaz ke liye ikattha ho jao. ham sab aap ke paas jama huey. aap ne farmaya mujh se pahley koi Nabi aisa nahi guzra jis par zaroori na ho apni ummat ko jo behtar baat usko malum ho batana aur jo buri baat ho us se daraana aur tumhari ye ummat iske pahley hisse mein salamati hai aur akheer hissey mein bula hai aur wo baatein hain jo tum ko buri lagengi aur aisey fitney aawengey ke aik fitna doosrey ko halka aur patlaa kar dega (yani baad ka fitna pahley se aisa badh kar hoga ke pahla fitna uske samney kuchh haqiqat na rakhega) aur aik fitna aawega to momin kahega ismein meri tabahi hai phir wo jata rahega aur doosra aawega momin kahega ismein meri tabahi hai. phir jo koi chahey ke jahannam se bachey aur jannat mein jaawey usko chahiye ke marey Allah Taala aur pichhley din par yaqin rakh kar aur logon se wo sulook karey jaisa wo chahta ho ke log us se karein aur jo shakhs kisi imam se bait karey aur usko apna hath de dewey aur dil se niyat karey uski taabedaari ki to uski itaat karey agar taqat ho. ab agar doosra imam us se ladney ko aawey to (usko mana karo agar na maaney baghair ladai ke to) uski gardan maaro. ye sun kar main Abdullah ke paas gaya aur unse kaha, main tum ko qism deta hun Allah ki tum ne ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai? unhon-ne apne kanon aur dil ki taraf ishara kya hath se aur kaha mere kanon ne suna aur dil ne yad rakha. maine kaha tumharey chacha ke betey Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ham ko hukm kartey hain aik doosrey ka maal nahaq khaney ke liye aur apni jaanon ko tabah karne ke liye aur Allah farmata hai ''aey eman waalo apne amwaal ko naajaaiz tareeqey se na khaao siwaey iske ke aisi tijarat ho jo baahami raza-mandi se ki jaey aur na apni jaanon ko qatl karo beshak Allah tum par raham farmanewala hai.'' ye sun kar Abdullah-bin Amr-bin-al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) thodi der tak chup rahe phir kaha Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki itaat karo us kaam mein jo Allah ke hukm ke muwafiq ho aur jo kaam Allah Taala ke hukm ke khilaf ho usmein Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ka kehna na maano."
"4777","Wakee aur abu-Muawia donon ne Aamash se isi sanad se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4778","Aamir ne Abdur-Rehman bin abde-rabe-kaba Saaidi se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Kaba ke paas aik majma dekha, phir Aamash ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya."
"4779","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hamein Shoba se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Qatada se suna, wo Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne Hazrat Usaid-bin-Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik Ansari ne tanhai main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat ki aur kaha : kya jis tarah aap ne falan shakhs ko aamil banaya hai mujhey aamil nahi banaaengey? aap ne farmaya : mere baad tum khud ko (doosron par) tarjeeh ( dene ka mamla ( dekhogey tum is par sabr kartey rehna , yahan tak ke hauze-kausar par mujh se aan milo. ( wahan tumhen meri shafaat par us sabr w tahammul ka be panah ajr milega. ("
"4780","hamein Khalid-bin Haris ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba bin Hajjaj ne Qatada se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo Hazrat Usaid-bin-Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke aik Ansari ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se tanhai mein baat ki, usi (pichhli hadis) ki tarah."
"4781","Muaz ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath hadis sunai aur ye nahi kaha is ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se tanhai mein baat ki."
"4782","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Samak-bin-Harab se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Alqama bin Waail hizrami se, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke Salma bin Yazeed jaufi (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kya aur kaha : Allah ke Nabi! aap kaisey dekhtey hain ke agar ham par aisey log hukmaraan banein jo ham se apne huquq ka mutalba karein aur hamarey haq hamein na dein to is sura mein aap hamein kya hukm detey hain? aap us se bachey, us ne dobara sawal kya, aap ne phir munh pher liya, phir jab us ne dusri ya teesri baar sawal kya to usko Ashas bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne kheench liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : suno aur itaat karo kyonke jo zimme-dari unko di gaee iska baar un par hai aur jo zimme-dari tumhen di gaee hai, uska bojh tum par hai."
"4783","Shababa ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Samak se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki aur kaha : Ashas bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne us (poochhney waale) ko kheencha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : suno aur itaat karo, jo zimme-dari un par dali gaee uska bojh un par hai aur jo tum par dali gaee iska bojh tum par hai."
"4784","Huzefa bin Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bhali baton ko puchha kartey aur main buri baat ko poochhta us dar se ke kahin burai mein na pad jaun. maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! ham jahiliyat aur burai mein they phir Allah ne ham ko ye bhalai di (yani Islam ( ab iske baad bhi kuchh burai hai? aap ne farmaya : haan lekin usmein dhabba hai. maine kaha wo dhabba kaisa? aap ne farmaya aisey log hongey jo meri sunnat par nahi chalengey aur mere tareeqe ke siwa aur raah par chalengey, unmein achi baatein bhi hongi aur buri bhi. maine arz kya phir iske baad burai hogi? aap ne farmaya haan aisey log paida hongey jo jahannam ke darwazey ki taraf logon ko bulaawengey, jo unki baat maanega usko jahannam mein daal dengey. maine kaha ya Rasulullah! un logon ka haal ham se bayan farmaiye? aap ne farmaya unka rang hamara sa hi hoga aur hamari hi zaban bolengey. maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! agar us zamane ko main paon to kya karun? aap ne farmaya musalmanon ki jamat ke sath reh aur unke imam ke sath reh. kaha agar jamat aur imam na hon? aap ne farmaya to sab firqon ko chhod de aur agarche aik darakht ki jad daant se chabaata rahe martey dam tak."
"4785","Huzefa bin Yaman (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! ham burai mein they phir Allah Taala ne bhalai di ab iske baad bhi kuchh burai hai? aap ne farmaya : haan. maine kaha phir iske baad bhalai hai aap ne farmaya haan maine kaha phir iske baad burai ? aap ne farmaya haan. maine kaha kaisey ? aap ne farmaya mere baad wo log Hakim hongey jo meri raah par na chalengey , meri sunnat par amal nahi karengey aur unmein aisey log hongey jinke dil shaitan ke se aur badan aadmiyon ke se hongey. maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! us waqt main kya karun? aap ne farmaya agar to aisey zamane mein ho to sun aur maan Hakim ki baat ko agarche wo teri peeth phodey aur tera maal le-ley par uski baat suney ja aur uska hukm maanta reh."
"4786","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs Hakim ki itaat se bahar ho jaawey aur jamat ka sath chhod de phir wo marey to uski maut jahiliyat ki si hogi aur jo shakhs andhey jhandey ke taley ladey (jis ladai ki durusti shariat se saaf-saaf Sabit na ho) ghussa ho qaum ke lihaaz se ya bulata ho qaum ki taraf ya madad karta ho qaum ki aur khuda ki razamandi maqsud na ho phir maara jaawey to uska maara jana jahiliyat ke zamaney ka sa hoga aur jo shakhs (meri ummat par) dast daraazi karey aur achchhey aur buron ko unmein ke qatl karey aur momin ko bhi na chhodey aur jis se ahad hua ho iska ahad pura na karey to wo mujh se ilaqa nahi rakhta aur main us se talluq nahi rakhta (yani wo musalman nahi hai)."
"4787","tarjama wahi hai jo uper guzra."
"4788","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs itaat se nikal jaawey aur jamat chhod de phir marey to uski maut jahiliyat ki si hogi, aur jo shakhs takleef deney waaley jhandey ke taley maara jaawey jo ghussa hota ho qaum ke paas se aur ladtaa ho qaum ke khayal se wo meri ummat mein se nahi hai aur jo meri ummat par nikley maarta hua unke nekon aur badon ko, kisi momin ko bhi na chhodey, jisse ahad ho wo bhi pura na karey to wo meri ummat mein nahi hai."
"4789","tarjama wahi hai jo uper guzra ."
"4790","Ibne-Abbas (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs apne Hakim se buri baat dekhey wo sabr karey isliye ke jo jamat se baalisht bhar juda ho jaawey uski maut jahiliyat ki maut hogi."
"4791","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs apne Hakim se buri baat dekhey wo sabr karey kyonke jo koi badshah se baalisht bhar juda ho phir marey usi haal mein, uski maut jahiliyat ki si maut hogi."
"4792","Jundub bin-Abdullah bijli (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs andhey jhandey ke taley maara jaawey aur wo bulata ho tassub aur qaumi tarafdaar ki taraf ya madad karta ho qaumi ta'ssub ki to uska qatl jahiliyat ka sa hoga."
"4793","Naafe se riwayat hai Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Abdullah-bin mutee ke paas aaey jab Harra ka waqia hua Yazeed bin Muawiya ke zamane mein us ne Madina munawara par lashkar bheja aur Madina waley Harra mein jo aik maqam hai Madina se mila hua qatl huey is tarah ke zulm Madina walon par huey. Abdullah-bin mutee ne kaha abu Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) (ye kunniyat hai Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki) ke liye to shak (gadda) bichhaao. unhon-ne kaha, main isliye nahi aaya ke baithun balke aik hadis tujh ko sunaney ke liye aaya hun jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni hai, aap farmatey they jo shakhs apna hath nikal ley itaat se wo qiyamat ke din khuda se milega aur koi daleel uske paas na hogi aur jo shakhs mar jaawey aur kisi se us ne bait na ki ho to uski maut jahiliyat ki si hogi."
"4794","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra."
"4795","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra ."
"4796","Shoba ne Ziyad bin Ilaqa se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Arfaja (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jald hi fitnon par fitney barpa hongey, to jo shakhs is ummat ke mamley (nizame-saltanat) ko tukdey-tukdey karna chahey jabke wo muttahid ho to usey talwaar ka nishana bana do, wo jo koi bhi ho, so ho."
"4797","abu-Awana , Sheban 'Israel' Abdullah-bin Mukhtar aur aik aadmi jiska Hammad ne naam liya tha, un sab ne Ziyad bin Ilaqa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Arfaja (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat bayan ki, magar un sab ki hadis mein : usey qatl kar do ke alfaz hain."
"4798","abu Yaafoor ne Hazrat Arfaja (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jab tumhara nizaam ( hukumat ( aik shakhs ke zimmey ho, phir koi tumharey ittihaad ki laathi ko todney ya tumhari jamat ko muntashir karne ke iraadey se aagey badhey to usey qatl kar do."
"4799","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab 2 khaleefon ke liye bait li jaey to unmein se doosrey ko qatl kar do."
"4800","Hammam bin Yahya ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Hasan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne zaba bin Mohsin se, unhon-ne Ummul-Momenin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jald hi aisey hukmaraan hongey ke tum unhein (kuchh kaamon mein) sahi aur (kuchh mein) ghalat paogey jisne (unki rehnumai mein) nek kaam kiye wo bari thehra aur jisne (unke ghalat kaamon se) inkar kar diya wo bach gaya lekin jo har kaam par razi hua aur (unki) pairwi ki (wo na bari hua na bach saka) sahaba ne kaha : kya ham unse jang na karein? aap ne farmaya : nahi, jab tak ke wo Namaz padhtey rahen (jang na karo)"
"4801","Hisham dustwaai ne Qatada se riwayat ki, kaha : hamein Hasan ne zaba bin Mohsin Anzi se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya mohtarma Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : tum par aisey ameer lagaey jaeinge jin main tum achchhaiyan bhi dekhogey aur buraaiyan bhi, jisne ( burey kaamon ko) na-pasand kya, wo buri ho gaya, jisne inkar kya wo bach gaya, magar jisne pasand kya aur peechhey laga (wo bari hua na bach saka.) sahaba ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! kya ham unse ladai na karein, aap ne farmaya : nahi, jab tak wo Namaz padhtey rahen. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka maqsad tha jisne dil se na-pasand kya aur dil se bura jaana."
"4802","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne kaha : hamein Mu-alla bin Ziyad aur Hisham ne Hasan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne zaba bin Mohsin se, unhon-ne Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : pichhli hadis ki tarah, albatta us hadis mein ye alfaz hain : jisne inkar kya, wo bari ho gaya aur jisne na-pasand kya, wo bach gaya."
"4803","ibne-Mubarak ne Hisham se, unhon-ne Hasan se, unhon-ne zaba-bin-Mohsin se, unhon-ne Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : phir usi ki tarah bayan kya, siwaey in alfaz ke : jisne pasand kya aur peechhey laga ye alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"4804","Yazeed bin Yazeed bin Jaabir ne Ruzaiq-bin-Hayyan se, unhon-ne Muslim-bin-Qarza se, unhon-ne Hazrat Auf bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey behtreen imam (khaleefa) wo hain jin se tum mohabbat karo aur wo tum se mohabbat karein, tum unke liye dua karo aur wo tumharey liye dua karein aur tumharey badtareen imam wo hain jin se tum bughz rakho aur wo tum se bughz rakhein, tum un par laanat karo aur wo tum par laanat karein. kaha gaya : Allah ke rasool! kya ham unko talwaar ke zor se phenk ( hata ( na dein? aap ne farmaya : nahi, jab tak ke wo tum mein Namaz qaaim kartey rahen aur jab tum apne hukmaraanon mein koi aisi cheez dekho jisey tum na-pasand kartey ho to uske amal ko na-pasand karo aur uski itaat se dastkash na ho."
"4805","Dawood-bin-rushaid ne kaha : hamein Waleed-bin-Muslim ne hadis sunai, kaha : hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Yazeed-bin-Jaabir ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey banu-Fazara ke aazad karda ghulam razeeq-bin-hayyaan ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Auf-bin-Malik Ashjai (Raziallahu anhu) ke chacha zaad Muslim-bin-Qarza se suna, wo keh rahe they : maine Hazrat Auf-bin-Malik Ashjai (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : tumharey behtreen imam ( hukmaraan ( wo hain jin se tum mohabbat karo aur wo tum se mohabbat karein, tum unke liye dua karo aur wo tumharey liye dua karein aur tumharey badtareen imam wo hain jin se tum bughz rakho aur wo tum se bughz rakhein aur tum un par laanat karo aur wo tum par laanat karein. (hazrat Auf-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : sahaba ne kaha : kya ham aisey mauqe par unka dat kar muqaabla na karein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi, jab tak wo tum mein Namaz qaaim kartey rahen , nahi, jab tak wo tum mein Namaz qaaim kartey rahen. sun rakho ! jis par kisi shakhs ko Hakim banaya gaya, phir us ne us Hakim ko Allah ki kisi gunah (nafarmani) mein mubtala dekha to wo Allah ki us ma'siyat (nafarmani)  ko bura janey aur uski itaat se hargiz hath na kheenchey. ibne- Jaabir ne kaha : maine Ruzeq se, jab unhon-ne mujhey ye hadis bayan ki, puchha : abu Miqdam ! main tum ko Allah ki qism deta hun, waqei unhon-ne ye hadis aapko bayan ki, ya aap ne Muslim-bin-Qarza se suni, jabke wo keh rahe they ke unhon-ne Auf (bin-Malik ( (Raziallahu anhu) se suni aur wo ye keh rahe they : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sunaa? kaha : to wo ( Ruzeq ( do zaanu baith gaey aur qibley ki taraf munh kar liya aur kaha is zaat ki qism jiske siwa koi ibadat ke laaiq nahi ! maine ye hadis Muslim-bin-Qarza se suni , wo keh rahe they : maine Auf-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna, wo keh rahe they : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna."
"4806","Ishaq-bin-Musa Ansari ne kaha : hamein Waleed-bin-Muslim ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein ibne- Jaabir ne isi sanad se khabar di aur kaha : banu-Fazara ke aazad karda ghulam razeeq. Imam Muslim ne kaha : ye hadis Muawiya-bin-Saleh ne bhi Rabee-bin-Yazeed se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Muslim-bin-Qarza se, unhon-ne Auf-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4807","Leis ne abu-Zubair se, unhon-ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Hudaibiya ke din ham aik hazaar char sau they, ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath par bait ki aur Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik darakht ke nichey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hath thaam rakha tha. wo babool ( keekar (ka darakht tha. Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ham ne is baat par aap se bait ki ke ham faraar na hongey aur ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath par maut ki bait nahi ki."
"4808","Sufiyan ne abu-Zubair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mar janey par bait nahi ki, ham ne aap se is baat par bait ki thi ke ham faraar na hongey."
"4809","Muhammad-bin-Hatim ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Hajjaj ne ibne-Juraij se hadis sunai, kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unse puchha gaya tha ke Hudaibiya ke din aap logon ki tadaad kitni thi? unhon-ne kaha : ham chaudah sau they. ham ne aik darakht ke nichey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki jabke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne aap ka hath thaam rakha tha. wo babool ka darakht tha, ham sab ne aap se bait ki siwaey jad-bin-Qais Ansari ke , (us ne aap se bait nahi ki) wo apne oont ke pet ke nichey chhup gaya."
"4810","mujhey Ibrahim-bin-Dinar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sulaiman-bin-majaalid ke aazad karda ghulam Hujjaj-bin-Muhammad Aawar ne hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unse sawal kiya gaya tha : kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zul-Hulaifa mein bait li thi? unhon-ne kaha : nahi, albatta aap ne wahan Namaz padhi thi aur Hudaibiya ke darakht ke siwa aap ne kisi aur darakht ke nichey bait nahi li. ibne-Juraij ne kaha : unhein abu-Zubair ne ye bataya ke Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ye kehtey they ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hudaibiya ke kuwein par dua ki thi."
"4811","Amr ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Hudaibiya ke din ham aik hazaar char sau they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya : aaj tum poori zamin ke behtreen afraad ho. Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : agar main dekh sakta to main tum ko us darakht ki jagah dikhata."
"4812","Amr-bin-Murra ne Saalim-bin-abi-Jaad se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se ashaab shajra (baite-rizwan karne walon ki tadaad (ke mutaalliq poochha, to unhon-ne kaha : agar ham aik laakh bhi hotey to wo (pani) hamein kafi hota lekin ham ( taqriban ( aik hazaar panch sau log they."
"4813","Husain ne Saalim-bin-abi-Jaad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke agar ham aik laakh bhi hotey to wo (pani) hamein kafi hota lekin ham ( taqriban ( pandarah sau they."
"4814","Aamash ne kaha : mujhey Saalim-bin-abi-Jaad ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha is din aap log kitney they? unhon-ne kaha : aik hazaar char sau. (yani bait karne waley)"
"4815","Ubaidullah ke walid Muaz ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Umra-bin-Murra se hadis sunai, kaha : mujhey Hazrat Abdullah-bin-abi-Ufa (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke ashaab shajra terah (13) sau they aur qabila Aslam ke log muhajireen ka aathwan hissey they. (unhon-ne ye tadaad andaazey se batai.)"
"4816","Abu-Dawud aur Nazar-bin-Shumail ne Shoba se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4817","Khalid ( Hazza ( ne hukm-bin-Abdullah-bin-Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ma'qil-bin-Yasaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine (baite-rizwan ke din apne aapko us haalat mein dekha ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon se bait ley rahe they aur maine us darakht ki shakhon mein se aik shaakh ko aap ke sar anwar se uper utha rakha tha, ham us waqt chaudah sau they. unhon-ne kaha : ham ne (is mauqe par) aap se maut par bait nahi ki thi, ham ne ye bait ki thi ke ham faraar nahi hongey."
"4818","Yunus ne isi sanad se, yani hukm-bin-Abdullah se riwayat ki."
"4819","abu-Awana ne Tariq se, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se riwayat ki, kaha : mere walid bhi un logon mein se they jinhoney darakht ke nichey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait ki thi. unhon-ne kaha : jab ham agley saal Haj ke liye gaey to hamein uski jagah nahi mili , agar tum logon ko wo jagah malum ho gaee hai to tum log zyada jaanney waley ho."
"4820","Sufiyan ne taariq-bin-Abdur-Rehman se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke (baite-rizwan ke saal wo log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, phir agley saal wo log us darakht ko bhool chukey they."
"4821","Qatada ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : maine wo darakht dekha tha, phir main iske baad wahan gaya to main us darakht ko na pehchan saka."
"4822","Hatim-bin-Ismail ne Hazrat Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) ke Maula Yazeed-bin-Ubaid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke Hudaibiya ke din tum logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath kis cheez par bait ki thi? unhon-ne kaha : maut par."
"4823","Hammad-bin-Masada ne kaha hamein Yazeed ne Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ‌ ‌ se usi ki manind (tarah) hadis bayan ki hai."
"4824","Ibad-bin-Tameem ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : unke paas koi shakhs aaya aur kehney laga : ibne-Hanzala logon se bait ley rahe hain? puchha : kis cheez par? kaha : maut par. kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad kisi shakhs ke sath is baat par bait nahi karunga."
"4825","Yazeed-bin-abi-Ubaid ne Hazrat Salma-bin-Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke wo Hajjaj ke paas gaey, usne kaha : ibne-Akwaa ! kya aap wapas pichhli ravish par lot gaey hain, baadiya mein rehney lagey hain? unhon-ne kaha : nahi (pichhli ravish par nahi lota ( lekin mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baadiya mein rehney ki ijazat di thi."
"4826","Ismail-bin-Zakariya ne Aasim ahwal se, unhon-ne abu-Usman nehdi se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Hazrat mujaashea'-bin-Masood Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai, kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hijrat par bait karne ke liye aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : hijrat ki bait karne walon ka waqt guzar gaya, albatta Islam , jihad aur khair par bait ( jaaiz ( hai."
"4827","Ali-bin-Mus'hir ne Aasim se, unhon-ne abu-Usman se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey mujaashea'-bin-Masood Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di, kaha : main apne bhai abu-Ma'bad (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath fateh (Makka) ke baad Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! is se hijrat par bait ley lijiye, aap ne farmaya : hijrat walon ke sath hijrat (ka marhala ( guzar gaya. maine kaha : phir aap kis baat par us se bait lengey ? aap ne farmaya : Islam , jihad aur khair par. abu-Usmaan ne kaha : meri Hazrat abu Mabad (Raziallahu anhu) se mulaqat hui to maine unko Hazrat mujaashea' (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha is ne sach kaha hai."
"4828","Muhammad-bin-Fuzail ne Aasim se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, kaha : main Hazrat majaashea' (Raziallahu anhu) ke bhai se mila, unhon-ne kaha is ne sach kaha, abu-Ma'bad (Raziallahu anhu) ka zikr nahi kiya."
"4829","Jarir ne Mansoor se, unhon-ne Mujahid se, unhon-ne Taaus se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : fateh ke din jab Makka fateh hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ab hijrat nahi hai, lekin jihad aur niyat hai aur jab tum ko jihad ke liye bulaya jaey to niklo."
"4830","Sufiyan , Mufazzal-bi-muhalhil aur Israel , sab ne Mansoor se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4831","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hijrat ke mutaalliq sawal kiya gaya, aap ne farmaya : fateh (Makka) ke baad hijrat nahi hai, lekin jihad aur niyat hai aur jab tum ko jihad ke liye bulaya jaey to niklo."
"4832","Waleed-bin-Muslim ne kaha : hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Amr Auzai ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey ibne-Shahab Zohri ne hadis sunai, kaha : mujhey Ata-bin-Yazeed Lesi ne hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne un sab ko hadis sunai, kaha : Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey hadis bayan ki ke aik dehati ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hijrat ke mutaalliq sawal kiya. aap ne farmaya : tum par afsos ! hijrat ka mamla to bahut mushkil hai. kya tumharey paas kuchh oont hain? usne kaha : haan , aap ne farmaya : kya tum unki zakat ada kartey ho? usne kaha : haan , aap ne farmaya : paaniyon ( chashmon , daryaon , samandaron wghaira) ke paar ( rahtey huey) amal kartey raho to bila shubah Allah Taala tumharey kisi amal ko hargiz rayegaan (bekar) nahi karega ."
"4833","Muhammad-bin-Yousuf ne Auzai se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki magar unhon-ne kaha : bila shubah Allah Taala tumharey amal mein se kisi cheez ko zaaya nahi karega aur ye izafa kiya, aap ne farmaya : jis din oontniyan pani peeney ke liye ( ghaat ya chashmey par) aati hain to kya tum ( zarurat mandon , miskinon , musaafiron ko pilaaney ke liye) unka doodh dohtey ho? usne kaha : haan."
"4834","Younus-bin-Yazeed ne kaha : ibne-Shahab ne kaha : mujhey Urwa-bin-Zubair ne bataya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya mohtarma Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : musalman auratein jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aatin to Allah ke us farman ke mutabiq unka imtihaan liya jata : aey Nabi ! jab aap ke paas musalman auratein aaein, aap se is par bait karein ke wo kisi ko Allah ka Sharik nahi banaein gi, na chori karengi aur na zina karengi aayat ke aakhir tak. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : momin aurton mein se jo aurat in baton ka iqrar kar leti , wo imtihaan ke zariey se iqrar karti ( maslan : unse sawal kiya jata : kya tum shirk nahi karo gi? to agar wo kehtin : nahi karengi , to yahi unka iqrar hota, aayat ke aakhiri hissey tak isi tarah imtihaan aur iqrar hota. (aur jab wo un baton ka iqrar kar letin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unse farmatey : jao, main tum se bait ley chuka hun. Allah ki qism ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hath kabhi kisi aurat ke hath ko nahi laga balke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke sath baat karke bait kartey they. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse un baton ke ilawa kisi cheez ka ahad nahi liya jinka Allah Taala ne aapko hukm diya tha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheli kabhi kisi aurat ki hatheli se ragdi nahi, aap jab unse bait letey to zabani farma detey : maine tum se bait ley li."
"4835","Imam Malik ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein aurton ki bait ke mutaalliq bataya , kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi kisi aurat ko apne hath se nahi chhuwa , albatta aap unse ( zabani ( ahad letey they aur jab wo ahad kar letin to aap farmatey : jao, maine tum se bait ley li."
"4836","Abdullah-bin-Dinar ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, keh rahe they : ham sunney aur itaat karne par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait kartey they aur aap ham se farmatey they : ( kaho : ( jiski mujhey istitaat (taqat) hogi."
"4837","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne Naafe se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Uhud ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jang (ke mamley) mein mera muaayna farmaya, us waqt meri umr chaudah saal thi, aap ne mujhey ( jang mein shumooliyat ki) ijazat nahi di aur Khandaq ki jang ke din mera muaayna farmaya jabke mein pandarah baras ka tha to aap ne mujhey ijazat de di. Naafe ne kaha : jis zamaney mein Umar-bin-Abdul-Azeez khaleefa they maine unke paas ja kar ye hadis bayan ki to unhon-ne kaha : ye sagheer ( nabaligh (aur kabir ( baligh (ke darmyan had ( faasil ( hai. phir unhon-ne apne aamilon ko likh bheja ke jo shakhs pandarah saal ka ho uska ( pura ( hissey muqarrar karein aur jo us se kam ka ho usko bachchon mein shumaar karein. (uske mutabiq wazeefa dein.)"
"4838","Abdullah-bin-Idris , abdur-Raheem-bin-Sulaiman aur abdul-wahaab Saqafi sab ne Ubaidullah se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar unki hadis mein hai : aur jab main chaudah saal ka tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey kam-sin qarar diya."
"4839","Imam Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dushman ke mulk mein Quraan Majeed ko sath lekar safar karne se mana farmaya."
"4840","Leis ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is khof ki bina par ke dushman ke hath lag jaeyga, dushman ki sarzameen mein Quraan Majeed ko sath lekar safar karne se mana farmatey they."
"4841","Hammad ne Ayub se, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Quraan ke sath safar na karo, kyonke mujhey is baat par itminan nahi ke wo dushman ke hath lag jaeyga Ayub ne kaha : Quraan Majeed dushman ke hath lag gaya to wo Quraan Majeed ke zariey se ( usey aad bana kar) tumharey sath muqaabla karega."
"4842","Ismail-bin-Ulaih , Sufiyan aur Saqafi sab ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki, Ayub aur Suhak-bin-Usman ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki. ibne-Ulaih aur Saqafi ki hadis mein hai : mujhey khof hai aur Sufiyan aur Suhak-bin-Usman ki hadis mein hai : is khof se ke dushman ke hath lag jaey."
"4843","Imam Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisey ghodon ki hafiya ke maqam se musaabiqat (daud) karwaai jinhein (arabi tareeqey se) faaltu charbi zaayel (khatm) karke tez chalne ke liye sadhaya gaya tha. unki daud saniyatul-wadaa' tak thi aur jinko tez chalne ke liye sadhaya nahi gaya tha unki daud saniya se masjid bani zuraiq tak karai. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) unmein shamil they jinhoney ghodey daudaey."
"4844","Yahya-bin-Yahya , Muhammad-bin-Rumeh aur Qutaiba-bin-Saeed ne Lais-bin-Sad se hadis bayan ki. Khalaf-bin-Hisham, abu-Rabe aur abu-Kamil ne kaha : hamein Hammad-bin-Zaid ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki. Zuhair ne kaha : hamein Ismail ne Ayub se hadis bayan ki. Abdullah-bin-Numair , abu-Usama aur Yahya qattaan sab ne Ubaidullah se riwayat ki. Ali-bin hijr , Ahmad-bin-Abda aur ibne-abi-Umar ne mujhey hadis sunai, sab ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Ismail-bin-Umayya se hadis sunai. ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey Musa-bin-Aqba ne khabar di. ibne-Wahab ne kaha : mujhey Usama-bin-Zaid ne khabar di. un sab ( Lais-bin-Sad , Ayub , Ubaidullah , Ismail-bin-Umayya , Musa-bin-Aqba aur Usama-bin-Zaid ( ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se Malik ki Naafe se riwayat ki hui hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki, Hammad aur ibne-Ulaih ki Ayub se riwayat mein ye izafa kiya : Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : main awwal aaya aur ghoda mujh samet masjid (banu- zuraiq) se aagey nikal gaya. (jahan pahunchnaa tha, tez raftaari ki bina par us jagah se aagey nikal gaya.)"
"4845","Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''ghodon ki peshani mein barkat hai aur khoobi qiyamat tak.''"
"4846","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra ."
"4847","Jareer-bin-Abdullaah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha aap aik ghodey ki peshani ke baal ungli se mal rahe they aur farmatey they ghodon ki peshaniyon se barkat bandhi hui hai qiyamat tak yani sawab aur ghaneemat."
"4848","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra ."
"4849","Urwa baariqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya barkat bandhi hui hai, ghodon ki peshaaniyon se qiyamat tak yani sawab aur ghaneemat."
"4850","Urwa baariqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya barkat bandhi hui hai ghodon ki peshaaniyon se. logon ne arz kiya kis tarah ya Rasulullah ! aap ne farmaya sawab hai aur ghaneemat qiyamat tak (kyonke jihad qaaim rahega qiyamat tak)."
"4851","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra ."
"4852","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra is riwayat mein sawab aur ghaneemat ka zikr nahi hai."
"4853","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra is riwayat mein sawab aur ghaneemat ka zikr nahi hai."
"4854","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya barkat ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein hai."
"4855","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra ."
"4856","Wakee ne Sufiyan se, unhon-ne Salam-bin-Abdur-Rehman se, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghodon mein shikaal ko na-pasand farmatey they. ( shikaal ka mafhoom agli hadis mein bayan hua hai.)"
"4857","Abdullah-bin-Numair aur Abdur-Razzaq ne Sufiyan se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki. aur Abdur-Razzaq ki hadis mein ye izafa kiya : shikaal ye hai ke ghodey ke daahiney paon aur baain hath mein safedi ho ya daain hath aur baain paon mein safedi ho ( ulti taraf ke aagey aur peechhey do qadam safaid hon.)"
"4858","Muhammad-bin-Jafar aur Wahab-bin-Jareer ne hamein Shoba se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Yazeed Nakhai se, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah riwayat ki jis tarah Wakee ki hadis hai. aur Wahab ki riwayat mein) sanad us tarah) hai : unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Yazeed se riwayat ki lekin Nakhai ka zikr nahi kiya."
"4859","Jarir ne umara-bin-Qaqa se, unhon-ne Abu-Zaraa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne khud ( aisey shakhs ki) zamanat di hai ke jo shakhs uske rastey mein nikla , mere rastey mein jihad , mere sath imaan aur mere rasulon ki tasdeeq ke siwa aur kisi cheez ne usey ghar se nahi nikala , uski mujh par zamanat hai ke main usey jannat mein dakhil karunga, ya phir usey uski usi qiyam gaah mein wapas ley aaoonga jis se wo (meri khaatir) nikla tha. jo ajr aur ghaneemat us ne hasil ki wo bhi usey hasil hogi. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! jo zakhm bhi Allah ki raah mein lagaya jata hai (to zakhm khaney wala ( qiyamat ke din usi haalat mein aayega jis haalat mein usko zakhm laga tha, us (zakhm) ka rang khoon ka hoga aur khushbu kastoori ki. aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! agar musalmanon par dushwar na hota to main Allah ki raah mein jihad karne waley kisi bhi lashkar se mukhtalif rawaiya apnaatey huey (ghar mein) na baithta, lekin mere paas itni wusat nahi hoti ke main sab musalmanon ko sawariyan muhaiya kar sakun aur na hi un (sab) ke paas itni wusat hoti hai aur ye baat unko bahut sakht guzarti hai ke wo mujh se peechhey reh jaaein. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! mujhey ye pasand hai ke main Allah ki raah mein jihad karun aur qatl kar diya jaun , phir jihad karun phir qatl kar diya jaun aur phir jihad karun phir qatl kar diya jaun."
"4860","ibne-Fuzail ne Umara se isi sanad ke sath (yahi) hadis bayan ki."
"4861","Mugheera-bin-Abdur-Rehman hazami ne abu-Zinad se khabar di, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, farmaya : jis shakhs ne Allah ki raah mein jihad kiya, usey apne ghar se Allah ki raah mein jihad aur us kalimey ki tasdeeq ke ilawa aur kisi cheez ne nahi nikala to Allah uske liye is baat ka kafeel bana hai ke (shaheed ho gaya to) usey jannat mein dakhil karega ya phir us ghaneemat aur ajr samet jo usey mila, uske usi thikaaney mein usko wapas ley jaeyga jahan se wo (jihad ke liye) nikla tha."
"4862","Amr Naqid aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne abu-Zinad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne-abu-Huraira (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, farmaya : koi shakhs Allah ki raah mein zakhmi nahi kiya gaya aur Allah khub janta hai ke uski raah mein kisey zakhmi kiya gaya magar wo qiyamat ke din is tarah aayega ke uske zakhm se khoon umad raha hoga. rang khoon ka hoga aur khushbu kastoori ki."
"4863","Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat hai, kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kin. unhon-ne bahut si hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik ye thi : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : har zakhm jo musalman ko Allah ki raah mein lagaya jata hai, qiyamat ke din phir isi tarah apni usi haalat mein hoga jis tarah zakhm lagtey waqt tha. us se khoon tapak raha hoga, uska rang khoon ka hoga aur khushbu kastoori jaisi hogi. us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! agar ye ( dar ( na hota ke main musalmanon ko mashaqqat mein daalun ga to main Allah ki raah mein ladney waley kisi bhi lashkar se peechhey na betha rehta, lekin main itni wusat nahi paata ke main un (musalmanon) ko sawaariyaan muhaiya karun na unke paas itni wusat hai ke wo sawaariyaan muhaiya karke mere peechhey aaein, unke dil is par) bhi) razi nahi hotey ke wo mere peechhey gharon mein baithe rahen."
"4864","ibne-abi-Umar ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne abu-Zinad se, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : agar ye baat na hoti ke main musalmanon ko mashaqqat mein mubtala karunga to main kisi lashkar se peechhey na rehta . unki hadis ki tarah aur isi sanad ke sath (aur is mein ye alfaz bhi hain : (us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! main chahta hun ke Allah ki raah mein qatl kiya jaun , phir zinda kiya jaun Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se Abu-Zaraa ki riwayat ki hui hadis ke mutabiq ."
"4865","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar ye ( khadsha ( na hota ke main apni ummat ko mushkil mein daalun ga to mujhey ye pasand tha ke main kisi lashkar se peechhey na rahoon . un sab ki hadis ki manind (tarah)."
"4866","Suhel ne apne walid ( Abu-Saleh ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah ki raah mein nikla , Allah uske liye is baat ki zamanat deta hai ''se lekar mein Allah ki raah mein ladney waley kisi lashkar se peechhey na rehta tak.''"
"4867","abu-Khalid Ahmar ne hamein Shoba se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Qatada aur humaid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, farmaya : koi bhi Rooh rakhne wala jo faut ho jaey aur Allah Taala ke yahan uske liye bhalai maujood ho, ye baat pasand nahi karta ke wo duniya mein wapas jaey ya duniya aur jo kuchh bhi duniya mein hai, usko mil jaey, siwaey Shahid ke , sirf wo shahadat ki jo fazeelat dekhta hai. uski wjah se is baat ki tamanna karta hai ke wo duniya mein wapas jaey aur Allah ki raah mein (dobara) Shahid kiya jaey."
"4868","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Qatada se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, aap ne farmaya : jannat mein dakhil honey wala koi bhi shakhs aisa nahi jo ye pasand karta ho ke wo duniya mein wapas jaey, ya zamin par maujood koi cheez uski ho jaey. siwaey Shahid ke , wo (apni ( jo izzat afzaai dekhta hai iski bina par ye tamanna karta hai ke wo das baar wapas jaey aur qatl kiya jaey."
"4869","Khalid-bin-Abdullaah waasti ne Suhail-bin-abi-Saleh se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya : izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ki raah mein jihad ke barabar kon sa amal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum uski istitaat nahi rakhtey. Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : sahaba ne do ya teen baar sawal dohraya , aap ne har baar farmaya : tum iski istitaat nahi rakhtey. teesri baar farmaya : Allah ki raah mein jihad karne waley ki misal us shakhs ki si hai jo roze-daar ho, Allah ke samney uski aayaton ke sath raaton ko khada bhi ho raha ho, wo us waqt tak na rozey mein waqfa aaney de, na Namaz mein yahan tak ke Allah ki raah mein jihad karne wala wapas aa jaey."
"4870","abu-Awana , Jarir aur abu-Muawiya sab ne isi sanad ke sath Suhel se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"4871","abu-Tooba ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Muawiya-bin-Salam ne Zaid-bin-salam se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Salam se suna, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Noman-bin-Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai, kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke member ke paas tha ke aik shakhs ne kaha : Islam laney ke baad agar main sirf haajiyon ko pani pilaaun aur uske siwa koi doosra amal na karun to mujhey koi parwah nahi. doosrey ne kaha : Islam laney ke baad agar main sirf Masjide-Haram ko abad karun aur uske siwa aur koi doosra amal na karun to mujhey koi parwah nahi. teesrey ne kaha : jo tum sab ne kaha us se Allah ki raah mein jihad karna afzal hai. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko danta aur kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke member ke paas awaz unchi na karo. (phir bataya ke) wo Jumey ka din tha. lekin (Jumey se pahley guftgu karne ke bajaey) jab maine Juma padh liya to haazire-khidmat hunga aur jiske barey main tum jhagad rahe ho iske barey mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochhoon ga , to (is mauqe par) Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari (hui) thi (jo aap ne sunai ( : kya tum haajiyon ko pani pilana aur Masjide-Haram ko abad karna us shakhs ke (amal ( jaisa samajhtey ho jo Allah aur yaum aakhirat par imaan laya (aur us ne Allah ke rastey mein jihad kiya? ( aayat ke aakhir tak."
"4872","Yahya-bin-Hassan ne kaha : hamein Muawiya ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Zaid ne khabar di ke unhon-ne abu-Salam se suna, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Noman-bin-Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis sunai, kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke member ke paas betha tha, jis tarah abu-Tooba ki hadis hai."
"4873","Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : subah ko ya Sham ko aik baar Allah ki raah mein nikalna duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, us se behtar hai."
"4874","Abdul-Azeez-bin-abi-Hazim ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, aap ne farmaya : Allah ki raah mein banda subah ke waqt jo aik safar karta hai (jis waqt safar karna aasan bhi hota hai) to wo duniya aur jo kuchh duniya mein hai us se behtar hai."
"4875","Sufiyan ne abu-Hazim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, aap ne farmaya : Allah ki raah mein subah ke waqt ka aik safar ya Sham ke waqt ka aik safar , duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, us se behtar hai."
"4876","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar meri ummat mein aisey log na hotey . (jo jihad par janey ke liye intihai zaroori saman muhaiya nahi kar saktey aur na main unke liye muhaiya kar sakta hun) phir aap ne guftgu farmai, usmein aap ne farmaya : Allah ki raah mein subah ka aik safar karna ya Sham ka aik safar karna duniya aur jo kuch is mein hai us se behtar hai."
"4877","Abdullah-bin-Yazeed muqri ne Saeed-bin-abi-Ayub se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Shurehbeel-bin-Sharik muaafiri ne abu-Abdur-Rehman hubli se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat abu Ayub (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah ki raah mein aik baar subah ko ya Sham ko nikalnaa (ya pahra dena ( un tamam chizon se behtar hai jin par suraj tuloo hota hai aur ghurub hota hai."
"4878","Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ne riwayat ki, kaha : hamein Saeed-bin-abi-Ayub aur Hewa-bin-shureh ne bataya , donon mein se har aik ne kaha : mujhey Shurehbeel-bin-Sharik ne abu-Abdur-Rehman habli se hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne abu-Ayub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bilkul pichhli riwayat ki tarah."
"4879","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : abu-Saeed ! jo shakhs Allah ke rab honey, Islam ke Deen honey aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke Nabi honey par (dil ki gahraaiyon) se razi ho gaya, uske liye jannat wajib ho gaee. Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye baat achi lagi to kehney lagey : Allah ke rasool ! yahi baat mere samney dobara irshad farmaein , aap ne aisa hi kiya, iske baad farmaya : aik baat aur bhi hai jiski wjah se bandey ko sau darjey rafa't (bulandi) bakhshi jati hai aur har do darjon mein zamin aur aasman jitna fasla hai. kaha : (maine kaha) Allah ke rasool ! wo ( baat ( kya hai? aap ne farmaya : Allah ke rastey mein jihad karnaa, Allah ke rastey mein jihad karna."
"4880","Leis ne Saeed-bin-abi-Saeed ( Maqbari ( se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Ubai Qatada se, unhon-ne abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne unhein (abu-Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) ko) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hadis bayan kartey huey suna ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sahaba kiram mein (khutba dene ke liye) khadey huey aur unhein bataya : Allah ki raah mein jihad karna aur Allah par imaan lana (baqi) tamam aamal se afzal hai. aik shakhs khada hua aur kehney laga : Allah ke rasool ! aap kya farmatey hain? agar main Allah ki raah mein Shahid kar diya jaun to kya us se mere gunah mujh se door hata diye jaeinge ? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya : haan , agar tum Allah ki raah mein is haalat mein Shahid kar diye jao ke tum sabr karne waley (datey huey) ho, sirf Allah ki raza chahtey ho, aagey badh rahe ho, peeth pher kar na bhag rahe ho. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne kis tarah kaha tha? usne kaha (maine is tarah kaha tha) : aap kya farmatey hain? agar main Allah ki raah mein Shahid kiya jaun to kya mere gunah mujh se door hata diye jaengey. aap ne farmaya : haan , agar tum is haalat mein Allah ki raah mein Shahid kar diye jao ke sabr karne waley (datey huey) ho, sirf Allah ki raza chahtey ho, aagey badh rahe ho, peeth pher kar bhaagney waley nahi, (to sarey gunah mitaa diye jaeinge ( siwaey qarz ke. Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne (abhi aa kar) mujh se ye kaha hai."
"4881","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Saeed-bin-abi-Saeed Maqbari se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Ubai Qatada se, unhon-ne apne walid (hazrat abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki ke aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kehney laga : aap kya farmatey hain? agar main Allah ki raah mein Shahid kar diya jaun. (aagey) Leis ki hadis ke ham mana (hadis bayan ki.)"
"4882","Amr-bin-Dinar aur Muhammad-bin-Ajlan ne Muhammad-bin-Qais se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Ubai Qatada se, unhon-ne apne walid Hazrat abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, un (Amr aur ibne- Ajlan) mein se aik apne doosrey sathi se kuchh zyada bayan karta hai ke aik shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aap member par they, usne kaha : aap kya farmatey hain ke agar main apni talwaar se waar karun? ( kaafir ko qatl karun phir Shahid kar diya jaun , aagey ( Maqbari ki hadis ke ham mana ( hadis bayan ki.)"
"4883","Mufazzal-bin-fazaala ne Abbas qitbaani ke betey Ayash se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Yazeed-abu-Abdur-Rehman habli se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Shahid ka har gunah maaf kar diya jata hai, siwaey qarz ke."
"4884","Saeed-bin-abi-Ayub ne kaha : mujhey Ayash-bin-Abbas qatbaani ne abu-Abdur-Rehman habli se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah ki raah mein qatl kiye janey se qarz ke siwa baqi tamam gunah mitaa diye jatey hain."
"4885","Masruq bayan kartey hain ke ham ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se us aayat ki tafseer malum ki : jo log Allah ki raah mein Shahid kiye gaey unko marey huey na samjho , wo apne rab ke yahan zinda hain, unko rizq diya jata hai. Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : ham ne bhi iske barey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se malum kiya tha, aap ne farmaya : unki roohein sabz parindon ke andar rehti hain, unke liye arsh ilahi ke sath qindeelein latki hui hain. wo roohein jannat mein jahan chaahein khaati-peeti hain, phir un qindeelon ki taraf lot aati hain, unke rab ne uper se unki taraf jhank kar dekha aur farmaya : kya tumhen kisi cheez ki khahish hai? unhon-ne jawab diya : ham (aur ( kya khahish karein, ham jannat mein jahan chahtey hain ghoomtey aur khaatey peetey hain. Allah ne teen baar aisa kiya ( jhank kar dekha aur poochha.) jab unhon-ne dekha ke unko chhoda nahi jaeyga, unse sawal hota rahega to unhon-ne ne kaha : aey hamarey rab ! ham ye chahtey hain ke hamari ruhon ko hamarey jismon mein lota diya jaey yahan tak ke ham dobara teri raah mein Shahid kiye jaaein. jab Allah Taala ye dekhega ke unko koi hajat nahi hai to unko chhod diya jaeyga."
"4886","Muhammad-bin-Waleed Zubaidi ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yazeed Lesi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur puchha : logon mein se kon sa shakhs afzal hai? aap ne farmaya : jo apne maal aur jaan ke sath Allah ki raah mein jihad karta hai. us ne puchha : iske baad phir kon afzal hai? aap ne farmaya : wo momin afzal hai jo kisi pahaad ki ghatiyon mein se aik ghaati mein rehta hai, Allah ki ibadat karta hai aur logon ko apni burai se mehfooz rakhta hai."
"4887","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yazeed Lesi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik shakhs ne puchha : Allah ke rasool ! logon mein se afzal kon hai? aap ne farmaya : aisa momin jo apni jaan aur maal se Allah Taala ki raah mein jihad karta hai. us ne puchha : iske baad ? aap ne farmaya : phir wo aadmi jo pahaad ki ghatiyon mein se kisi ghaati mein tanha rehta hai, apne rab ki ibadat karta hai aur logon ko apne shar se mehfooz rakhta hai."
"4888","Auzai ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki aur aadmi jo kisi ghaati mein hai kaha, phir wo aadmi nahi kaha."
"4889","Yahya-bin-Yahya tamimi ne kaha : hamein Abdul-Azeez-bin-abi-Hazim ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne ba'aja se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : logon ke liye zindagi ke behtreen tariqon mein se ye hai ke aadmi ne Allah ke rastey mein jihad ke liye ghodey ki lagaam pakad rakhi ho, uski peeth par Allah ki raah mein udtaa ( tezi se harkat karta ( phirey , jab bhi) dushman ki) aahat ya ( kisi ke) darney ki awaz suney , ud kar wahan pahunch jaey, har us jagah qatl aur maut ko talash karta ho jahan uske honey ka guman ho. ya phir wo aadmi jo bakriyon ke chhotey se rewad ke sath un chotiyon mein se kisi aik choti par ya un wadiyon mein se kisi wadi mein ho, Namaz qaaim karey, zakat de aur yaqeeni anjam ( maut ( tak apne rab ki ibadat karey, achai ke maamlaat ke siwa logon se koi talluq na rakhey ."
"4890","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed ne Abdul-Azeez-bin-abi-Hazim se, unhon-ne aur Yaqoob-bin-Abdur-Rehman donon ne isi sanad ke sath abu-Hazim se usi ki tarah riwayat bayan ki (ba'aja ka mukammal naam letey huey) ba'aja-bin-Abdullah-bin-badr kaha, aur Yahya ki riwayat ke bar-aks (un wadiyon mein se aik wadi ke bajaey) un ghatiyon mein se aik ghaati mein kaha."
"4891","Usama-bin-Zaid ne ba'aja-bin-Abdullah Juhni se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi hadis ke ham mana hadis riwayat ki jo abu-Hazim ne ba'aja se riwayat ki. aur unhon-ne ghatiyon mein se aik ghaati mein kaha."
"4892","Muhammad-bin-abi-Umar Makki ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne abu-Zinad se, unhon-ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala do aadmiyon ki taraf (dekh kar) hansta hai, un donon mein se aik aadmi doosrey ko qatl karta hai aur donon jannat mein dakhil ho jatey hain. sahaba kiram ne puchha : Allah ke rasool ! ye kaisey (mumkin) hai? aap ne farmaya : aik shakhs Allah ki raah mein jang karta hai aur Shahid ho jata hai, phir Allah iske qaatil ko tauba ki taufeeq ata karta hai to wo musalman ho jata hai, phir wo (bhi) Allah ki raah mein jihad karta hai aur Shahid ho jata hai. (jaisa ke Hazrat Hamza aur wahshi-bin-harab (Raziallahu anhu) hain.)"
"4893","Wakee ne Sufiyan se, unhon-ne abu-Zinad se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4894","Hammam-bin-Munabbah se riwayat hai, kaha : ye hadisein hain jo Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, unhon-ne bahut si hadisein bayan kin unmein se ye hai : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala do shakhson ki taraf dekh kar hansta hai, unmein se aik shakhs doosrey ko qatl karta hai aur wo donon jannat mein dakhil ho jatey hain. sahaba kiram ne puchha : Allah ke rasool ! kaisey? aap ne farmaya : ye shakhs Shahid kiya jata hai aur jannat ke andar chala jata hai, phir Allah Taala doosrey (qaatil) par nazar inayat farmata hai, usey Islam ki hidayat ata karta hai, phir wo Allah ki raah mein jihad karta hai aur Shahid kar diya jata hai."
"4895","Alaa ke walid ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kaafir aur usko qatl karne wala (musalman) jahannam mein kabhi ikatthey nahi hongey."
"4896","Suhel ke walid Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : do log jahannam mein is tarah ikatthey nahi hongey ke ikatthey honey ki wjah se aik shakhs doosrey ko nuqsan pahuncha sakey. kaha ki : Allah ke rasool ! wo kon hain? farmaya : wo momin jisne (jihad kartey huey) kisi kaafir ko qatl kiya, phir Deen par mazbooti se jama raha."
"4897","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne abu-Amr Shebani se, unhon-ne abu-Masood Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik shakhs ontni ki mahaar (nakel) pakdey huey aaya aur kehney laga : ye Allah ki raah (jihad) mein hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumhen iske badley mein qiyamat ke din saat so oontniyan milein gi aur sabhi nakel samet hongi ."
"4898","Zayda aur Shoba donon ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"4899","abu-Muawia ne hamein Aamash se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Amr Shebani se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Masood Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : aik shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kaha : Allah ke rasool ! mera sawari ka janwar zaaya ho gaya hai, aap mujhey sawari muhaiya kar dijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mere paas sawari nahi hai. aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! main usko aisa shakhs batata hun jo usey sawari ka janwar muhaiya kar dega. aap ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne kisi neki ka pata bataya, uske liye (bhi) neki karne waley ke jaisa ajr hai."
"4900","Isa-bin-Yonus , Shoba aur Sufiyan sab ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki."
"4901","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis sunai ke qabila Aslam ke aik naujawaan ne aa kar kaha : Allah ke rasool ! main jihad karna chahta hun aur mere paas istitaat nahi ke iska saman baandh sakoon. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum falan shakhs ke paas chaley jao, us ne jihad ka saman taiyaar kiya tha lekin wo bimar ho gaya hai. wo naujawaan us aadmi ke paas gaya aur kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tum ko salam kehtey hain aur farmatey hain : wo Sara saman mujhey de do jo tum ne (jihad ke liye) taiyaar kiya hai. unhon-ne kaha : aey falan bevi ! maine jo kuchh (jihad ke liye) taiyaar kiya tha usey de do aur is mein se koi cheez bacha ke na rakho, Allah ki qism ! aisey nahi hoga ke tum usmein se kuchh bacha ke rakho aur is mein se tumharey liye barkat ho."
"4902","Bukair-bin-Ashajj ne Basar-bin-Saeed se, unhon-ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Khalid Juhni (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne Allah ke rastey mein jang karne waley kisi aadmi ko samane-jihad muhaiya kiya to yaqinan usne bhi jihad kiya aur jis shakhs ne ghaazi ke ghar walon ki achi tarah dekh bhaal ki to yaqinan usne bhi jihad kiya."
"4903","abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne Basar-bin-Saeed se, unhon-ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Khalid Juhni (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne kisi Mujahid ke liye saman muhaiya kiya to yaqinan us ne jihad kiya aur jisne Mujahid ke peechhey iske ghar walon ki dekh bhaal ki usne bhi jihad kiya."
"4904","Ali-bin-Mubarak ne kaha : hamein Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Mehri ke Maula abu-Saeed ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis sunai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banu- Lahyaan ke khilaf aik lashkar rawaana kiya aur farmaya : har ( ghar ke) do mardon mein se aik mard uthey aur jaey, sawab mein donon Sharik hongey."
"4907","Mehri ke aazad karda ghulam Yazeed-bin-abi-Saeed ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah ne banu-Lahiyaan ki taraf aik lashkar rawaana kiya aur farmaya : har do aadmiyon mein se aik aadmi (jihad ke liye nikley) aur farmaya : tum mein se jo shakhs bhi (jihad ke liye) nikalney waley ke ahal aur ayaal aur maal aur mataa (daulat) ki achi tarah dekh bhaal ke liye peechhey rahega , nikalney waley ke ajr mein se aadha usey milega. (yani jihad karne waley aur peechhey khayal rakhney waley donon ke liye sawab hai. peechhey reh kar khayal rakhney waley ko bhi ghar mein rahtey huey aadha sawab mil jaeyga.)"
"4908","Sufiyan (Sory) ne Alqama-bin-Marsad se, unhon-ne Sulaiman-bin-Barida se, unhon-ne apne walid Hazrat Barida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ghar mein baithney walon ke liye mujahideen ki aurton ki izzat aur hurmat isi tarah hai jis tarah unki apni maaon ki hurmat aur izzat hai. aur gharon mein baithney walon mein se jo bhi shakhs mujaahideen ke ghar walon ki dekh bhaal ka zimme daar hai, phir unke mamley mein unke sath khayanat karta hai) poori tarah dekh bhaal nahi karta ( to usko qiyamat ke din us ( Mujahid (ke samney khada kiya jaeyga aur wo iske amal mein se jitna chaahega ley lega , ab tumhara (is saza ke barey mein) kiya khayal hai? ( kotaahi karne waley ne mujahideen ke ghar walon ki dekh bhaal mein kotahi karke nek amal bhi kiye hongey to wo us se chhin jaeinge aur ho sakta hai uske paas kuchh bhi na bachchey.)"
"4909","Misar ne hamein Alqama-bin-Marsad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne ibne-bareeda se, unhon-ne apne walid Hazrat Barida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( phir Sufiyan ( Sory ki hadis ke ham mana ( hadis bayan ki.)"
"4910","Qa'anab ne Alqama-bin-Marsad se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki : aur farmaya : ( usey kaha jaeyga ke) tum uski nekiyon mein se jo chaho ley lo phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya : tum kiya samajhtey ho?"
"4911","Muhammad-bin-Musanna aur Muhammad-bin-Bashar ne hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz ibne-Musanna ke hain. padhi. donon ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Bara (bin-aazib (Raziallahu anhu)) se suna, wo Quran Majeed ki aayat : mominon mein se ghar baithney waale, jo ma'zoor nahi aur Allah ki raah mein jihad karne waley barabar nahi, ke barey mein keh rahe they ( aayat , darmyan waley hissey jo ma'zoor nahi ke baghair nazil hui ( to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya, wo aik shaaney ki haddi ley aaey aur is par ye aayat likh de. is mauqe par Hazrat ibn-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne naa-beenaa honey ki shikayat ki, tab ye aayat ( darmyan ke hissey samet is tarah) utri : mominon mein se ghar baithney waale, jo ma'zoor nahi aur Allah ki raah mein jihad karne waley barabar nahi. Shoba ne kaha : mujhey aik shakhs ne Sad-bin-Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se aayat : baithney waley barabar nahi Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis ki tarah bayan ki, ibne-Bashar ne apni riwayat mein kaha : Sad-bin-Ibrahim ne apne walid se, unhon-ne aik aadmi se, us ne Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, (pehli hadis ki sanad mukammal aur sahi hai. ye donon sanadein zabt aur taaid ke liye hain.)"
"4912","Misar ne Abu-Ishaq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab aayat : ''mominon mein se ghar baithney waley mujaahidon ke barabar nahi'' nazil hui to ( Abdullah ( ibn-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se guftgu ki, tab ( غَيْرُ أُولِى ٱلضَّرَرِ ( (jo ma'zoor nahi (ke alfaz nazil huey."
"4913","Saeed-bin-Amr ash-asi aur Saeed-bin-Saeed ne hamein hadis bayan ki : . padhi. alfaz Saeed ke hain. padhi. kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Amr se khabar di : unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke aik shakhs ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! agar main ( Allah ki raah mein ladtey huey) Shahid kar diya jaun to main kahan hoonga? farmaya : jannat mein. us shakhs ke hath mein jo khajoorein thin us ne unko phainkaa , phir lada yahan tak ke Shahid ho gaya aur Suwed ki riwayat mein ye hai : aik shakhs ne Uhud ke din Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kiya."
"4914","Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kaha : Ansar ke aik qabeeley , banu-nabiyat mein se aik shakhs (Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein) aaya aur us ne kaha : main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ka mustahiq nahi aur bila shubah aap Allah ke bandey aur uske rasool hain. phir aagey badha , ( khub ( jang ki yahan tak ke Shahid kar diya gaya, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya is shakhs ne amal bahut kam kiya aur usko ajr bahut zyada ata kiya gaya."
"4915","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu-Sufiyan ki khabar laney ke liye busaisa ( khazraji Ansari ( (Raziallahu anhu) ko jaasus bana kar bheja ke dekhey Abu-Sufiyan ke) tijarati ( qafley ki kya surate-haal hai? jis waqt wo wapas aaya to ghar mein mere aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke siwa aur koi nahi tha. padhi. (Sabit ne) kaha : mujhey ye maalum nahi ke unhon ne ye baat Ummul-Momenin ke alawaa kahi ya nahi. padhi. kaha is ne aa kar aapko saari baat batai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur farmaya : hamein kuchh ( karna ( matloob hai, so jiske paas sawari maujood ho wo hamarey sath Sawar ho kar chaley. kuchh log oopri Madina mein) maujood ( apni sawaariyan laney ki ijazat talab karne lagey. aap ne farmaya : nahi, sirf wahi log ( sath chalein ( jinki sawaariyaan yahin maujood hon. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ke ashaab chal padey aur mushrekeen se pahley badr pahunch gaey, mushrekeen bhi aa pahunchey, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi shakhs , jab tak main uske peechhey na hun, kisi cheez par pesh qadmii na kare. mushrekeen qareeb aagey to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya is jannat ki taraf badh jiski chaudai aasman aur zamin hain. kaha : (ye sun kar) Hazrat Umair-bin-Hammam Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) kehney lagey : ya Rasulullah ! jannat jiska arz aasman aur zamin hai? aap ne farmaya : haan. usne kaha : waah-waah ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum ne ye waah-waah kis wjah se kaha ? usne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! is ummeed ke siwa aur kisi wjah se nahi (kaha (ke main ( bhi) jannat walon mein se ho jaun , aap ne farmaya : bila shubah tum ahle-jannat mein se ho. Hazrat Umer (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne tarkash se kuchh khajoorein nikal kar khaani shuru kin, phir kehney lagey : agar main apni in khajooron ko kha leney tak zinda raha to phir ye badi lambi zindagi hogi (yani jannat milney mein der ho jaeygi) , phir unhon-ne , jo khajoorein unke paas thin, phenki aur ladai shuru kar di yahan tak ke Shahid ho gaey."
"4916","Abu-Bakar-bin-Abdullah-bin-Qais se riwayat hai, unhon-ne apne walid (Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine apne walid se, jab wo dushman ka saamna kar rahe they, suna : wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jannat ke darwazey talwaaron ke saaey taley ( hotey ( hain. ye sun kar aik khasta haal shakhs khada hua aur kehney laga : abu-Musa ! kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khud ye farmatey huey suna tha? unhon-ne kaha : haan. ye sun kar wo shakhs wapas apne sathiyon ke paas gaya aur kehney laga : main tumhen salam kehta hun, phir us ne apni talwaar ki niyaam tod kar phenk di aur talwaar lekar badha , us se shamsheer zani ki yahan tak ke Shahid kar diya gaya."
"4917","Sabit ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : kuchh log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kehney lagey : hamarey sath kuchh aadmi bhej dein jo ( hamein ( Quran aur sunnat ki taleem dein. aap ne unke sath sattar (70) Ansari bhej diye jinhein qir'a kaha jata tha, unmein mere maamun Hazrat haram (bin-milhaan (Raziallahu anhu)) bhi they, ye log raat ke waqt Quran padhtey they, aik doosrey ko sunatey they, Quran ki taleem hasil kartey they, aur din ko masjid mein pani la kar rakhtey they aur jangal se lakdiyan la kar farokht kartey aur us se ashabe-Suffa aur fuqaraa ke liye khana khareedtey they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein un ( aaney waley kaafiron ( ki taraf bheja aur unhon-ne manzil par pahunchne se pahley ( rastey hi mein dhokey se) un par hamla kar diya aur unhein Shahid kar diya. us waqt unhon-ne kaha : aey Allah ! hamari taraf se hamarey Nabi ko ye paigham pahuncha de ke hamari tujh se mulaqat ho gaee hai. ham tujh se razi ho gaey hain aur to ham se razi ho gaya hai. us saanihey (hadise) mein aik shakhs ne peechhey se aa kar Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ke maamun , haram (bin-milhaan ( (Raziallahu anhu) ko is tarah neza maara ke wo aar paar ho gaya to unhon-ne kaha : rabe Kaba ki qism ! main kaamyaab ho gaya, us waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ashaab se farmaya : tumharey bhai Shahid kar diye gaey hain aur unhon-ne kaha hai : aey Allah ! hamarey Nabi ko ye paigham pahuncha de ke ham ne tujh se mulaqat kar li hai, ham tujh se razi ho gaey hain aur to ham se razi ho gaya hai."
"4918","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : mere chacha jinke naam par mera naam rakha gaya hai, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jange-badr mein hazir nahi ho sakey they aur ye baat un par bahut sakht guzri thi. unhon-ne kaha : ye pahlai jang thi jis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sharik huey aur main us se ghair hazir raha, iske baad agar Allah Taala ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath koi ladaai  mujhey dikhai to Allah mujhey bhi dekhega ke main kya karta hun. wo in kalimaat ke ilawa koi aur baat kehney se darey (dil mein bahut kuchh kar guzarney ka azm tha lekin is baat se zyada kuchh nahi kaha) phir wo Uhud ki jang ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sharik huey, kaha : phir Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) unke samney aaey to ( mere chacha ( Anas (bin-nazar) (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha : abu-Amr ! kidhar ? ( phir kaha : ( jannat ki khushbu kaisi ajeeb hai ! jo mujhey pahaad Uhud ke peechhey se aa rahi hai, phir wo kaafiron se ladey yahan tak ke Shahid ho gaey. unke jism par talwaar , neze aur teeron ke assi se uper zakhm paaey gaey. unki behan , meri phoophi , Rabe binte-nazar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine apne bhai (ki laash ( ko sirf unki ungliyon ke poron se pehchaana tha, (usi mauqe par) ye aayat nazil hui : ''(mominon mein se) kitney mard hain ke jis (qaul) par unhon-ne Allah se ahad kiya tha, usey sach kar dikhaya , unmein se kuchh aisey hain jinhoney apna zimma pura kar diya, aur unmein se koi aisey hain jo muntazir hain, wo zarra barabar tabdeel nahi huey (apne Allah ke sath kiye huey ahad par qaaim hain.)'' sahaba kiram ka khayal ye tha ke ye aayat Hazrat Anas (bin-nazar ( (Raziallahu anhu) aur unke sathiyon ke barey mein nazil hui."
"4919","Amr-bin-Murra ne kaha : maine abu-Waeil ( Shaqiq ( se suna, unhon-ne kaha : hamein abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke aik dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha : Allah ke rasool ! koi shakhs maale-ghanimat ki khaatir ladtaa hai, koi shakhs isliye ladtaa hai ke us (ke kaarnaamon) ka zikr ho aur koi isliye ladtaa hai ke) ladai aur shuja'at ( mein uske maqam ko dekha jaey, unmein se Allah ke rastey mein) ladney wala ( kon hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo shakhs jo isliye ladey ke Allah ka kalima uncha ho, wahi Allah ke rastey mein (ladney wala) hai."
"4920","abu-Muawia ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Shaqiq se, unhon-ne abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisey shakhs ke barey mein sawal kiya gaya jo shuja'at ke liye ladtaa hai, koi (qaumi) hamiyat ke liye ladtaa hai, koi dikhaawey ke liye ladtaa hai, unmein se Allah ki raah main ( ladney wala ( kon hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs isliye lada ke Allah ka kalima sabse uncha ho to wahi Allah ke liye ladney wala hai."
"4921","Isa-bin-Yonus ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne Shaqiq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha : Allah ke rasool ! ham mein se koi shakhs izhare shuja'at ke liye ladtaa hai. phir usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4922","Mansoor ne abu-Waeil se, unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Allah ki raah mein jang karne ke mutaalliq sawal kiya aur kaha : aik shakhs ghussey ki wjah se jang karta hai, aik shakhs ( qaumi ( hamiyat ki bina par jang karta hai. kaha : to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski taraf apna sar Mubarak uthaya aur sirf isliye uthaya ke wo aadmi khada hua tha aur farmaya : jo shakhs isliye lada ke Allah ka kalima sabse uncha ho, wahi Allah ki raah main ( ladney wala ( hai."
"4923","Khalid-bin-Haaris ne kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Younus-bin-Yoosuf ne Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : ( jamghatey ke baad) log Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se chhat gaey to ahale Sham mein se naatil (bin-Qais-juzaamii-raees ahale Sham (Syria) ( ne unse kaha : Shekh ! mujhey aisi hadis sunain jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni ho, kaha : haan , maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : qiyamat ke roz sabse pahlaa shakhs jiske khilaf faisla aayega , wo hoga jisey Shahid kar diya gaya. usey pesh kiya jaeyga Allah Taala usey apni ( ata karda ( nemat ki pehchan kiraaey ga to wo usey pehchan lega. wo poochhega tu ney is nemat ke sath kya kiya? wo kahega : maine teri raah mein ladai ki yahan tak ke mujhey Shahid kar diya gaya. ( Allah Taala ( farmaeyga tu ney jhoot bola. tum isliye ladey they ke kaha jaey : ye ( shakhs) jari (nidar) hai. aur yahi kaha gaya, phir uske barey mein hukm diya jaeyga to us aadmi ko munh ke bal ghaseetaa jaeyga yahan tak ke aag mein daal diya jaeyga aur wo aadmi jisne ilm padha , padhaayaa aur Quran ki qirat ki, usey pesh kiya jaeyga ( Allah Taala ( usey apni ne'maton ki pehchan kiraaey ga , wo pehchan kar lega , wo farmaeyga : tu ney in ne'maton ke sath kya kiya ? wo kahega : maine ilm padha aur padhaayaa aur teri khaatir Quran ki qirat ki. ( Allah ( farmaeyga : tu ney jhoot bola, tu ney isliye ilm padha ke kaha jaey (ye ( aalim hai aur tu ney Quran isliye padha ke kaha jaey : ye qaari hai, wo kaha gaya, phir uske barey mein hukm diya jaeyga, usey munh ke bal ghaseetaa jaeyga yahan tak ke aag mein daal diya jaeyga aur wo aadmi jis par Allah ne wusat ki aur har qisam ka maal ata kiya. usey laya jaeyga Allah Taala usey apni ne'maton ki pehchan kiraaey ga , wo pehchan lega. Allah farmaeyga : tum ne unmein kya kiya? kahega : maine koi raah nahi chhodi jis main tumhen pasand hai ke maal kharch kiya jaey magar har aisi raah mein kharch kiya. Allah farmaeyga : tum ne jhoot bola hai, tum ne (ye sab ( isliye kiya taake kaha jaey, wo data (sakhi) hai, aisa hi kaha gaya, phir uske barey mein hukm diya jaeyga, to usey munh ke bal ghaseetaa jaeyga, phir aag mein daal diya jaeyga."
"4924","Hujjaj-bin-Muhammad ne hamein ibne-Juraij se khabar di, kaha : mujhey Younus-bin-Yoosuf ne Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : log Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se chhat gaey to naatil shaami ne kaha, padhi. aur (iske baad) Khalid-bin-Haaris ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4925","Hewa-bin-shureh ne abu-Haani se riwayat ki, unhon-ne abu-Abdur-Rehman habli se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ladney wali koi bhi jamat jo Allah ki raah mein jang karti hai, phir wo log maale-ghanimat hasil kar letey hain to wo aakhirat ke ajr se do hissey fauran hasil kar letey hain, unke liye aik baqi reh jata hai aur agar wo ghaneemat hasil nahi kartey to (aakhirat mein) unka ajr pura hoga."
"4926","Naafe-bin-Yazeed ne kaha : mujhey abu-Haani ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey abu-Abdur-Rehman-hablii ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo bhi ghaazi jamat ya lashkar jihad karey, ghaneemat hasil karey aur salamat rahe to unhon-ne apne do tehai ajr fauran (yahin) hasil kar liye aur jo bhi ghaazi jamat ya lashkar khali hath lautey aur zakhm khaaey to un logon ke ajr mukammal hongey."
"4927","Imam Malik ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin-Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Alqama-bin-waqaas se, unhon-ne Hazrat Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : amal ka daaromadar niyat par hi hai, aur aadmi ke liye wahi ( ajr ( hai jiski us ne niyat ki. jis shakhs ki hijrat Allah aur uske rasool ki taraf thi to uski hijrat Allah aur uske rasool ki taraf hai aur jis shakhs ki hijrat duniya hasil karne ke liye ya kisi aurat se nikah karne ke liye thi to uski hijrat usi cheez ki taraf hai jiski taraf us ne hijrat ki thi."
"4928","Leis, Hammad-bin-Zaid , abdul-wahaab Saqafi , Sulaiman-bin-Hayyan , Hafs-bin-Ghiyas , Yazid-bin-Harun , ibne-Mubarak aur Sufiyan sab ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se, Malik ki sanad aur unki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki. Sufiyan ki hadis mein hai : maine Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko member par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis bayan kartey huey suna."
"4929","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne sachey dil se shahadat talab ki, usey ata kar di jati hai) ajr ata kar diya jata hai) chahey wo usey ( amalan ( hasil na ho sakey."
"4930","abu-Taahir aur Hurmala-bin-Yahya ne mujhey hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz Hurmala ke hain. padhi. abu-Taahir ne kaha : hamein Abdullah-bin-Wahab ne khabar di, Hurmala ne kaha : hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey abu-Shuraih ne hadis bayan ki ke Sahal-bin-abi-Amama-bin-Sahal-bin-Haneef ne apne walid ke waastey se apne dada se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs sachey dil se Allah ki shahadat maangey , Allah usey shohdaa ke maraatib tak pahuncha deta hai, chahey wo apne bistar hi par kyon na faut ho. abu-Taahir ne apni hadis mein sachey (dil ( se ke alfaz bayan nahi kiye."
"4931","Muhammad-bin-Abdur-Rehman-bin-saham-antaki ne kaha : hamein Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ne Wuhaib Makki se khabar di, unhon-ne Umar-bin-Muhammad-bin Munkadir se, unhon-ne Sumai se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs mar gaya aur jihad kiya na dil mein jihad ka irada hi kiya, wo nifaq ki aik qisam mein maraa. ibne-saham ne kaha : Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ka qaul hai : hamein ye samajh mein aata hai ke ye (hukm) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein tha (jab jihad ki sangeen zarurat thi. bahut badey mumaalik ke Islam mein dakhil honey aur dushmanon se maamoon ho janey ke baad ab har kisi ki jihad mein shumooliyat ki itni shadeed zarurat nahi rahi. ("
"4932","Jarir ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Abu-Sufiyan se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham aik ghazwey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, aap ne farmaya : Madina mein aisey log bhi hain ke tum kisi rastey par nahi chaltey ya kisi wadi ko tay nahi kartey magar wo tumharey sath hotey hain, unhein bimari ne rok rakha hai."
"4933","abu-Muawia , Wakee aur Isa-bin-Yonus sab ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, magar Wakee ki hadis mein (magar wo tumharey sath hotey hain ke bajaey) magar wo tumharey sath ajr mein Sharik hotey hain hai."
"4934","Ishaq-bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hazrat umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) (jo huzoor ki dudh-sharik khala lagti thin) ke paas tashrif ley jatey aur wo aapko khana pesh karti thin, ( baad iske ( wo Hazrat Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein) aa gai) thin, aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke yahaan gaey, unhon-ne aapko khana pesh kiya aur phir baith kar aap ke sar mein juein talash karne lagein. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey, phir aap hanstey huey bedaar huey, Hazrat umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! aap kyon hans rahe hain? aap ne farmaya : meri ummat ke kuchh log , Allah ki raah mein jihad kartey huey mere samney pesh kiye gaey, wo us samandar ki pusht par Sawar hongey. wo takht par baithey huey badshah hongey, ya apne apney takht par baithey huey badshahon ki tarah hongey. unhein shak tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaayaa? kaha : to umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! Allah se dua kijiye ke wo mujhey bhi un mujaahideen mein shamil kar de. aap ne unke liye dua ki aur phir apna sar ( takiye par) rakh kar so gaey, phir aap hanstey huey bedaar huey, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! aap kyon hans rahe hain? aap ne farmaya : mujhey ( khuwab mein) meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ki raah mein jihad kartey huey dikhaaey gaey. jis tarah pehli martaba farmaya tha, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! aap Allah se dua kijiye ke wo mujhey bhi unmein shamil kar de. aap ne farmaya : tum awwaleen logon mein se ho. phir Hazrat umme-Haraam-binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamaney mein samandar mein (bahri bedey par) sawar huin aur jab samandar se bahar niklin to apni sawari ke janwar se gir kar Shahid ho gain. (is tarah shahadat paai.)"
"4935","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muhammad-bin-Yahyaa-bin-hibbaan se, unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Hazrat umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, wo Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khala thin, kaha : aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahaan tashrif laey aur hamarey yahaan qailula farmaya, phir aap hanstey huey bedaar huey. maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! aap par mere maan-baap qurbaan ! aap ke hansney ka sabab kya hai? aap ne farmaya : mujhey meri ummat ka aik giroh dikhaya gaya jo samandar ki peeth par Sawar hain, jaisey badshah apne-apne takht par baithey hon. maine kaha : aap Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unmein shamil kar de. aap ne farmaya : tum unhi mein ho. Hazrat umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aap phir so gaey aur aap dobara jaagey to bhi aap hans rahe they. maine (phir) aap se sawal kiya to aap ne isi tarah farmaya, maine kaha : aap Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke wo mujhey bhi unmein shamil kar de. aap ne farmaya : tum awwaleen logon mein se ho. kaha : phir iske baad Hazrat Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse nikah kar liya. unhon-ne samandar ke rastey jihad kiya aur Hazrat umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ko apne sath le gaey, jab wo pahunchin to unke paas aik khachchar laai gaee, wo is par Sawar huin lekin us ne unko gira diya jis se unki gardan toot gaee. (aur is tarah unhon-ne shahadat paai.)"
"4936","Leis ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se, unhon-ne ibne-hibbaan se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne apni khala umme-Haraam-binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere qareeb hi so gaey, phir aap muskuratey huey bedaar huey, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? aap ne farmaya : mujhey meri ummat ke kuchh log dikhaaey gaey jo us bahare-akhzar par Sawar ho kar ja rahe hain. phir Hammad-bin-Zaid ki hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"4937","Abdullah-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne kaha ke unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki khala , binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tashrif laey aur unke yahaan (takiye par) sar rakh kar so gaey, iske baad Ishaq-bin-abi-Talha aur Muhammad-bin-Yahyaa-bin-hibbaan ki hadis ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"4938","Lais-bin-Sad ne hamein Ayub-bin-Musa se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Mak-hool se, unhon-ne Shurehbeel-bin-Simt se, unhon-ne Salman (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : aik din aur aik raat sarhad par pahra denaa, aik maah ke rozon aur qiyam se behtar hai aur agar (pahra dene wala) faut ho gaya to uska wo amal jo wo kar raha tha, (aainda bhi) jari rahega , uske liye uska rizq jari kiya jaeyga aur wo (qabr mein sawalat karke) imtihaan leney waley se mehfooz rahega."
"4939","abu-Ubaida-bin-Aqba ne Shurehbeel-bin-Simt se, unhon-ne Salman-khair (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Ayub-bin-Musa se Leis ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki."
"4940","sumi ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik baar aik shakhs kisi rastey par ja raha tha, us ne rastey mein aik khaardaar shaakh dekhi to usko (rastey se) peechhey kar diya, Allah Taala ne usey uske amal ki jazaa di aur usko bakhsh diya. phir aap ne farmaya : Shahid panch ( qism ke ashkhaas ( hain : (1) taaoon ki bimari mein marney wala. (2) pet ki bimari mein marney wala. (3) doob kar marney wala. (4) kisi cheez ke nichey dab kar marney wala. (5) aur jo shakhs izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ki raah mein (ladtey huey) Shahid hua."
"4941","Jarir ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid ( Abu-Saleh ( se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum aapas mein (baat kartey huey) Shahid kis ko shumaar kartey ho? sahaba ne kaha : Allah ke rasool ! jo shakhs Allah ki raah mein qatl kiya jaey wo Shahid hai. aap ne farmaya : phir to meri ummat ke shohdaa bahut kam huey. sahaba ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! phir wo kon hain? aap ne farmaya : jo shakhs Allah ki raah mein maara jaey wo Shahid hai aur jo shakhs Allah ki raah main (talabe-ilm, safar Haj , jihad ke doran main apni maut ( mar jaey wo Shahid hai, jo shakhs taaoon mein marey wo Shahid hai, jo shakhs pet ki bimari main (mubtala ho kar) mar jaey wo Shahid hai. ( Abu-Saleh se bayan karne waley aik aur rawi Ubaidullah ( bin-muqsim ne (Suhail-bin-abi Saleh se) kaha : main tumharey walid ke barey mein gawahi deta hun ke unhon-ne ( hadis bayan kartey huey ye bhi) kaha tha : aur gharq honey wala Shahid hai."
"4942","Khalid ne hamein Suhel se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki, albatta unki hadis mein hai : Suhel ne kaha : Ubaidullah-bin-muqsim ne ( Suhel se) kaha ke main tumharey bhai ke barey mein (bhi) gawahi deta hun ke us hadis (ko apne walid se bayan kartey huey us ( mein ye izafa kiya tha : aur jo gharq ho jaey wo Shahid hai."
"4943","Wuhaib ne kaha : hamein Suhel ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, unki hadis mein hai, kaha : mujhey Ubaidullah-bin-muqsim ne Abu-Saleh se khabar di, aur is mein izafa kiya : gharq honey wala Shahid hai."
"4944","abdul-Wahid-bin-Ziyad ne kaha : hamein Aasim ne Hafsa-binte-Sirin se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se puchha : Yahya-bin-abi-Umra kis bimari se faut huey they? unhon-ne kaha : maine kaha : taaoon se. unhon-ne kaha : to unhon ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : taaoon (se maut) har musalman ke liye shahadat hai."
"4945","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne Aasim se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4946","samaama-bin-shufee se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Hazrat Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par farma rahe they : tum unke muqaabley ke liye jitni kar sako, quwwat taiyaar karo.sun rakho ! quwwat teer andazi (ka naam ( hai, sun rakho ! quwwat teer andazi (ka naam) hai, sun rakho ! quwwat teer andazi (ka naam) hai."
"4947","ibne- Wahab ne kaha : mujhey Amr-bin-Haris ne abu-Ali ( samaama-bin-shafi) se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jald hi tumharey liye bahut si zaminon (par qabzey) ke darwazey khol diye jaeinge aur Allah tumharey liye kafi hoga, isliye tum mein se koi apne teeron ki mashq se ghaafil na rahe."
"4948","Main saiyedna Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mazkura (uper zikr) hadis ki manind (tarah) riwayat naql kartey hain."
"4949","Haaris-bin-Yaqoob ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-shumaasa se riwayat ki ke fuqaim lakhmi ne Hazrat Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : aap ( teer chhodney aur ja lagney ke) un do nishaanon ke darmyan chakkar lagaatey hain jabke aap boodhey hain aur ye aap ke liye baaise mashaqqat bhi hai. Hazrat Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : agar maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik baat na suni hoti to main ye takleef na uthata . Haris ne kaha : maine ibne-Shumaasa se puchha : wo baat kya hai? unhon-ne kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha : jis shakhs ne teer andazi seekhi, phir usko tark kar diya, wo ham mein se nahi hai. ya (farmaya:) us ne nafarmani ki."
"4950","Hazrat Soban (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : hamesha meri ummat ka aik giroh haq par qaaim rahega koi unko nuqsan na pahuncha sakega yahan tak ke Allah Taala ka hukm aawey (yani qiyamat (aur wo isi haal mein hongey."
"4951","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra . (is hadis ka bayan kitabul-Imaan mein guzra hai.)"
"4952","tarjama wahi jo uper guzra ."
"4953","Jaabir-bin-Samra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ye Deen barabar qaaim rahega aur iske uper ladti rahegi aik jamat ( kaafiron se aur mukhaalifon se) musalmanon ki qiyamat honey tak."
"4954","Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai maine suna Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aap farmatey they hamesha aik giroh meri ummat ka haq par ladtaa rahega qiyamat tak."
"4955","Umair-bin-Hani se riwayat hai maine Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se suna member par, wo kehtey they maine suna Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aap farmatey they hamesha aik giroh meri ummat ka Allah ke hukm par qaaim rahega jo koi unko bigaadnaa chahey wo kuchh bigaad na sakega. yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aan pahunchey aur wo ghalib raheingey logon par."
"4956","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jis shakhs ki Allah Taala bhalai chahta hai usko Deen mein samajh deta hai aur hamesha aik jamat musalmanon ki haq par ladti rahegi aur ghalib rahegi un par jo unse ladein qiyamat tak."
"4957","Abdur-Rehman-bin-shumaasa Mehri se riwayat hai main muslima-bin-mukhlid ke paas betha tha unke paas Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) they. Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha qiyamat qaaim na hogi magar badtareen makhlooq par, wo badtar hongey jahiliyat walon se ,Allah taala se jis baat ki dua karengey Allah Taala unko raddh kar de ga. log isi haal mein they ke Aqba-bin-Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) aaey Muslima ne unse kaha aey Aqba ! Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) kya kehtey hain? Aqba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha wo mujh se zyada jantey hain par maine to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai aap farmatey they hamesha meri ummat ka aik giroh ya aik jamat Allah ke hukm par ladti rahegi aur apne dushman par ghalib rahegi jo koi unka khilaf khada hoga unko kuchh nuqsan na pahuncha sakega yahan tak ke qiyamat aa jaawey gi. aur wo usi haal mein hongey. Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha be-shak (hazrat ne aisa farmaya) lekin phir Allah aik hawa bhejeyga jis mein mushk ki si boo hogi aur resham ki tarah badan par lagey gi wo na chhodegi , kisi shakhs ko jiske dil mein aik daney barabar bhi imaan hoga. balke usko maarey jaawey gi. baad iske sab burey kaafir log reh jaawen gey unhi par qiyamat qaaim hogi."
"4958","Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hamesha maghrib waley haq par ghalib raheingey yahan tak ke qiyamat qaaim hogi."
"4959","Jarir ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum shadabi (hariyali) (ke zamaney) mein safar karo to zamin mein se oonton ko unka hissey do aur jab tum khushk saali (ya qahat zada zameen) mein safar karo to us zamin par se jaldi guzro aur jab tum raat ke aakhiri hissey mein manzil karo to guzar gaah se hat jao kyonke raat ko wo ( rastey ki) jagah kidon-makaudo ka thikana hoti hai. ( wahan apni khuraak ke husool ke liye aatey hain.)"
"4960","Abdul-Azeez-bin-Muhammad ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum shadabi (ke zamaney) mein safar karo to zamin se oonton ko unka hissey do aur jab tum khushk saali mein safar karo to us (se mutaassira ilaaqey mein) se un (oonton ki taangon) ka goodaa bacha kar ley jao ( tez raftaarii se nikal jao taake zyada arsa bhookey reh kar wo kamzor na ho jayen) aur jab tum raat ke aakhiri hissey mein qiyam karo to guzargaah mein thaharney se ijtinab karo kyonke raat ke waqt wo jagah janwaron ki guzar gaah aur kidey-makaude ki aamaajgaah hoti hai."
"4961","Yahya-bin-Yahya tamimi ne kaha : maine Imam Malik se puchha : Sumai ne aapko Abu-Saleh ke waastey se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat bayan ki thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : safar azab ka aik tukda hai, wo tum mein se aik ( musaafir ( ko soney , khaney aur peeney se rok deta hai, jab tum mein se koi shakhs wo kaam sar anjam de chukey jo uske peshe-nazar tha to wo jald apne ghar aaey? unhon (Imam Malik ( ne kaha : haan."
"4962","Yazid-bin-Harun ne Hammam se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ishaq-bin-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ko apne ghar walon par dastak na detey they. aap (safar se ghar walon ke paas ( subah ko ya Sham ko tashrif latey they."
"4963","Abdus-Samad-bin-Abdul-Waris ne kaha : hamein Hammam ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Ishaq-in-Abdullah-bin-abi-Talha ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, albatta unhon-ne kaha : ( gharon mein) dakhil na hotey they."
"4964","Hushaim ne Sayyar se, unhon-ne ( Aamir ( Shabi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham aik ghazwey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, jab ham Madina pahunchey to ham gharon ke andar dakhil honey ke liye janey lagey to aap ne farmaya : ruk jao, yahan tak ke ham ( kuchh taakheer se) raat ke waqt , yani isha ke waqt jayen taake bikhrey baalon wali apne baal sanwaar ley aur shauhar ki ghair maujoodgi mein rehney wali apni safaaii kare."
"4965","Abdus-Samad ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Sayyar se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aamir (Shabi) se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi shakhs raat ke waqt ghar wapas aaey to raat ko (achanak) apne ghar mein dakhil na ho (balke itni der twaqquf karey) ke shauhar ki ghair haziri mein rehney wali apni safaai kar ley aur uljhey baalon wali baal sanwaar ley."
"4966","Rauh-bin-Ubada ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sayyar ne isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"4967","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Aasim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Shabi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : jab koi insan lamba waqt ghar se door raha ho to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey raat ko achcha ghar mein dakhil honey se mana farmaya."